eated. Wait for the request to finish.":"banana","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"banana","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"banana","Templates: {{reason}}":"banana","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"banana","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"banana","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"banana","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"banana","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"banana","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"banana","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"banana","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"banana","The path prefixes your policy allows":"banana","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"banana","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"banana","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"banana","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"banana",Theme:gDt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"banana","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"banana","This account ({{accountId}})":"banana","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"banana","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below