ain. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"banana","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"banana","Unable to load templates":"banana",Undo:fDt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"banana","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"banana",Update:yDt,"Update certificate signer":"banana",'Use "{{key}}"':"banana",'Use "{{value}}"':"banana","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"banana","Use cases":"banana","Use one from another account":"banana",'Use: "{{text}}"':"banana","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"banana",Validating:bDt,Value:wDt,"Value must be 256 characters or less.":"banana",Values:SDt,"View all":"banana","View all notifications":"banana","View JSON":"banana",Visual:_Dt,Warning:kDt,Warnings:xDt,'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':"banana","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"banana",Workload:EDt,"Workload identities":"banana","Workload identities ({{total}})":"banana","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"banana","Workload identity":"banana","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"banana","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"banana","Workload identity providers":"banana","Workload identity: {{name}}":"banana","Workloads get named automatically":"banana","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"banana","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"banana","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"banana","Wrap lines":"banana","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"banana","Yes by default":"banana","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"banana","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"banana","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"banana","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"banana","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"banana","You have more keys than can be displayed":"banana","You have more values than can be displayed":"banana","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"banana","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"banana","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"banana","You must choose a path segment":"banana","You must specify a condition key":"banana","You must specify a tag key":"banana","You must specify a unique tag key.":"banana","You must specify a value":"banana","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"banana","YYYY/MM/DD":"banana"},ADt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:gIt,Actions:uIt,Active:dIt,Add:pIt,Apply:hIt,Attestation:vIt,Cancel:fIt,Clear:yIt,Close:bIt,Condition:wIt,Configured:SIt,Confirm:_It,Contains:kIt,Created:xIt,Delete:EIt,Description:CIt,Details:AIt,Disable:TIt,Dismiss:IIt,Edit:DIt,Editing:LIt,Enable:PIt,Equals:NIt,Errors:RIt,Format:MIt,Inactive:OIt,Info:FIt,JWKS:BIt,Key:$It,Name:jIt,None:WIt,Notifications:UIt,Operator:qIt,Operators:VIt,Pa