to copy":"Fehler beim Kopieren von {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} Vorlage","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} Übereinstimmung","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} Übereinstimmungen","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} Tag entfernt","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} Tags wurden entfernt","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} Tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} Tags","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} Vorlage","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} Vorlagen","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 bis 48 Stunden, in ganzen Stunden. Die Veröffentlichung ist in der Regel viel schneller, kann aber bis zu 24 Stunden dauern.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Wählen Sie alle Kontrollkästchen aus, um zu bestätigen, was das Löschen von {{providerName}} bewirkt.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Bestätigen Sie, dass Sie diesen Anbieter löschen möchten, indem Sie unten {{providerName}} eingeben.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Eine Ablehnung, und zwar nur für delegierte Administratoren","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"Ein Anbieter ist der Aussteller und die Vertrauensgrenze für die ihm unterliegenden Workload-Identitäten. Ein einzelner Anbieter umfasst sowohl die Identitäten, die eine Vorlage generiert, als auch die Identitäten, die Sie manuell deklarieren.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"Ein Ressourcenbesitzer kann dem Namen Zugriff gewähren, bevor sein Workload online geht.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Ein Tag ist eine Beschriftung, die Sie einer AWS-Ressource zuweisen. Jedes Tag besteht aus einem Schlüssel und einem optionalen Wert. Verwenden Sie Tags, um diesen Anbieter zu durchsuchen und zu filtern oder Ihre AWS-Kosten zu verfolgen.","A template with this name already exists.":"Eine Vorlage mit diesem Namen ist bereits vorhanden.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Greifen Sie auf eine Partner-API, einen SaaS-Endpunkt oder einen OIDC-Dienst zu. Keine Einrichtung erforderlich.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Greifen Sie auf ein Service Mesh, eine Datenbank oder ein On-Premises-System zu.","Access denied":"Zugriff verweigert","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Der Zugriff, den Sie diesen Identitäten gewährt haben, funktioniert nicht mehr","Account scoped":"Auf das Konto beschränkt",Actions:TDt,"Activating it":"Es wird aktiviert",Active:IDt,Add:DDt,"Add {{label}} template":"Vorlage {{label}} hinzufügen","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Fügen Sie mindestens 1 Pfadsegment hinzu.","Add attestation rules":"Attestierungsregeln hinzufügen","Add condition":"Bedingung hinzufügen","Add new tag":"Neues Tag hinzufügen","Add path segment":"Pfadsegment hinzufügen","Add policy":"Richtlinie hinzufügen","Add tags":"Tags hinzufügen","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie diesem Anbieter Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie dieser Vorlage Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Fügen Sie dieser Workload-Identität Tags für Kostenmanagement und Zugriffskontrolle hinzu.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"Fügen Sie die Fakten hinzu, die dieser Workload-Typ bestätigt, und zwar in der Reihenfolge, in der sie im Namen erscheinen sollten.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Hinzugefügte oder geänderte Tags wurden nicht gespeichert","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Alle ausgehenden Unterzeichner unter diesem Anbieter werden gelöscht","All properties":"Alle Eigenschaften","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Alle Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten unter diesem Anbieter werden gelöscht",and:"und","Any value":"Beliebiger Wert",Apply:LDt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN kopiert","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Zur Laufzeit bestätigt die Plattform diese Fakten über den Workload. Jeder Workload, dessen Attestierung diese Fakten enthält, erhält eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage.",Attestation:PDt,"Attestation rules":"Attestierungsregeln","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Bescheinigungsregeln sind Fakten, die ein Workload nachweisen muss, bevor dieser Anbieter ihm eine Identität ausstellt. Die Rechenplattform bürgt für sie, sodass ein Workload keine Identität beanspruchen kann, die nicht seine eigene ist.","Attested by":"Attestiert von","Auto generated identity name":"Automatisch generierter Identitätsname","Automatically generate from a template":"Automatisch aus einer Vorlage generieren","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Verfügbar für jedes Konto in Ihrer Organisation ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Verfügbar für dieses Konto ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWS-Konto-ID","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA konnte diese Zertifizierungsstelle nicht einrichten. Löschen Sie sie in der AWS Private CA-Konsole und versuchen Sie es erneut.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA erstellt eine Zertifizierungsstelle für IAM und gibt eine ID dafür zurück.",Cancel:NDt,"Cannot start with aws:":"Man kann nicht mit aws starten:","Certificate authority":"Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate authority created":"Zertifizierungsstelle erstellt","Certificate authority ID":"ID der Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate authority name":"Name der Zertifizierungsstelle","Certificate deleted.":"Zertifikat gelöscht.","Certificate signer":"Unterzeichner des Zertifikats","Certificate signer disabled.":"Zertifikatssignierer deaktiviert.","Certificate signer enabled.":"Zertifikatssignierer aktiviert.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"Zertifikatsignierer aktualisiert. Die neue Zertifikatskette wird im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht, bevor sie zum Signieren verwendet wird.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Zertifikatssignierung aktiviert. Die Zertifikatskette wird zunächst im Vertrauenspaket veröffentlicht. Die Signierung beginnt nach etwa {{hours}} Stunde, sobald sie in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Das Signieren von Zertifikaten ist aktiviert. Die Zertifikatskette wird zuerst im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht, und das Signieren beginnt in etwa {{hours}} Stunden, sobald es in jeder Region verfügbar ist.","Certificate verifier information":"Informationen zum Zertifikatsprüfer","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Ändern Sie die Fakten, die ein Workload bestätigt haben muss, um eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage zu erhalten. Identitäten, die diese Vorlage bereits generiert hat, sind davon nicht betroffen.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Ändern Sie die Fakten, die eine Workload bestätigt haben muss, um als diese Identität ausgeführt zu werden. Eine Workload, die bereits eine Sitzung hält, behält diese, bis die Sitzung abläuft.","Check again":"Erneut prüfen","Choose a condition key":"Einen Bedingungsschlüssel auswählen","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Wählen Sie einen Pfad und ein Muster für die Namen. Beginnen Sie mit einer Standardeinstellung oder passen Sie Pfad und Muster nach Ihren Wünschen an.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"Wählen Sie einen bestimmten Namen für den Workload, damit Sie ihn Ihren eigenen Konventionen zuordnen können.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Wählen Sie vorab einen bestimmten Namen aus, damit Sie ihm Zugriff gewähren oder eine bestehende Namenskonvention einhalten können, bevor der Workload ausgeführt wird.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Wählen Sie oben einen Anwendungsfall aus, um eine Vorlage hinzuzufügen.","Choose from this account":"Wählen Sie aus diesem Konto","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Wählen Sie die Bedingungsschlüssel aus, die als Attestierungsfakten verwendet werden sollen. Die Plattform muss sie alle attestieren, bevor diese Vorlage eine Identität für einen Workload generiert.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Wählen Sie die Fakten aus, die ein Workload bestätigt haben muss, um eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage zu erhalten. Es wird nichts daraus generiert, bis Sie dies tun.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Wählen Sie die Merkmale aus, deren Vorliegen für eine Workload bestätigt sein muss, damit sie unter dieser Identität ausgeführt werden kann. Bis dahin kann nichts für sie ausgestellt werden.",Clear:RDt,"Clear filters":"Filter löschen",Close:MDt,"Close modal":"Modal schließen","Code editor":"Code Editor",Condition:zDt,"Condition key":"Bedingungsschlüssel","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Konfigurieren Sie Identitätsvorlagen für Ihre Workload-Anwendungsfälle. Jede Vorlage definiert ein Pfadmuster, das zur eindeutigen Ausstellung von Identitäten verwendet wird, sowie die Fakten, die ein Workload nachweisen muss, bevor eine Identität ausgestellt wird.",Configured:ODt,Confirm:FDt,Contains:BDt,"Continue setup":"Einrichtung fortsetzen","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} kopieren","Copy ARN":"ARN kopieren","Copy JSON":"JSON kopieren","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Erstellen Sie eine Vorlage, um die Identitätsgenerierung zu automatisieren","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"Erstellen Sie eine Identität, um Zugriff zu gewähren, bevor ein Workload ausgeführt wird","Create identity":"Identität erstellen","Create new":"Neu erstellen","Create provider":"Anbieter erstellen","Create template":"Vorlage erstellen","Create templates":"Vorlagen erstellen","Create the certificate authority first.":"Erstellen Sie zuerst die Zertifizierungsstelle.","Create workload identities":"Workload-Identitäten erstellen",Created:$Dt,"Created through":"Erstellt durch","Created time":"Zeitpunkt der Erstellung","Created values":"Erstellte Werte","Creating certificate authority":"Zertifizierungsstelle wird erstellt","Creating the certificate authority":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle wird erstellt","Current CA":"Aktuelle Zertifizierungsstelle","Current provider":"Derzeitiger Anbieter","Custom tag key":"Benutzerdefinierter Tag-Schlüssel","Custom tag value":"Benutzerdefinierter Tag-Wert","Dark themes":"Dunkle Designs","Default permissions without a policy":"Standardberechtigungen ohne Richtlinie","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"Definieren Sie, welcher Workload unter diesem Namen ausgeführt werden darf.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Definieren Sie, welche Workloads diese Vorlage verwenden dürfen.",Delete:jDt,"Delete certificate?":"Zertifikat löschen?","Delete provider":"Anbieter löschen","Delete provider?":"Anbieter löschen?","Delete template":"Vorlage löschen","Delete template?":"Vorlage löschen?","Delete workload identity?":"Workload-Identität löschen?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"Das Löschen von <b>{{templateName}}</b> bewirkt Folgendes:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"Das Löschen von <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> bewirkt Folgendes:",Description:WDt,Details:UDt,Disable:qDt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Zertifikatsignierer deaktivieren?","Discovery expiration time":"Ablaufzeit der Erkennung",Dismiss:VDt,"Does not contain":"Enthält nicht","Does not equal":"Ist nicht gleich","Drag or select to resize":"Ziehen oder auswählen, um die Größe zu ändern","Drag to reorder":"Zum Neuanordnen ziehen","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"Jeder Identitätsname enthält die Region und die Ressource, die ihn erzeugt hat, sodass zwei Konten nicht den gleichen Namen wiedergeben können.",Edit:HDt,"Edit attestation rules":"Attestierungsregeln bearbeiten","Edit filter":"Filter bearbeiten","Edit identity path and attestation":"Identitätspfad und Bescheinigung bearbeiten",Editing:GDt,Enable:KDt,"Enable certificate signer":"Zertifikatsignierer aktivieren","Enable certificate signer?":"Zertifikatsignierer aktivieren?","End signing time":"Ende der Signierzeit","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Geben Sie eine 12-stellige AWS-Konto-ID ein.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Geben Sie eine Zertifizierungsstellen-ID ein.","Enter a name":"Namen eingeben","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Geben Sie einen Namen für die Zertifizierungsstelle ein.","Enter a path prefix":"Ein Pfadpräfix eingeben","Enter a path prefix value":"Geben Sie einen Wert für das Pfadpräfix ein","Enter a value":"Einen Wert eingeben","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Geben Sie eine ganze Zahl von Stunden zwischen 1 und 48 ein.","Enter key":"Schlüssel eingeben","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Geben Sie die ID einer Zertifizierungsstelle ein oder wählen Sie eine der folgenden Optionen aus","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Geben Sie die Richtlinie als gültiges JSON ein.","Enter value":"Wert eingeben",Equals:YDt,Error:"Fehler","Error fetching the details":"Fehler beim Abrufen der Details",Errors:JDt,"Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"Jede veröffentlichte Zertifikatskette. Ein Verifier, der die X.509-SVIDs dieses Anbieters akzeptiert, ruft seine Roots von hier ab.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"Jede Vorlage und jede Workload-Identität unter {{providerName}} wird damit gelöscht, und ihre Identitätsnamen werden nie wieder ausgegeben. Workloads, die diese benötigen, erhalten keine Anmeldeinformationen mehr.","Failed to copy":"Fehler beim Kopieren","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON konnte nicht kopiert werden","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Die Attestierungsrichtlinie konnte nicht geladen werden.","Failed to load templates.":"Vorlagen konnten nicht geladen werden.","Filter identities":"Identitäten filtern","Filter providers":"Anbieter filtern","Filter templates":"Vorlagen filtern","Filter themes":"Designs filtern","Find identities":"Identitäten suchen","Find providers":"Anbieter finden","Find templates":"Vorlagen suchen","Find theme":"Thema suchen","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Fügen Sie für gegenseitiges TLS eine Zertifizierungsstelle hinzu","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Für Token-basierte Dienste geben Sie ein JWT aus",Format:ZDt,"Generating its key":"Generiert ihren Schlüssel","Get started":"Erste Schritte","Give your workloads an identity":"Geben Sie Ihren Workloads eine Identität","Govern who can create resources":"Legen Sie fest, wer Ressourcen erstellen kann","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Legen Sie fest, wer Vorlagen erstellen kann, die auf diesen Anbieter verweisen","Grant access up front":"Zugriff im Voraus gewähren","Greater than":"Größer als","Greater than or equal":"Größer als oder gleich",hours:QDt,"How identities are kept unique":"Wie Identitäten eindeutig bleiben",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identität „{{identityId}}“ wurde nicht gefunden.","Identity name":"Identitätsname","Identity name pattern":"Identitätsnamensmuster","Identity path and attestation":"Identitätspfad und Attestierung","Identity selection":"Identitätsauswahl","In transition":"Im Übergang",Inactive:XDt,"Incoming CA":"Eingehende Zertifizierungsstelle",Info:eLt,"Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"Infrastruktur-ID (Konto-ID) im Pfadmuster der Vorlage","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Ungültiger Schlüssel. Schlüssel dürfen nur Unicode-Buchstaben, Ziffern, Leerzeichen und Folgendes enthalten: _.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"Ungültige Anfrage","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Ungültiger Wert. Werte dürfen nur Unicode-Buchstaben, Ziffern, Leerzeichen und Folgendes enthalten: _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"Stellt die X.509-SVIDs aus, die die Workloads dieses Anbieters als Client-Zertifikate für Systeme außerhalb von AWS präsentieren. Dafür wird eine AWS Private CA-Zertifizierungsstelle benötigt, die mit IAM verknüpft ist.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Gibt X.509-SVIDs für mTLS-Peers aus, die ein Client-Zertifikat verifizieren.","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA-Zertifikat wird ausgestellt","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Er signiert nicht mehr. Seine Kette ist jedoch immer noch veröffentlicht, sodass Workloads darauf angewiesen sind, dass er die zuvor ausgegebenen Anmeldeinformationen überprüft. Wenn Sie ihn jetzt löschen, wird die Kette sofort entfernt und diese Anmeldeinformationen beginnen zu versagen. Wenn Sie ihn in Ruhe lassen, wird er von selbst inaktiv. Danach ändert das Löschen nichts mehr.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Das Element wurde von Position {{initialPosition}} zu Position {{finalPosition}} von {{total}} verschoben","JSON copied":"JSON kopiert",JWKS:tLt,"JWKS popover":"Jeder aktive Signaturschlüssel, ausgewählt nach kid. AWS veröffentlicht hier einen neuen Schlüssel, bevor das Signieren zu diesem wechselt.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Signaturalgorithmus","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Schlüsselalgorithmen","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Aktuelle Schlüsselsignierung seit","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS generiert die Schlüssel und rotiert sie nach seinem eigenen Zeitplan, wobei jeder neue Schlüssel im JWKS veröffentlicht wird, bevor mit der Signierung begonnen wird. Die Algorithmen bleiben während einer Rotation gleich, sodass ein Verifier, der das JWKS liest, keine Änderungen auf Ihrer Seite benötigt.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Signiert JWT-SVIDs für Systeme, die ein signiertes Token verifizieren.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC-Discovery","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Das Standard-Discovery-Dokument. Die meisten Verifizierer benötigen nur diese URL, weil sie die Schlüssel daraus finden.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC-Ausgeber","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Der iss-Anspruch jedes hier signierten JWT-SVID. Ein Verifizierer, der einen Ausgeber pinnt, pinnt diesen Wert.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informationen zum Token-Verifizierer","JWT Outbound signers status":"Standardmäßig von AWS bereitgestellt","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT-Signierer",Key:nLt,"Last updated time":"Zeit der letzten Aktualisierung","Learn more":"Weitere Informationen","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Mehr über das Löschen eines Anbieters erfahren (wird auf einer neuen Registerkarte geöffnet)","Less than":"Weniger als","Less than or equal":"Kleiner oder gleich","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Lassen Sie andere Konten oder Prinzipale in Ihrer Organisation Vorlagen und Identitäten unter diesem Anbieter innerhalb der von Ihnen ausgewählten Pfadpräfixe erstellen.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Ermöglichen Sie Workloads den Zugriff auf Nicht-AWS-Ressourcen","Light themes":"Helle Designs","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Zeile {{row}}, Spalte {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Zertifizierungsstellen werden geladen","Loading code editor":"Code Editor wird geladen","Loading tag keys":"Tag-Schlüssel laden","Loading tag values":"Tag-Werte werden geladen","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Tags, die dieser Ressource zugeordnet sind, werden geladen","Loading workload identities":"Workload-Identitäten werden geladen","Manage tags":"Tags verwalten","Manage the provider":"Den Anbieter verwalten","Manual creation":"Manuelle Erstellung","Manually create":"Manuell erstellen","Manually created identities":"Manuell erstellte Identitäten","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Passende Workloads erhalten in dem Moment, in dem sie gestartet werden, ihren eigenen Identitätsnamen – und zwar in jeder Größenordnung.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"Mitgliedskonten können unter diesem Anbieter nichts mehr erstellen oder verwenden","Minimum signing delay":"Minimale Signierverzögerung","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"Die Signierung wird auf eine andere Zertifizierungsstelle umgestellt. Deren Zertifikatskette wird zunächst im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht. Das aktuelle Zertifikat signiert weiter, bis die neue Zertifizierungsstelle die Signierung übernimmt.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Artikel wird an Position {{currentPosition}} von {{total}} verschoben",Name:aLt,"Name must be 256 characters or less.":"Der Name darf 256 Zeichen nicht überschreiten.","Name pattern":"Namensmuster","Name pattern values":"Namensmusterwerte","Name values":"Namenswerte","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Benennt Identitäten automatisch, wenn Workloads gestartet werden, sodass Sie sie nicht einzeln erstellen oder verwalten müssen.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"Namen, die Sie unter diesem Anbieter manuell erstellen. Ein Ressourcenbesitzer kann Zugriff auf einen Namen gewähren, bevor sein Workload ausgeführt wird.","naming prefix":"Benennungspräfix","Naming scheme":"Benennungsschema","Next month":"Nächster Monat","Next page":"Nächste Seite","Next step":"Nächster Schritt","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Es wurde keine Attestierungsrichtlinie festgelegt. Definieren Sie eine, damit eine Workload mit dieser Identität ausgeführt werden kann.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Standardmäßig Nein, aber es kann eine Richtlinie hinzugefügt werden","No certificate authorities in this account":"In diesem Konto gibt es keine Zertifizierungsstellen","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"Keine Bedingungen. Nichts kann als diese Identität ausgeführt werden, bis Sie mindestens 1 hinzufügen.","no domain":"Keine Domain","No match found":"Keine Übereinstimmung gefunden","No matches":"Keine Übereinstimmungen","No tags associated with the resource.":"Es sind keine Tags mit der Ressource verknüpft.","No templates added yet":"Es wurden noch keine Vorlagen hinzugefügt","No workload identity providers":"Keine Anbieter für Workload-Identitäten","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Kein Workload entspricht dieser Vorlage, daher werden keine Identitäten generiert.","No, and cannot be granted":"Nein, und kann nicht gewährt werden",None:iLt,"Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Nicht gespeichert: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Nicht festgelegt",Notifications:rLt,"Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Anbieter auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Vorlagen auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Nur das Verwaltungskonto oder ein delegierter Administrator kann Workload-Identitäten auf Organisationsebene löschen.","Open in AWS Private CA":"In AWS Private CA öffnen",Operator:oLt,Operators:sLt,optional:lLt,or:cLt,"Organization scoped":"Auf die Organisation beschränkt","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organisieren Sie den Anbieter und verfolgen Sie seine Kosten mit Tags.","Other accounts in your organization":"Andere Konten in Ihrer Organisation","Other condition keys":"Andere Bedingungsschlüssel","Outbound signers":"Ausgehende Signierer","Outbound signers page desc":"Ausgehende Unterzeichner signieren die Anmeldeinformationen, die die Workloads dieses Anbieters Systemen außerhalb von AWS präsentieren. Um AWS selbst zu erreichen, ist kein Unterzeichner erforderlich: Ein Workload verfügt dafür bereits über SigV4.","Outbound signers page title":"Ausgehende Signierer","Owning account":"Kontoinhaber","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Seite {{pageNumber}} von allen Seiten",path:uLt,Path:dLt,"path from templates":"Pfad aus Vorlagen","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Pfad ist der Teil eines Identitätsnamens pro Workload. Er wird zur Laufzeit anhand der Fakten ausgefüllt, die ein Workload belegt.","Path pattern":"Pfadmuster","Path prefix":"Pfadpräfix","Path segment {{index}}":"Pfadsegment {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Element an Position {{position}} von {{total}} aufgenommen","Policy details":"Richtliniendetails","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Richtlinie: Definieren Sie, wie ein Workload attestiert, um die Identität zu erhalten",Preferences:pLt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Drücken Sie die Leertaste oder die Eingabetaste, um das Ziehen zu aktivieren, verwenden Sie die Pfeiltasten zum Verschieben und drücken Sie anschließend die Leertaste oder die Eingabetaste, um zu bestätigen.",Preview:mLt,"Previous CA":"Vorherige Zertifizierungsstelle","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Frühere Zertifikate ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Vorheriger Monat","Previous page":"Vorherige Seite",Properties:hLt,Property:gLt,Provided:vLt,Provider:fLt,"Provider name":"Anbietername","Provider not found":"Anbieter nicht gefunden","Provider overview":"Anbieterüberblick","Provider selection":"Auswahl des Anbieters","Provider settings":"Anbietereinstellungen","Provider values":"Werte des Anbieters",Providers:yLt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"Veröffentlichung im Vertrauensspeicher. Die Signierung beginnt, sobald es in jeder Region verfügbar ist.","Quick create":"Schnellerstellung",Ready:bLt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Für die meisten Workloads empfohlen","Refresh certificate authorities":"Zertifizierungsstellen aktualisieren",Remove:wLt,"Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} entfernen","Remove condition":"Bedingung entfernen","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Filter {{filter}} entfernen","Remove governance policy?":"Verwaltungsrichtlinie entfernen?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Tag {{key}} entfernen","Removed tags were not saved":"Entfernte Tags wurden nicht gespeichert","Reordering canceled":"Neuanordnung abgebrochen","Resize handle":"Größenänderung der Leiste","Restricted by":"Eingeschränkt durch",Retry:SLt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Überprüfen Sie die Tags und speichern Sie sie erneut.",Save:_Lt,"Save changes":"Änderungen speichern",scheme:kLt,Scheme:xLt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Schema legt das Format fest, das dieser Anbieter zur Benennung von Identitäten verwendet.",Scope:ELt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"Der Umfang legt fest, welche Konten diesen Anbieter verwenden dürfen.","Scope values":"Geltungsbereichswerte","Search tags":"Tags suchen","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segment, das Identitäten unterteilt.","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} auswählen",Set:"Satz","Set a naming pattern":"Legen Sie ein Benennungsmuster fest","Set an attestation rule":"Legen Sie eine Attestierungsregel fest","Set by your provider.":"Von Ihrem Anbieter festgelegt.","Set the name":"Namen festlegen","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"Legen Sie das eindeutige Pfadmuster und die Bescheinigungsregeln fest, die jede von dieser Vorlage generierte Workload-Identität verwendet.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Richten Sie eine Möglichkeit ein, Workload-Identitäten auszustellen","Set up for your use cases":"Richten Sie es für Ihre Anwendungsfälle ein","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Die Einrichtung der Zertifizierungsstelle wurde unterbrochen. Sie können dort weitermachen, wo Sie aufgehört haben.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Einstellungen von Ihrem Anbieter {{providerName}}","Show fewer":"Weniger anzeigen","Show more":"Mehr anzeigen","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"Neue Zertifikate werden signiert und im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"Die Signierung wird sofort wieder aufgenommen, da dieses Zertifikat noch im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht ist.","Signing start time":"Signierungsstartzeit","Something went wrong":"Es ist ein Fehler aufgetreten.",Status:CLt,"Status bar":"Statusleiste","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Sicherstellen, dass der Zugriff, den Sie diesem Identitätsnamen gewährt haben, nicht mehr funktioniert","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Sicherstellen, dass der Zugriff, den Sie diesen Identitätsnamen gewährt haben, nicht mehr funktioniert","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Sicherstellen, dass passende Workloads keine Identität mehr erhalten, sodass sie bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehlschlagen","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Die Auflösung der generierten Identitäten verhindern","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Den Workload anhalten, der unter dieser Identität ausgeführt wird, sodass er bei der nächsten Anfrage fehlschlägt","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Das Signieren wurde eingestellt, und das Zertifikat ist nicht mehr im Vertrauensspeicher enthalten. Daher kann nichts mehr anhand dieses Zertifikats verifiziert werden. Es kann bedenkenlos gelöscht werden.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"Das Signieren wurde beendet und ist nicht mehr im Vertrauensspeicher enthalten.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"Das Signieren wurde eingestellt, das Zertifikat ist jedoch weiterhin im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht. Daher bleiben zuvor ausgestellte Zertifikate weiterhin verifizierbar.",Subject:ALt,Success:TLt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Tag-Schlüssel konnten nicht abgerufen werden","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Tag-Werte konnten nicht abgerufen werden",Tags:ILt,"Tags could not be loaded":"Tags konnten nicht geladen werden","Tags not saved":"Tags nicht gespeichert",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Vorlage „{{templateId}}“ wurde nicht gefunden.","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Vorlage {{templateName}} wurde gelöscht.","Template name":"Name der Vorlage","Template name values":"Werte für den Vorlagennamen","Template: {{name}}":"Vorlage: {{name}}",Templates:DLt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Vorlagen geben passenden Workloads automatisch ihren eigenen Identitätsnamen. Jede verwendet das Namenspräfix dieses Anbieters sowie einen Pfad und ein Muster.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Das Konto, dem die Zertifizierungsstelle gehört.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"Der Attester bürgt für den Workload, und er muss mit allen Bedingungen übereinstimmen, damit eine Identität aus dieser Vorlage ausgestellt werden kann.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"Der Attester bürgt für die Workload, und sie muss jede Bedingung erfüllen, um als diese Identität ausgeführt zu werden.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"Die Zertifizierungsstelle befindet sich noch im Aufbau.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"Die ID am Ende des ARN der Zertifizierungsstelle in AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Der Identitätsname ist das Benennungsschema des Anbieters, ein Pfadpräfix und ein Pfadmuster.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Die maximale Anzahl von Zeichen, die Sie in einem Tag-Schlüssel verwenden können, beträgt 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Die maximale Anzahl von Zeichen, die Sie in einem Tag-Wert verwenden können, beträgt 256.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Die Pfadpräfixe, die Ihre Richtlinie zulässt","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Die in dieser Richtlinie für <b>{{providerName}}</b> definierten Berechtigungen gelten nicht mehr.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Der frühestmögliche Zeitpunkt, zu dem dieses Zertifikat mit dem Signieren beginnen kann. Es wird zunächst im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht, damit alle Verifizierer es überprüfen können, bevor damit etwas signiert wird. Die Signierung kann später beginnen, aber niemals früher.",Theme:LLt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Beim Laden des Code Editors ist ein Fehler aufgetreten.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Dieses Konto ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"Diese Aktion löscht den Workload-Identitätsanbieter {{providerName}} und alles, was darunter konfiguriert ist.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"Diese Aktion löscht den Workload-Identitätsanbieter <b>{{providerName}}</b> und alles, was darunter konfiguriert ist.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und wenn Sie später einen Anbieter mit demselben Namen erstellen, wird nichts wiederhergestellt. Gehen Sie wie folgt vor, um fortzufahren.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Dieser Vorgang kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und der Pfad, den diese Vorlage reserviert hat, bleibt reserviert. Keine zukünftige Vorlage kann darunter Identitäten generieren.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Dieser Vorgang kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden, und dieser Name bleibt reserviert. Er wird nie wieder ausgestellt, daher können Sie diese Identität nicht unter demselben Namen neu erstellen.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"Diese Zertifizierungsstelle funktioniert nur in USA Ost (Nord-Virginia) us-east-1. Um sie in anderen Regionen zu verwenden, replizieren Sie sie in der AWS Private CA-Konsole.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Dieses Zertifikat ist gültig, daher wird die Überprüfung sofort beendet, wenn Sie es löschen.","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"Die Zertifikatskette dieses Zertifikats wird zunächst wieder im Vertrauensspeicher veröffentlicht. Die Signierung wird fortgesetzt, sobald sie in allen Regionen verfügbar ist.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Eine Bedingung mit dieser Schlüssel- und Operatorkombination ist bereits vorhanden","This management account and delegated administrators":"Dieses Verwaltungskonto und delegierte Administratoren","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Diese Organisation ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Dieser Anbieter stellt ab sofort keine X.509-SVIDs mehr aus. Workloads, die ein Clientzertifikat benötigen, schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl. Das nachstehende Zertifikat bleibt konfiguriert. Bereits ausgestellte Zertifikate bleiben etwa 12 Stunden lang verifizierbar. Mit „Aktivieren“ wird die Signierung fortgesetzt.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Dadurch wird das Zertifikat vom Anbieter entfernt und die zugehörige Kette wird sofort aus dem Vertrauenspaket entfernt. Die Zertifizierungsstelle selbst verbleibt unverändert in AWS Private CA.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Dadurch wird das Zertifikat vom Anbieter entfernt. Seine Kette hat das Vertrauenspaket bereits verlassen, sodass sich nichts, was heute verifiziert wird, ändert. Die Zertifizierungsstelle selbst verbleibt unverändert in AWS Private CA.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Dieses Tag wird beim Speichern der Änderungen entfernt","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Dies dauert in der Regel ein paar Minuten. Lassen Sie diese Seite geöffnet, bis es fertig ist.",Today:PLt,"Too many requests":"Zu viele Anfragen","Trust bundle endpoint":"Vertrauensspeicher-Endpunkt","trust domain":"Vertrauensdomain","Trust domain":"Vertrauensdomain","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Die Vertrauensdomain ist die Vertrauensbasis für das SPIFFE-Benennungsschema. Es ist ein logischer Name, der dem DNS-Benennungsstil folgt, z. B. prod.acme.com, der jedoch nicht mit einem echten DNS-Eintrag übereinstimmen muss.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Versuchen Sie es erneut. Wenn das Problem weiterhin besteht, wenden Sie sich an den AWS Support.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Zwei Konten dürfen nicht in der Lage sein, den gleichen Identitätsnamen wiederzugeben.","Unable to load templates":"Vorlagen können nicht geladen werden",Undo:NLt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"Eindeutiges Präfix für verschiedene Pfade",Update:RLt,"Update certificate signer":"Unterzeichner des Zertifikats aktualisieren",'Use "{{key}}"':"„{{key}}“ verwenden",'Use "{{value}}"':"„{{value}}“ verwenden","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"Verwenden Sie ein Pfadpräfix, das Ihre Organisation erkennt, z. B. einen Geschäftsbereich oder ein Team. Es muss in Ihrer gesamten Organisation eindeutig sein. Sie können eine Richtlinie verfassen, die festlegt, welche Konten Identitäten unter diesem Präfix ausstellen dürfen.","Use cases":"Anwendungsfälle","Use one from another account":"Verwenden Sie eines von einem anderen Konto",'Use: "{{text}}"':"„{{text}}“ verwenden","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Wird als allgemeiner Name im Betreff der Zertifizierungsstelle verwendet.",Validating:MLt,Value:zLt,Values:OLt,"View all":"Alles anzeigen","View all notifications":"Alle Benachrichtigungen anzeigen","View JSON":"JSON anzeigen",Visual:FLt,Warning:BLt,Warnings:$Lt,"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Ohne eine Richtlinie kann kein anderes Konto Vorlagen unter diesem Anbieter erstellen, obwohl delegierte Administratoren bereits Vorlagen und Workload-Identitäten erstellen können. Fügen Sie für jedes Konto, jede Organisationseinheit oder jeden IAM-Prinzipal, der das können sollte, eine Anweisung hinzu, und beschränken Sie jede Anweisung auf ein Pfadpräfix.",Workload:jLt,"Workload identities":"Workload-Identitäten","Workload identity":"Workload-Identität","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Die Workload-Identität {{workloadIdentifier}} wurde gelöscht.","Workload identity providers":"Anbieter für Workload-Identitäten","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Workload-Identität: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"Workloads werden automatisch benannt","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads, die in diesem Konto ausgeführt werden, können Identitäten verwenden, die von dieser Vorlage anhand von Informationen, die von {{workloadLabel}} verifiziert wurden, generiert wurden.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads, die in Ihrer Organisation ausgeführt werden, können Identitäten verwenden, die von dieser Vorlage anhand von Informationen, die von {{workloadLabel}} verifiziert wurden, generiert wurden.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Workloads, die diese Identitäten verwenden, erhalten keine Anmeldeinformationen mehr und schlagen bei ihrer nächsten Anfrage fehl","Wrap lines":"Zeilen umbrechen","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Schreiben Sie eine Richtlinie, die es einem anderen Konto ermöglicht, Vorlagen zu erstellen, oder um einen delegierten Administrator daran zu hindern, einen Teil des Namespaces zu nutzen. Jede Anweisung benennt eine Organisationseinheit, bestimmte Konten oder einzelne IAM-Prinzipale, erlaubt oder verweigert und kann auf ein Pfadpräfix beschränkt werden.","Yes by default":"Standardmäßig Ja","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Sie können bis zu {{availableTags}} weiteres Tag hinzufügen.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Sie können bis zu {{availableTags}} weitere Tags hinzufügen.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"Sie wählen ein Präfix pro Anwendungsfall, und der Name trägt dieses stattdessen. Die Namen sind kürzer und das Präfix muss in Ihrer gesamten Organisation eindeutig sein.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tag ist überschritten.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Sie haben das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tags überschritten.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Sie haben mehr Schlüssel, als angezeigt werden können","You have more values than can be displayed":"Sie haben mehr Werte, als angezeigt werden können","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tag ist erreicht.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Sie haben das Limit von {{tagLimit}} Tags erreicht.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Sie haben ungespeicherte Tag-Änderungen. Diese Seite verlassen und die Änderungen verwerfen?","You must choose a path segment":"Sie müssen ein Pfadsegment auswählen","You must specify a condition key":"Sie müssen einen Bedingungsschlüssel angeben","You must specify a tag key":"Sie müssen einen Tag-Schlüssel angeben","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Sie müssen einen eindeutigen Tag-Schlüssel angeben.","You must specify a value":"Sie müssen einen Wert angeben","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Ihr Administrator entscheidet, welche Präfixe dieses Konto verwenden kann. Dies wird bei der Erstellung überprüft.","YYYY/MM/DD":"JJJJ/MM/TT","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},ULt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:TDt,Active:IDt,Add:DDt,Apply:LDt,Attestation:PDt,Cancel:NDt,Clear:RDt,Close:MDt,Condition:zDt,Configured:ODt,Confirm:FDt,Contains:BDt,Created:$Dt,Delete:jDt,Description:WDt,Details:UDt,Disable:qDt,Dismiss:VDt,Edit:HDt,Editing:GDt,Enable:KDt,Equals:YDt,Errors:JDt,Format:ZDt,Inactive:XDt,Info:eLt,JWKS:tLt,Key:nLt,Name:aLt,None:iLt,Notifications:rLt,Operator:oLt,Operators:sLt,Path:dLt,Preferences:pLt,Preview:mLt,Properties:hLt,Property:gLt,Provided:vLt,Provider:fLt,Providers:yLt,Ready:bLt,Remove:wLt,Retry:SLt,Save:_Lt,Scheme:xLt,Scope:ELt,Status:CLt,Subject:ALt,Success:TLt,Tags:ILt,Templates:DLt,Theme:LLt,Today:PLt,Undo:NLt,Update:RLt,Validating:MLt,Value:zLt,Values:OLt,Visual:FLt,Warning:BLt,Warnings:$Lt,Workload:jLt,and:"und",default:WLt,hours:QDt,optional:lLt,or:cLt,path:uLt,scheme:kLt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),qLt="Acciones",VLt="Activo",HLt="Agregar",GLt="Aplicar",KLt="Verificación",YLt="Cancelar",JLt="Borrar",ZLt="Cerrar",QLt="Condición",XLt="Configurado",ePt="Confirmar",tPt="Contiene",nPt="Creado",aPt="Eliminar",iPt="Descripción",rPt="Detalles",oPt="Desactivar",sPt="Descartar",lPt="Editar",cPt="Editando",uPt="Habilitar",dPt="Igual a",pPt="Errores",mPt="Formato",hPt="horas",gPt="Inactivo",vPt="Información",fPt="JWKS",yPt="Clave",bPt="Nombre",wPt="Sin esquema",SPt="Notificaciones",_Pt="Operador",kPt="Operadores",xPt="opcional",EPt="Ruta",CPt="Ruta",APt="Preferencias",TPt="Vista previa",IPt="Propiedades",DPt="Propiedad",LPt="Proporcionado",PPt="Proveedor",NPt="Proveedores",RPt="Listo",MPt="Eliminar",zPt="Reintentar",OPt="Guardar",FPt="Esquema",BPt="Esquema",$Pt="Alcance",jPt="Estado",WPt="Asunto",UPt="Éxito",qPt="Etiquetas",VPt="Plantillas",HPt="Tema",GPt="Deshacer",KPt="Actualizar",YPt="Validando",JPt="Valor",ZPt="Valores",QPt="Visual",XPt="Advertencia",eNt="Advertencias",tNt="Carga de trabajo",nNt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}” no existe en su cuenta","(earliest)":"(más temprano)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"Se agregó o se cambió {{addedCount}} etiqueta","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"Se agregaron o se cambiaron {{addedCount}} etiquetas","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identidades","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identidad","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copiado","{{label}} failed to copy":"No se pudo copiar {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} plantilla","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} coincidencia","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} coincidencias","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"Se eliminó {{removedCount}} etiqueta","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"Se eliminaron {{removedCount}} etiquetas","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} etiqueta","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} etiquetas","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} plantilla","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} plantillas","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"De 1 a 48 horas, sin decimales. La publicación suele tardar mucho menos, pero puede demorar hasta 24 horas.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Seleccione todas las casillas de verificación para confirmar lo que hará la eliminación de {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Confirme que desea eliminar este proveedor escribiendo {{providerName}} a continuación.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Una denegación, y solo para administradores delegados","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"Un proveedor es el emisor y el límite de confianza para las identidades de carga de trabajo que contiene. Un único proveedor contiene tanto las identidades que genera una plantilla como las que se declaran manualmente.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"El propietario de un recurso puede concederle acceso al nombre antes de que su carga de trabajo esté en línea.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Una etiqueta es una marca que se asigna a un recurso de AWS. Cada etiqueta consta de una clave y un valor opcional. Puede usar etiquetas para buscar y filtrar este proveedor o hacer un seguimiento de los costes de AWS.","A template with this name already exists.":"Ya existe una plantilla con este nombre.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Acceda a una API de un socio, a un punto de conexión de SaaS o a un servicio de OIDC. No se requiere configuración.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Acceda a una malla de servicios, una base de datos o un sistema en las instalaciones.","Access denied":"Acceso denegado","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"El acceso que haya otorgado a estas identidades dejará de funcionar","Account scoped":"Con alcance de cuenta",Actions:qLt,"Activating it":"Activándola",Active:VLt,Add:HLt,"Add {{label}} template":"Agregar plantilla {{label}}","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Agregue al menos un segmento de ruta.","Add attestation rules":"Agregar reglas de atestación","Add condition":"Agregar condición","Add new tag":"Agregar nueva etiqueta","Add path segment":"Agregar segmento de ruta","Add policy":"Agregar política","Add tags":"Agregar etiquetas","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a este proveedor para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a esta plantilla para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Agregue etiquetas a esta identidad de carga de trabajo para administrar los costos y controlar el acceso.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"Agregue los hechos que verifica este tipo de carga de trabajo, en el orden en que deben aparecer en el nombre.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Las etiquetas agregadas o modificadas no se guardaron","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Se eliminarán todos los firmantes salientes de este proveedor","All properties":"Todas las propiedades","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Se eliminarán todas las plantillas e identidades de carga de trabajo de este proveedor",and:"y","Any value":"Cualquier valor",Apply:GLt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copiado","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Durante el tiempo de ejecución, la plataforma atestigua estos hechos sobre la carga de trabajo. Cualquier carga de trabajo cuya atestación contenga estos hechos emite una identidad a partir de esta plantilla.",Attestation:KLt,"Attestation rules":"Reglas de atestación","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Las reglas de atestación son los datos que una carga de trabajo debe probar antes de que este proveedor le emita una identidad. La plataforma informática las avala, por lo que una carga de trabajo no puede reclamar una identidad que no sea la suya.","Attested by":"Verificado por","Auto generated identity name":"Nombre de identidad generado automáticamente","Automatically generate from a template":"Genere automáticamente a partir de una plantilla","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponible para todas las cuentas de tu organización ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponible para esta cuenta ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID de cuenta de AWS","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA no pudo configurar esta autoridad de certificación. Elimínela de la consola de AWS Private CA e inténtelo de nuevo.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA crea una autoridad de certificación para IAM y devuelve su ID.",Cancel:YLt,"Cannot start with aws:":"No puede comenzar con aws:","Certificate authority":"Autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority created":"Se creó la autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority ID":"ID de autoridad de certificación","Certificate authority name":"Nombre de la autoridad de certificación","Certificate deleted.":"Se eliminó el certificado.","Certificate signer":"Firmante de certificados","Certificate signer disabled.":"Se desactivó el firmante de certificados.","Certificate signer enabled.":"Se habilitó el firmante de certificados.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"Se actualizó el firmante de certificados. La nueva cadena de certificados se publica en el paquete de confianza antes de que el nuevo firmante comience a firmar.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Se habilitó la firma de certificados. Primero se publica la cadena de certificados en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} hora, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Se habilitó la firma de certificados. La cadena de certificados se publica primero en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza en aproximadamente {{hours}} horas, una vez que la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","Certificate verifier information":"Información del verificador de certificados","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Cambie los hechos que deben constar en la atestación de una carga de trabajo para que se le asigne una identidad a partir de esta plantilla. Las identidades que esta plantilla ya ha generado no se verán afectadas.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Cambie los datos que una carga de trabajo debe haber certificado para ejecutarse con esta identidad. Una carga de trabajo que ya tenga una sesión la conservará hasta que la sesión caduque.","Check again":"Comprobar de nuevo","Choose a condition key":"Elija una clave de condición","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Elija una ruta y un patrón para los nombres. Empiece con un valor predeterminado o personalice el suyo propio.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"Elija un nombre específico para la carga de trabajo de modo que pueda asignarla a sus propias convenciones.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Elija un nombre específico de antemano para poder concederle acceso o ajustarlo a una convención de nomenclatura existente antes de que se ejecute la carga de trabajo.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Elige uno de los casos de uso anteriores para agregar una plantilla.","Choose from this account":"Seleccionar una CA de esta cuenta","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Elija las claves de condición que se utilizarán como hechos de atestación. La plataforma debe atestiguar todos estos hechos antes de que esta plantilla emita una identidad para una carga de trabajo.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Elija los hechos que deben constar en la atestación de una carga de trabajo para que se le asigne una identidad a partir de esta plantilla. No se generará nada a partir de ella hasta que lo haga.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Elija los hechos que deben constar en la certificación de una carga de trabajo para que se ejecute como esta identidad. No se podrá emitir nada para ella hasta que lo haga.",Clear:JLt,"Clear filters":"Quitar filtros",Close:ZLt,"Close modal":"Cerrar modal","Code editor":"Editor de código",Condition:QLt,"Condition key":"Clave de condición","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configure plantillas de identidad para sus casos de uso de carga de trabajo. Cada plantilla define un patrón de rutas que se utiliza para emitir identidades de forma exclusiva y los datos que una carga de trabajo debe demostrar antes de emitir una identidad.",Configured:XLt,Confirm:ePt,Contains:tPt,"Continue setup":"Continuar con la configuración","Copy {{label}}":"Copiar {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copiar ARN","Copy JSON":"Copiar JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Cree una plantilla para automatizar la generación de identidades","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"Cree una identidad para conceder el acceso antes de que se ejecute una carga de trabajo","Create identity":"Crear una identidad","Create new":"Crear nuevo","Create provider":"Crear proveedor","Create template":"Crear plantilla","Create templates":"Crear plantillas","Create the certificate authority first.":"Cree primero la autoridad de certificación.","Create workload identities":"Crear identidades de carga de trabajo",Created:nPt,"Created through":"Creado a través de","Created time":"Hora de creación","Created values":"Valores creados","Creating certificate authority":"Creando la autoridad de certificación","Creating the certificate authority":"Creando la autoridad de certificación","Current CA":"CA actual","Current provider":"Proveedor actual","Custom tag key":"Clave de etiqueta personalizada","Custom tag value":"Valor de etiqueta personalizado","Dark themes":"Temas oscuros","Default permissions without a policy":"Permisos predeterminados sin una política","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"Defina qué carga de trabajo puede ejecutarse con este nombre.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Defina qué cargas de trabajo pueden usar esta plantilla.",Delete:aPt,"Delete certificate?":"¿Desea eliminar el certificado?","Delete provider":"Eliminar proveedor","Delete provider?":"¿Eliminar proveedor?","Delete template":"Eliminar plantilla","Delete template?":"¿Desea eliminar la plantilla?","Delete workload identity?":"¿Desea eliminar la identidad de carga de trabajo?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"La eliminación de <b>{{templateName}}</b> tendrá las siguientes consecuencias:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"La eliminación de <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> tendrá las siguientes consecuencias:",Description:iPt,Details:rPt,Disable:oPt,"Disable certificate signer?":"¿Desea desactivar el firmante de certificados?","Discovery expiration time":"Fecha y hora de vencimiento del descubrimiento",Dismiss:sPt,"Does not contain":"No contiene","Does not equal":"No es igual a","Drag or select to resize":"Arrastre o seleccione para cambiar el tamaño","Drag to reorder":"Arrastre para cambiar el orden","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"Cada nombre de identidad contiene la región y el recurso que lo generó, por lo que dos cuentas no pueden representar el mismo nombre.",Edit:lPt,"Edit attestation rules":"Editar reglas de atestación","Edit filter":"Editar filtro","Edit identity path and attestation":"Editar ruta de identidad y reglas de atestación",Editing:cPt,Enable:uPt,"Enable certificate signer":"Habilitar el firmante de certificados","Enable certificate signer?":"¿Desea habilitar el firmante de certificados?","End signing time":"Fecha y hora de finalización de la firma","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Ingrese un ID de cuenta de AWS de 12 dígitos.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Ingrese el ID de una autoridad de certificación.","Enter a name":"Introduzca un nombre","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Ingrese un nombre para la autoridad de certificación.","Enter a path prefix":"Introduzca un prefijo de ruta","Enter a path prefix value":"Introduzca un valor de prefijo de ruta","Enter a value":"Ingrese un valor","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Ingrese un número entero de horas entre 1 y 48.","Enter key":"Ingresar clave","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Ingrese el ID de una autoridad de certificación o seleccione una de las siguientes opciones","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Ingrese la política como un JSON válido.","Enter value":"Ingresar valor",Equals:dPt,Error:"Error","Error fetching the details":"Se produjo un error al obtener los detalles",Errors:pPt,"Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"Todas las cadenas de certificados publicadas. Un verificador que acepte los X.509-SVID de este proveedor obtiene aquí los certificados raíz.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"Con ella se eliminan todas las plantillas e identidades de carga de trabajo bajo {{providerName}}, y sus nombres de identidad nunca se vuelven a emitir. Las cargas de trabajo que dependen de ellas dejan de recibir credenciales.","Failed to copy":"No se pudo copiar","Failed to copy JSON":"No se pudo copiar JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"No se pudo cargar la política de atestación.","Failed to load templates.":"No se pudieron cargar las plantillas.","Filter identities":"Filtrar identidades","Filter providers":"Filtrar proveedores","Filter templates":"Filtrar plantillas","Filter themes":"Filtrar temas","Find identities":"Buscar identidades","Find providers":"Buscar proveedores","Find templates":"Buscar plantillas","Find theme":"Buscar tema","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Para TLS mutuo, asocie una autoridad de certificación","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Para los servicios basados en tokens, emita un JWT",Format:mPt,"Generating its key":"Generando su clave","Get started":"Comenzar","Give your workloads an identity":"Otorgue una identidad a las cargas de trabajo","Govern who can create resources":"Controle quién puede crear recursos","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Determine quién puede crear plantillas que hagan referencia a este proveedor","Grant access up front":"Conceda acceso por adelantado","Greater than":"Mayor que","Greater than or equal":"Mayor o igual",hours:hPt,"How identities are kept unique":"Cómo se mantienen únicas las identidades",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"No se encontró la identidad “{{identityId}}”.","Identity name":"Nombre de identidad","Identity name pattern":"Patrón de nombre de identidad","Identity path and attestation":"Ruta de identidad y atestación","Identity selection":"Selección de identidad","In transition":"En transición",Inactive:gPt,"Incoming CA":"CA entrante",Info:vPt,"Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"ID de infraestructura (ID de cuenta) en el patrón de rutas de la plantilla","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Clave no válida. Las claves solo pueden contener letras Unicode, dígitos, espacios en blanco y cualquiera de los siguientes elementos: _.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"Solicitud no válida","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"El valor no es válido. Los valores solo pueden contener letras Unicode, dígitos, espacios en blanco y cualquiera de los siguientes elementos: _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"Emite los X.509-SVID que las cargas de trabajo de este proveedor presentan como certificados de cliente ante sistemas externos a AWS. Requiere una autoridad de certificación de AWS Private CA asociada con IAM.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Emite X.509-SVID para su uso con pares de mTLS que verifican certificados de cliente.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Emitiendo su certificado CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Ya ha dejado de firmar, pero su cadena sigue publicada, por lo que las cargas de trabajo dependen de esta para verificar las credenciales emitidas anteriormente. Si se elimina ahora, la cadena se retirará de inmediato y esas credenciales dejarán de funcionar. Si no se elimina, quedará inactivo por sí solo y, a partir de ese momento, eliminarlo no tendrá ningún efecto.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Se movió el elemento de la posición {{initialPosition}} a la posición {{finalPosition}} de {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copiado",JWKS:fPt,"JWKS popover":"Cada clave de firma activa, seleccionada por kid. AWS publica aquí una nueva clave antes de empezar a usarla para firmar.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo de firma","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritmos de clave","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Clave actual utilizada para firmar desde","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS genera las claves y las rota según su propia programación. Publica cada clave nueva en el JWKS antes de empezar a usarla para firmar. Los algoritmos no cambian durante la rotación, por lo que no es necesario realizar ningún cambio en el verificador que lee el JWKS.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Firma JWT-SVID para sistemas que verifican tokens firmados.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Detección de OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"El documento de detección estándar. La mayoría de los verificadores solo necesitan esta URL, ya que encuentran las claves en ella.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Emisor de OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"La afirmación iss de cada JWT-SVID firmado aquí. Si un verificador fija un emisor, fija este valor.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Información del verificador de tokens","JWT Outbound signers status":"Proporcionada por AWS de forma predeterminada","JWT Outbound signers title":"Firmante de JWT",Key:yPt,"Last updated time":"Hora de la última actualización","Learn more":"Más información","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Más información sobre cómo eliminar un proveedor (se abre en una pestaña nueva)","Less than":"Menor que","Less than or equal":"Menor o igual","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Permita que otras cuentas o entidades principales de la organización creen plantillas e identidades asociadas a este proveedor dentro de los prefijos de ruta que elija.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Permita que las cargas de trabajo accedan a recursos que no son de AWS","Light themes":"Temas claros","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Cargando las autoridades de certificación","Loading code editor":"Cargando el editor de código","Loading tag keys":"Cargando claves de etiqueta","Loading tag values":"Cargando valores de etiqueta","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Cargando etiquetas asociadas a este recurso","Loading workload identities":"Cargando identidades de carga de trabajo","Manage tags":"Administrar etiquetas","Manage the provider":"Administrar el proveedor","Manual creation":"Creación manual","Manually create":"Cree manualmente","Manually created identities":"Identidades creadas manualmente","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Las cargas de trabajo coincidentes reciben su propio nombre de identidad en el momento en que comienzan, a cualquier escala.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"Las cuentas de miembro ya no pueden crear ni usar nada bajo este proveedor","Minimum signing delay":"Tiempo mínimo de espera para iniciar la firma","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"Transfiere la firma a otra autoridad de certificación. La cadena de la nueva autoridad se publica primero en el paquete de confianza. La firma continúa con el certificado actual hasta que la nueva autoridad comienza a firmar.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Se mueve el elemento a la posición {{currentPosition}} de {{total}}",Name:bPt,"Name must be 256 characters or less.":"El nombre debe tener 256 caracteres o menos.","Name pattern":"Patrón de nombres","Name pattern values":"Valores de patrones de nombres","Name values":"Valores de nombres","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Las identidades reciben un nombre automáticamente cuando se inician las cargas de trabajo, por lo que no es necesario crearlas ni administrarlas una por una.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"Nombres que usted crea manualmente con este proveedor. El propietario de un recurso puede conceder acceso a un nombre antes de que se ejecute su carga de trabajo.","naming prefix":"prefijo de nomenclatura","Naming scheme":"Esquema de nomenclatura","Next month":"Siguiente mes","Next page":"Página siguiente","Next step":"Próximo paso","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"No se estableció ninguna política de certificación. Defina una para que la carga de trabajo pueda ejecutarse como esta identidad.","No by default, but can add a policy":"No de forma predeterminada, pero puede agregar una política","No certificate authorities in this account":"No hay autoridades de certificación en esta cuenta","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"No hay condiciones. No se puede ejecutar nada con esta identidad hasta que agregue al menos una.","no domain":"no hay dominios","No match found":"No se encontró ninguna coincidencia","No matches":"No hay coincidencias","No tags associated with the resource.":"No hay etiquetas asociadas al recurso.","No templates added yet":"Aún no se han agregado plantillas","No workload identity providers":"Sin proveedores de identidad de cargas de trabajo","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Ninguna carga de trabajo coincide con esta plantilla, por lo que no genera identidades.","No, and cannot be granted":"No, y no se puede conceder",None:wPt,"Not saved: {{keys}}.":"No guardadas: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Sin establecer",Notifications:SPt,"Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar los proveedores a nivel de organización.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar las plantillas a nivel de organización.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Solo la cuenta de administración o un administrador delegado pueden eliminar las identidades de carga de trabajo a nivel de organización.","Open in AWS Private CA":"Abrir en AWS Private CA",Operator:_Pt,Operators:kPt,optional:xPt,or:"o","Organization scoped":"Con alcance de organización","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organice el proveedor y haga un seguimiento de su costo mediante etiquetas.","Other accounts in your organization":"Otras cuentas en su organización","Other condition keys":"Otras claves de condición","Outbound signers":"Firmantes salientes","Outbound signers page desc":"Los firmantes de salida firman las credenciales que las cargas de trabajo de este proveedor presentan a sistemas externos a AWS. Para acceder a AWS no se necesita ningún firmante: la carga de trabajo ya dispone de SigV4 para esto.","Outbound signers page title":"Firmantes salientes","Owning account":"Cuenta propietaria","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Página {{pageNumber}} de todas las páginas",path:EPt,Path:CPt,"path from templates":"ruta desde plantillas","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"La ruta es la parte de un nombre de identidad correspondiente a cada carga de trabajo. Se rellena en tiempo de ejecución a partir de los datos que demuestra una carga de trabajo.","Path pattern":"Patrón de ruta","Path prefix":"Prefijo de ruta","Path segment {{index}}":"Segmento de ruta {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Se recogió el elemento en la posición {{position}} de {{total}}","Policy details":"Detalles de la política","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Política: defina cómo debe atestiguar una carga de trabajo para obtener la identidad",Preferences:APt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Presione la barra espaciadora o Intro para activar el arrastre, use las teclas de flecha para mover el elemento y, a continuación, presione la barra espaciadora o Intro para confirmar",Preview:TPt,"Previous CA":"CA anterior","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificados anteriores ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mes anterior","Previous page":"Página anterior",Properties:IPt,Property:DPt,Provided:LPt,Provider:PPt,"Provider name":"Nombre del proveedor","Provider not found":"No se encontró el proveedor","Provider overview":"Descripción general del proveedor","Provider selection":"Selección de proveedores","Provider settings":"Configuración del proveedor","Provider values":"Valores de proveedores",Providers:NPt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"Publicando en el paquete de confianza. La firma comienza cuando la cadena de certificados está disponible en todas las regiones.","Quick create":"Creación rápida",Ready:RPt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Recomendado para la mayoría de las cargas de trabajo","Refresh certificate authorities":"Volver a cargar las autoridades de certificación",Remove:MPt,"Remove {{name}}":"Eliminar {{name}}","Remove condition":"Eliminar condición","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Eliminar filtro {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"¿Eliminar la política de gobierno?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Eliminar etiqueta {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Las etiquetas eliminadas no se guardaron","Reordering canceled":"Se canceló la reordenación","Resize handle":"Control de redimensionamiento","Restricted by":"Restringido por",Retry:zPt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Revise las etiquetas y vuelva a guardarlas.",Save:OPt,"Save changes":"Guardar cambios",scheme:FPt,Scheme:BPt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"El esquema establece el formato que usa este proveedor para nombrar las identidades.",Scope:$Pt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"El alcance establece qué cuentas pueden usar este proveedor.","Scope values":"Valores de alcance","Search tags":"Buscar etiquetas","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmento que divide las identidades.","Select {{name}}":"Seleccionar {{name}}",Set:"Conjunto","Set a naming pattern":"Establecer un patrón de nomenclatura","Set an attestation rule":"Establezca una regla de atestación","Set by your provider.":"Establecido por el proveedor.","Set the name":"Establezca el nombre","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"Establezca el patrón de rutas y las reglas de atestación únicos que utilizan todas las identidades de carga de trabajo generadas por esta plantilla.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configure una forma de emitir identidades de carga de trabajo","Set up for your use cases":"Configure según sus casos de uso","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Se detuvo la configuración de la autoridad de certificación. Puede continuar desde donde se interrumpió.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Configuración de su proveedor {{providerName}}","Show fewer":"Mostrar menos","Show more":"Mostrar más","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"Firma certificados nuevos y se publica en el paquete de confianza.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La firma se reanuda de inmediato porque este certificado sigue publicado en el paquete de confianza.","Signing start time":"Fecha y hora de inicio de la firma","Something went wrong":"Se produjo un problema",Status:jPt,"Status bar":"Barra de estado","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Impedir que siga funcionando el acceso concedido a este nombre de identidad","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Impedir que siga funcionando el acceso concedido a esos nombres de identidad","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Impedir que las cargas de trabajo que cumplan los criterios obtengan una identidad, de modo que fallen cuando realicen su próxima solicitud","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Impedir que se resuelvan las identidades que generó","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Impedir que la carga de trabajo siga ejecutándose con esta identidad, de modo que falle cuando realice su próxima solicitud","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Ya no firman ni forman parte del paquete de confianza, por lo que ya no se utilizan para verificar certificados. Es seguro eliminar cualquiera de estos firmantes.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"Ya no firma ni forma parte del paquete de confianza.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"Ya no firma, pero todavía se publica en el paquete de confianza, por lo que los certificados emitidos anteriormente aún se pueden verificar.",Subject:WPt,Success:UPt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"No se pudieron recuperar las claves de etiqueta","Tag values could not be retrieved":"No se pudieron recuperar los valores de etiqueta",Tags:qPt,"Tags could not be loaded":"No se pudieron cargar las etiquetas","Tags not saved":"Las etiquetas no se guardaron",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"No se encontró la plantilla “{{templateId}}”.","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Se eliminó la plantilla {{templateName}}.","Template name":"Nombre de la plantilla","Template name values":"Valores de nombres de plantillas","Template: {{name}}":"Plantilla: {{name}}",Templates:VPt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Las plantillas asignan automáticamente su propio nombre de identidad a las cargas de trabajo coincidentes. Cada una usa el prefijo del nombre de este proveedor, además de una ruta y un patrón.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"La cuenta propietaria de la autoridad de certificación.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"El verificador avala la carga de trabajo, que debe cumplir todas las condiciones para que se le emita una identidad a partir de esta plantilla.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"El certificador avala la carga de trabajo, que debe cumplir todas las condiciones para que se ejecute como esta identidad.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"La autoridad de certificación aún se está configurando.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"El ID que aparece al final del ARN de la autoridad de certificación en AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"El nombre de la identidad consta del esquema de nomenclatura del proveedor, un prefijo de ruta y un patrón de ruta.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"El número máximo de caracteres que puede utilizar en una clave de etiqueta es 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"El número máximo de caracteres que puede utilizar en un valor de etiqueta es 256.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Los prefijos de ruta que permite su política","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Los permisos definidos en esta política para <b>{{providerName}}</b> dejan de aplicarse.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"El momento más temprano en que se puede empezar a firmar con este certificado. El certificado se publica primero en el paquete de confianza para que todos los verificadores puedan comprobarlo antes de que se use para firmar. La firma puede comenzar más tarde, pero nunca antes de ese momento.",Theme:HPt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Se produjo un error al cargar el editor de código.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Esta cuenta ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"Esta acción elimina el proveedor de identidades de carga de trabajo {{providerName}} y todo lo que esté configurado en él.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"Esta acción elimina el proveedor de identidades de carga de trabajo <b>{{providerName}}</b> y todo lo que se haya configurado en este.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Esto no se puede deshacer y la creación posterior de un proveedor con el mismo nombre no restaura nada. Para continuar, complete los pasos que se indican a continuación.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Esta acción no se puede deshacer y la ruta reservada por esta plantilla permanecerá reservada. Ninguna plantilla futura podrá generar identidades en esa ruta.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Esta acción no se puede deshacer y el nombre permanecerá reservado. No volverá a asignarse, por lo que no podrá volver a crear esta identidad con el mismo nombre.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"Esta autoridad de certificación solo funciona en Este de EE. UU. (Norte de Virginia) us-east-1. Para usarla en otras regiones, replíquela en la consola de AWS Private CA.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Este certificado se utiliza actualmente para validar, por lo que eliminarlo detendrá la verificación de inmediato","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"Primero se vuelve a publicar la cadena de este certificado en el paquete de confianza. La firma se reanuda cuando la cadena está disponible en todas las regiones.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Esta combinación de clave de condición y operador ya existe","This management account and delegated administrators":"Esta cuenta de administración y los administradores delegados","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Esta organización ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Este proveedor deja de emitir X.509-SVID de inmediato y las cargas de trabajo que necesitan un certificado de cliente comenzarán a fallar a partir de su próxima solicitud. El certificado que aparece a continuación permanece configurado. Los certificados ya emitidos aún se pueden verificar durante unas 12 horas. Al seleccionar Habilitar, se reanuda la firma.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"De este modo, se elimina el certificado del proveedor y se retira inmediatamente su cadena del paquete de confianza. La propia autoridad de certificación permanece en AWS Private CA sin cambios.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"De este modo, se elimina el certificado del proveedor. Su cadena de certificados ya se retiró del paquete de confianza, por lo que las verificaciones que se realizan actualmente no se verán afectadas. La propia autoridad de certificación permanecerá en AWS Private CA sin cambios.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Esta etiqueta se eliminará al guardar los cambios","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Esto suele tardar unos minutos. Mantenga esta página abierta hasta que termine.",Today:"Hoy","Too many requests":"Demasiadas solicitudes","Trust bundle endpoint":"Punto de conexión del paquete de confianza","trust domain":"dominio de confianza","Trust domain":"Dominio de confianza","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"El dominio de confianza es la raíz de la confianza del esquema de nomenclatura de SPIFFE. Es un nombre lógico que sigue el estilo de nomenclatura de DNS, por ejemplo prod.acme.com, pero no necesita coincidir con un registro de DNS real.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Inténtelo de nuevo. Si el problema persiste, contacte con AWS Support.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Dos cuentas no deben poder representar el mismo nombre de identidad.","Unable to load templates":"No se pueden cargar las plantillas",Undo:GPt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"Prefijo único para diferentes rutas",Update:KPt,"Update certificate signer":"Actualizar el firmante de certificados",'Use "{{key}}"':"Utilice “{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"Utilice “{{value}}”","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"Utilice un prefijo de ruta que su organización reconozca, como un área empresarial o un equipo. Debe ser único en toda la organización. Puede escribir una política que regule qué cuentas pueden emitir identidades con este prefijo.","Use cases":"Casos de uso","Use one from another account":"Usar una CA de otra cuenta",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Usar: “{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Se utiliza como nombre común en el asunto de la autoridad de certificación.",Validating:YPt,Value:JPt,Values:ZPt,"View all":"Ver todo","View all notifications":"Ver todas las notificaciones","View JSON":"Ver JSON",Visual:QPt,Warning:XPt,Warnings:eNt,"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Sin una política, ninguna otra cuenta puede crear plantillas bajo este proveedor, aunque los administradores delegados ya pueden crear ambas. Agregue una instrucción para cada cuenta, unidad organizativa o entidad principal de IAM que debería poder hacerlo, y limite cada una a un prefijo de ruta.",Workload:tNt,"Workload identities":"Identidades de la carga de trabajo","Workload identity":"Identidad de carga de trabajo","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Se eliminó la identidad de la carga de trabajo {{workloadIdentifier}}.","Workload identity providers":"Proveedores de identidad de cargas de trabajo","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Identidad de carga de trabajo: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"Las cargas de trabajo reciben un nombre automáticamente","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en esta cuenta pueden usar las identidades generadas por esta plantilla con información verificada por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Las cargas de trabajo que se ejecutan en su organización pueden usar las identidades generadas por esta plantilla con información verificada por {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Las cargas de trabajo que utilicen estas identidades dejarán de recibir credenciales y fallarán en su próxima solicitud","Wrap lines":"Ajustar líneas","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Escriba una política para permitir que otra cuenta cree plantillas o para impedir que un administrador delegado ocupe parte del espacio de nombres. Cada instrucción designa una unidad organizativa, cuentas específicas o entidades principales de IAM concretas, permite o deniega el acceso y se puede limitar a un prefijo de ruta.","Yes by default":"Sí de forma predeterminada","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Puede agregar hasta {{availableTags}} etiqueta más.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Puede agregar hasta {{availableTags}} etiquetas más.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"Elige un prefijo por caso de uso y el nombre lo lleva en su lugar. Los nombres son más cortos y el prefijo debe ser único en toda la organización.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Ha superado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiqueta.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Ha superado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiquetas.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Tiene más claves de las que se pueden mostrar","You have more values than can be displayed":"Tiene más valores de los que se pueden mostrar","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Ha alcanzado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiqueta.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Ha alcanzado el límite de {{tagLimit}} etiquetas.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Tiene cambios de etiqueta sin guardar. ¿Desea abandonar esta página y descartarlos?","You must choose a path segment":"Debe elegir un segmento de ruta","You must specify a condition key":"Debe especificar una clave de condición","You must specify a tag key":"Debe especificar una clave de etiqueta","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Debe especificar una clave de etiqueta única.","You must specify a value":"Debe especificar un valor","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"El administrador decide qué prefijos puede usar esta cuenta. Esto se comprueba al crearla.","YYYY/MM/DD":"AAAA/MM/DD","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},aNt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:qLt,Active:VLt,Add:HLt,Apply:GLt,Attestation:KLt,Cancel:YLt,Clear:JLt,Close:ZLt,Condition:QLt,Configured:XLt,Confirm:ePt,Contains:tPt,Created:nPt,Delete:aPt,Description:iPt,Details:rPt,Disable:oPt,Dismiss:sPt,Edit:lPt,Editing:cPt,Enable:uPt,Equals:dPt,Errors:pPt,Format:mPt,Inactive:gPt,Info:vPt,JWKS:fPt,Key:yPt,Name:bPt,None:wPt,Notifications:SPt,Operator:_Pt,Operators:kPt,Path:CPt,Preferences:APt,Preview:TPt,Properties:IPt,Property:DPt,Provided:LPt,Provider:PPt,Providers:NPt,Ready:RPt,Remove:MPt,Retry:zPt,Save:OPt,Scheme:BPt,Scope:$Pt,Status:jPt,Subject:WPt,Success:UPt,Tags:qPt,Templates:VPt,Theme:HPt,Today:"Hoy",Undo:GPt,Update:KPt,Validating:YPt,Value:JPt,Values:ZPt,Visual:QPt,Warning:XPt,Warnings:eNt,Workload:tNt,and:"y",default:nNt,hours:hPt,optional:xPt,or:"o",path:EPt,scheme:FPt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),iNt="Actions",rNt="Actif",oNt="Ajouter",sNt="Appliquer",lNt="Attestation",cNt="Annuler",uNt="Effacer",dNt="Fermer",pNt="Condition",mNt="Configuré",hNt="Confirmer",gNt="Contient",vNt="Créé",fNt="Supprimer",yNt="Description",bNt="Détails",wNt="Désactiver",SNt="Ignorer",_Nt="Modifier",kNt="Modification",xNt="Activer",ENt="Égal à",CNt="Erreurs",ANt="Format",TNt="heures",INt="Inactif",DNt="Informations",LNt="JWKS",PNt="Aucun",NNt="Notifications",RNt="Opérateur",MNt="Opérateurs",zNt="facultatif",ONt="Chemin",FNt="Chemin",BNt="Préférences",$Nt="Aperçu",jNt="Propriétés",WNt="Propriété",UNt="Fourni",qNt="Fournisseur",VNt="Fournisseurs",HNt="Prêt",GNt="Supprimer",KNt="Réessayer",YNt="Enregistrer",JNt="Schéma",ZNt="Schéma",QNt="Portée",XNt="Statut",eRt="Objet",tRt="Réussite",nRt="Balises",aRt="Modèles",iRt="Thème",rRt="Aujourd’hui",oRt="Annuler",sRt="Mettre à jour",lRt="Validation en cours",cRt="Valeur",uRt="Valeurs",dRt="Visuel",pRt="Avertissement",mRt="Avertissements",hRt="Charges de travail",gRt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"« {{providerName}} » n’existe pas dans votre compte","(earliest)":"(le plus tôt)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} balise ajoutée ou modifiée","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} balises ajoutées ou modifiées","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identités","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identité","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copié","{{label}} failed to copy":"Échec de la copie de {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} modèle","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} correspondance","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} correspondances","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"Balise {{removedCount}} supprimée","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} balises supprimées","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} balise","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} balises","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} modèle","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} modèles","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 à 48 heures, en heures entières. La publication est généralement beaucoup plus rapide, mais peut prendre jusqu’à 24 heures.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Cochez toutes les cases pour confirmer ce qu’entraînera la suppression de {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Pour confirmer la suppression de ce fournisseur, saisissez {{providerName}} ci-dessous.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Un refus, et uniquement pour les administrateurs délégués","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"Un fournisseur est l’émetteur et la limite de confiance pour les identités de charge de travail qui en dépendent. Un seul fournisseur contient à la fois les identités générées par un modèle et celles que vous déclarez manuellement.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"Le propriétaire d’une ressource peut accorder l’accès au nom avant que sa charge de travail ne soit mise en ligne.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Une balise est une étiquette que vous affectez à une ressource AWS. Chaque balise comprend une clé et une valeur facultative. Utilisez des balises pour rechercher et filtrer ce fournisseur, ou pour suivre vos coûts AWS.","A template with this name already exists.":"Un modèle portant ce nom existe déjà.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Accédez à une API partenaire, à un point de terminaison SaaS ou à un service OIDC. Aucune configuration n’est nécessaire.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Accédez à un maillage de services, à une base de données ou à un système sur site.","Access denied":"Accès refusé","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Les accès que vous avez accordés à ces identités ne fonctionneront plus","Account scoped":"Portée du compte",Actions:iNt,"Activating it":"Son activation",Active:rNt,Add:oNt,"Add {{label}} template":"Ajouter un modèle {{label}}","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Ajoutez au moins un segment de chemin.","Add attestation rules":"Ajouter des règles d’attestation","Add condition":"Ajouter une condition","Add new tag":"Ajouter une nouvelle balise","Add path segment":"Ajoutez un segment de chemin","Add policy":"Ajouter une politique","Add tags":"Ajouter des balises","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à ce fournisseur pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à ce modèle pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Ajoutez des balises à cette identité de charge de travail pour la gestion des coûts et le contrôle d’accès.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"Ajoutez les faits attestés par ce type de charge de travail, dans l’ordre dans lequel ils doivent apparaître dans le nom.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Les balises ajoutées ou modifiées n’ont pas été enregistrées","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Tous les signataires sortants associés à ce fournisseur seront supprimés","All properties":"Toutes les propriétés","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Tous les modèles et toutes les identités de charge de travail liés à ce fournisseur seront supprimés",and:"et","Any value":"N’importe quelle valeur",Apply:sNt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copié","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Au moment de l’exécution, la plateforme certifie ces informations relatives à la charge de travail. Toute charge de travail dont l’attestation contient ces informations génère une identité à partir de ce modèle.",Attestation:lNt,"Attestation rules":"Règles d’attestation","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Les règles d’attestation sont les faits qu’une charge de travail doit prouver avant que ce fournisseur ne lui délivre une identité. La plateforme de calcul s’en porte garante, de sorte qu’une charge de travail ne peut pas revendiquer une identité qui n’est pas la sienne.","Attested by":"Attesté par","Auto generated identity name":"Nom d’identité généré automatiquement","Automatically generate from a template":"Générez automatiquement à partir d’un modèle","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponible pour tous les comptes de votre organisation ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponible pour ce compte ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID de compte AWS","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"L’autorité de certification privée AWS n’a pas pu configurer cette autorité de certification. Supprimez-la dans la console de l’autorité de certification privée AWS et réessayez.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"L’autorité de certification privée AWS crée une autorité de certification pour IAM et renvoie un identifiant pour celle-ci.",Cancel:cNt,"Cannot start with aws:":"Ne peut pas commencer par aws:","Certificate authority":"Autorité de certification","Certificate authority created":"Autorité de certification créée","Certificate authority ID":"ID de l’autorité de certification","Certificate authority name":"Nom de l’autorité de certification","Certificate deleted.":"Certificat supprimé.","Certificate signer":"Signataire du certificat","Certificate signer disabled.":"Le signataire du certificat est désactivé.","Certificate signer enabled.":"Signataire de certificat activé.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"Signataire du certificat mis à jour. La nouvelle chaîne de certificats est publiée dans le bundle de confiance avant qu’il ne prenne en charge la signature.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Signature de certificat activée. La chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée dans le bundle de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heure, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Signature de certificat activée. La chaîne de certificats est d’abord publiée dans le bundle de confiance, et la signature commence dans environ {{hours}} heures, une fois que chaque région en dispose.","Certificate verifier information":"Informations sur le vérificateur de certificats","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Modifiez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir certifiés pour se voir attribuer une identité à partir de ce modèle. Les identités que ce modèle a déjà générées ne sont pas affectées.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Changez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir attestés pour fonctionner sous cette identité. Une charge de travail contenant déjà une session la conserve jusqu’à son expiration.","Check again":"Vérifiez à nouveau","Choose a condition key":"Choisir une clé de condition","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Choisissez un chemin d’accès et un modèle pour les noms. Commencez par un modèle par défaut ou personnalisez-le à votre guise.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"Choisissez un nom spécifique pour la charge de travail afin de pouvoir la mapper selon vos propres conventions.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Choisissez un nom spécifique dès le départ afin de lui accorder l’accès ou de respecter une convention de dénomination existante avant l’exécution de la charge de travail.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Choisissez un cas d’utilisation ci-dessus pour ajouter un modèle.","Choose from this account":"Choisissez depuis ce compte","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Choisissez les clés de condition à utiliser comme faits d’attestation. La plateforme doit tous les certifier avant que ce modèle ne crée une identité pour une charge de travail.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Choisissez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir certifiés pour obtenir une identité à partir de ce modèle. Rien n’est généré à partir de celui-ci tant que vous ne l’avez pas fait.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Choisissez les faits qu’une charge de travail doit avoir attestés pour s’exécuter avec cette identité. Rien ne peut être émis pour celle-ci tant que vous ne l’avez pas fait.",Clear:uNt,"Clear filters":"Effacer les filtres",Close:dNt,"Close modal":"Fermer la fenêtre modale","Code editor":"Éditeur de code",Condition:pNt,"Condition key":"Clé de condition","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configurez des modèles d’identité pour les cas d’utilisation de votre charge de travail. Chaque modèle définit un modèle de chemin utilisé pour émettre des identités de manière unique et les faits qu’une charge de travail doit prouver avant qu’une identité ne soit émise.",Configured:mNt,Confirm:hNt,Contains:gNt,"Continue setup":"Poursuivre la configuration","Copy {{label}}":"Copier {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copier l’ARN","Copy JSON":"Copier JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Créer un modèle pour automatiser la génération d’identités","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"Création d’une identité pour accorder l’accès avant l’exécution d’une charge de travail","Create identity":"Créer une identité","Create new":"Créer","Create provider":"Créer un fournisseur","Create template":"Créer un modèle","Create templates":"Créer les modèles","Create the certificate authority first.":"Créez d’abord l’autorité de certification.","Create workload identities":"Créer des identités de charge de travail",Created:vNt,"Created through":"Créé via","Created time":"Heure de création","Created values":"Valeurs créées","Creating certificate authority":"Création de l’autorité de certification","Creating the certificate authority":"Création de l’autorité de certification","Current CA":"CA actuelle","Current provider":"Fournisseur actuel","Custom tag key":"Clé de balise personnalisée","Custom tag value":"Valeur de balise personnalisée","Dark themes":"Thèmes sombres","Default permissions without a policy":"Autorisations par défaut sans politique","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"Définissez la charge de travail autorisée à s’exécuter sous ce nom.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Définissez les charges de travail autorisées à utiliser ce modèle.",Delete:fNt,"Delete certificate?":"Supprimer le certificat ?","Delete provider":"Supprimer le fournisseur","Delete provider?":"Supprimer le fournisseur ?","Delete template":"Supprimer le modèle","Delete template?":"Supprimer le modèle ?","Delete workload identity?":"Supprimer l’identité de charge de travail ?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"La suppression de <b>{{templateName}}</b> aura pour effet de :","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"La suppression de <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> aura pour effet de :",Description:yNt,Details:bNt,Disable:wNt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Désactiver le signataire du certificat ?","Discovery expiration time":"Délai d’expiration de la découverte",Dismiss:SNt,"Does not contain":"Ne contient pas","Does not equal":"N’est pas égal à","Drag or select to resize":"Faire glisser ou sélectionner pour redimensionner","Drag to reorder":"Faire glisser pour réorganiser","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"Chaque nom d’identité contient la région et la ressource qui l’a produite, de sorte que deux comptes ne peuvent pas afficher le même nom.",Edit:_Nt,"Edit attestation rules":"Modifier les règles d’attestation","Edit filter":"Modifier le filtre","Edit identity path and attestation":"Modifier le chemin d’identité et l’attestation",Editing:kNt,Enable:xNt,"Enable certificate signer":"Activer le signataire du certificat","Enable certificate signer?":"Activer le signataire du certificat ?","End signing time":"Heure de fin de signature","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Saisissez un ID de compte AWS à 12 chiffres.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Saisissez un ID d’autorité de certification.","Enter a name":"Saisir un nom","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Entrez le nom de l’autorité de certification.","Enter a path prefix":"Saisir une valeur de préfixe de chemin","Enter a path prefix value":"Entrez une valeur de préfixe de chemin","Enter a value":"Saisir une valeur","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Saisissez un nombre entier d’heures compris entre 1 et 48.","Enter key":"Saisissez une clé","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Entrez l’ID d’une autorité de certification ou choisissez l’une des options ci-dessous","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Saisissez la politique au format JSON valide.","Enter value":"Saisissez une valeur",Equals:ENt,Error:"Erreur","Error fetching the details":"Erreur lors de l’extraction des détails",Errors:CNt,"Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"Chaque chaîne de certificats publiée. Un vérificateur qui accepte les SVID X.509 de ce fournisseur extrait ses racines à partir d’ici.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"Chaque modèle et chaque identité de charge de travail sous {{providerName}} sont supprimés avec lui, et ses noms d’identité ne sont jamais réémis. Les charges de travail qui en dépendent ne reçoivent plus d’informations d’identification.","Failed to copy":"Échec de la copie","Failed to copy JSON":"Impossible de copier le JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Impossible de charger la politique d’attestation.","Failed to load templates.":"Échec du chargement des modèles.","Filter identities":"Filtrer les identités","Filter providers":"Filtrer les fournisseurs","Filter templates":"Filtrer des modèles","Filter themes":"Filtrer les thèmes","Find identities":"Rechercher des identités","Find providers":"Rechercher des fournisseurs","Find templates":"Rechercher des modèles","Find theme":"Rechercher un thème","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Pour un TLS mutuel, associez une autorité de certification","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Pour les services basés sur des jetons, émettez un JWT",Format:ANt,"Generating its key":"Génération de sa clé","Get started":"Commencer","Give your workloads an identity":"Donnez une identité à vos charges de travail","Govern who can create resources":"Déterminez qui peut créer des ressources","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Déterminer qui peut créer des modèles faisant référence à ce fournisseur","Grant access up front":"Autoriser l’accès dès le départ","Greater than":"Supérieur à","Greater than or equal":"Supérieur ou égal à",hours:TNt,"How identities are kept unique":"Comment les identités restent uniques",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identité « {{identityId}} » introuvable.","Identity name":"Nom d’identité","Identity name pattern":"Modèle de nom d’identité","Identity path and attestation":"Chemin d’identité et attestation","Identity selection":"Sélection de l’identité","In transition":"En transition",Inactive:INt,"Incoming CA":"CA entrante",Info:DNt,"Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"ID d’infrastructure (ID de compte) dans le modèle de chemin","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Clé non valide. Les clés ne peuvent contenir que des lettres Unicode, des chiffres, des espaces et les caractères suivants : _.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"Demande non valide","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Valeur non valide. Les valeurs ne peuvent contenir que des lettres Unicode, des chiffres, des espaces et les caractères suivants : _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"Émet les SVID X.509 que les charges de travail de ce fournisseur présentent sous forme de certificats clients à des systèmes extérieurs à AWS. Il nécessite une autorité de certification privée AWS associée à IAM.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Émet des SVID X.509 pour les pairs mTLS qui vérifient un certificat client.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Délivrance de son certificat CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Il a cessé de signer, mais sa chaîne est toujours publiée. Les charges de travail s’appuient donc sur elle pour vérifier les informations d’identification émises précédemment. Sa suppression entraîne la suppression immédiate de la chaîne et ces informations d’identification commencent à échouer. Laissez-le tranquille et il deviendra inactif tout seul, après quoi sa suppression ne changera rien.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Objet déplacé de la position {{initialPosition}} à la position {{finalPosition}} sur {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copié",JWKS:LNt,"JWKS popover":"Chaque clé de signature active, sélectionnée par kid. AWS publie une nouvelle clé ici avant que la signature ne bascule vers celle-ci.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algorithme de signature","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algorithmes de clés","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Clé de signature actuelle depuis","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS génère les clés et les fait pivoter selon son propre calendrier, en publiant chaque nouvelle clé dans le JWKS avant qu’il ne commence à signer. Les algorithmes restent les mêmes tout au long d’une rotation, de sorte qu’un vérificateur lisant le JWKS n’a besoin d’aucune modification de votre part.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Signe les JWT-SVID, pour les systèmes qui vérifient un jeton signé.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Découverte OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Le document de découverte standard. La plupart des vérificateurs n’ont besoin que de cette URL, car ils y trouvent les clés.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Émetteur OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"La revendication iss de chaque JWT-SVID signé ici. Un vérificateur qui épingle un émetteur épingle cette valeur.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informations sur le vérificateur de jetons","JWT Outbound signers status":"Valeur par défaut fournie par AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Signataire JWT",Key:"Clé","Last updated time":"Heure de dernière mise à jour","Learn more":"En savoir plus","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"En savoir plus sur la suppression d’un fournisseur (s’ouvre dans un nouvel onglet)","Less than":"Inférieur à","Less than or equal":"Inférieur ou égal à","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Permettez à d’autres comptes ou principaux de votre organisation de créer des modèles et des identités sous ce fournisseur, en utilisant les préfixes de chemin que vous choisissez.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Laissez les charges de travail d’accéder à des ressources hors AWS","Light themes":"Thèmes clairs","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Lig {{row}}, Col {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Chargement des autorités de certification","Loading code editor":"Chargement de l’éditeur de code","Loading tag keys":"Chargement des clés de balises en cours","Loading tag values":"Chargement des valeurs de balise en cours","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Chargement des balises associées à cette ressource","Loading workload identities":"Chargement des identités de charge de travail","Manage tags":"Gérer les balises","Manage the provider":"Gérez le fournisseur","Manual creation":"Création manuelle","Manually create":"Créez manuellement","Manually created identities":"Identités créées manuellement","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Les charges de travail correspondantes reçoivent leur propre nom d’identité dès leur lancement, quelle que soit l’échelle.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"Les comptes membres ne peuvent plus rien créer ni utiliser auprès de ce fournisseur","Minimum signing delay":"Délai de signature minimum","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"Déplace la signature vers une autre autorité de certification. Sa chaîne publie d’abord dans le bundle de confiance, et le certificat actuel continue à signer jusqu’à ce qu’il prenne le relais.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Déplacement de l’élément vers la position {{currentPosition}} de {{total}}",Name:"Nom","Name must be 256 characters or less.":"Le nom ne doit pas dépasser 256 caractères.","Name pattern":"Modèle de nom","Name pattern values":"Valeurs du motif de nom","Name values":"Valeurs de nom","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Nomme les identités automatiquement au fur et à mesure que les charges de travail démarrent, afin que vous n’ayez pas à les créer ni à les gérer une par une.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"Les noms que vous créez manuellement sous ce fournisseur. Le propriétaire d’une ressource peut accorder l’accès à un nom avant l’exécution de sa charge de travail.","naming prefix":"préfixe de dénomination","Naming scheme":"Schéma de dénomination","Next month":"Mois suivant","Next page":"Page suivante","Next step":"Étape suivante","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Aucune politique d’attestation n’a été définie. Définissez-en une pour qu’une charge de travail puisse s’exécuter sous cette identité.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Non par défaut, mais vous pouvez ajouter une politique","No certificate authorities in this account":"Aucune autorité de certification dans ce compte","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"Aucune condition. Rien ne peut être exécuté sous cette identité tant que vous n’en avez pas ajouté au moins 1.","no domain":"Aucun domaine","No match found":"Aucune correspondance trouvée","No matches":"Aucune correspondance","No tags associated with the resource.":"Aucune balise n’est associée à la ressource.","No templates added yet":"Aucun modèle n’a encore été ajouté","No workload identity providers":"Aucun fournisseur d’identité de charge de travail","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Aucune charge de travail ne correspond à ce modèle, il ne génère donc aucune identité.","No, and cannot be granted":"Non, et cela ne peut pas être accordé",None:PNt,"Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Non enregistré : {{keys}}.","Not set":"Non défini",Notifications:NNt,"Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les fournisseurs au niveau de l’organisation.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les modèles au niveau de l’organisation.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Seul le compte de gestion ou un administrateur délégué peut supprimer les identités de charge de travail au niveau de l’organisation.","Open in AWS Private CA":"Ouvrir dans l’autorité de certification privée AWS",Operator:RNt,Operators:MNt,optional:zNt,or:"ou","Organization scoped":"Portée de l’organisation","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organisez le fournisseur de services et suivez ses coûts à l’aide de balises.","Other accounts in your organization":"Autres comptes de votre organisation","Other condition keys":"Autres clés de condition","Outbound signers":"Signataires sortants","Outbound signers page desc":"Les signataires sortants signent les informations d’identification que les charges de travail de ce fournisseur présentent aux systèmes extérieurs à AWS. L’accès à AWS lui-même ne nécessite aucun signataire : une charge de travail dispose déjà de SigV4 pour cela.","Outbound signers page title":"Signataires sortants","Owning account":"Compte propriétaire","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Page {{pageNumber}} sur l’ensemble des pages",path:ONt,Path:FNt,"path from templates":"chemin à partir de modèles","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Le chemin est la partie du nom d’identité spécifique à chaque charge de travail. Il est rempli au moment de l’exécution à partir des faits prouvés par une charge de travail.","Path pattern":"Modèle de chemin","Path prefix":"Préfixe du chemin","Path segment {{index}}":"Segment de chemin {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Élément pris à la position {{position}} de {{total}}","Policy details":"Détails de la politique","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Politique : définir comment une charge de travail se fait attester pour obtenir l’identité",Preferences:BNt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Utilisez la barre d’espace ou Entrée pour activer le glissement, puis utilisez les touches fléchées pour vous déplacer et utilisez la barre d’espace ou Entrée pour confirmer.",Preview:$Nt,"Previous CA":"CA précédente","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificats précédents ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mois précédent","Previous page":"Page précédente",Properties:jNt,Property:WNt,Provided:UNt,Provider:qNt,"Provider name":"Nom du fournisseur","Provider not found":"Fournisseur introuvable","Provider overview":"Vue d’ensemble du fournisseur","Provider selection":"Sélection du fournisseur","Provider settings":"Paramètres du fournisseur","Provider values":"Valeurs du fournisseur",Providers:VNt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"Publication dans le bundle de confiance. La signature commence une fois que chaque région le possède.","Quick create":"Création rapide",Ready:HNt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Recommandé pour la plupart des charges de travail","Refresh certificate authorities":"Actualiser les autorités de certification",Remove:GNt,"Remove {{name}}":"Supprimer {{name}}","Remove condition":"Supprimer la condition","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Supprimer le filtre {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Supprimer la politique de gouvernance ?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Supprimer la balise {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Les balises supprimées n’ont pas été enregistrées","Reordering canceled":"Réorganisation annulée","Resize handle":"Poignée de redimensionnement","Restricted by":"Restreint par",Retry:KNt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Vérifiez les balises et enregistrez à nouveau.",Save:YNt,"Save changes":"Enregistrer les modifications",scheme:JNt,Scheme:ZNt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Le schéma définit le format utilisé par ce fournisseur pour nommer les identités.",Scope:QNt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"La portée définit les comptes autorisés à utiliser ce fournisseur.","Scope values":"Valeurs de portée","Search tags":"Rechercher des balises","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segment qui partitionne les identités.","Select {{name}}":"Sélectionner {{name}}",Set:"Définir","Set a naming pattern":"Définir un modèle de dénomination","Set an attestation rule":"Définir une règle d’attestation","Set by your provider.":"Défini par votre fournisseur.","Set the name":"Définir le nom","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"Définissez le modèle de chemin unique et les règles d’attestation utilisées par chaque identité de charge de travail générée par ce modèle.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configurez un moyen d’émettre des identités de charge de travail","Set up for your use cases":"Configuration adaptée à vos cas d’utilisation","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"La configuration de l’autorité de certification s’est arrêtée. Vous pouvez reprendre là où elle s’est arrêtée.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Paramètres de votre fournisseur {{providerName}}","Show fewer":"Afficher moins","Show more":"Afficher plus","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"Signature de nouveaux certificats et publication dans le bundle de confiance.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La signature reprend immédiatement, car ce certificat est toujours publié dans le bundle de confiance.","Signing start time":"Heure de début de signature","Something went wrong":"Un problème est survenu",Status:XNt,"Status bar":"Barre d’état","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Empêcher l’accès que vous avez accordé à ce nom d’identité de fonctionner","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Empêcher l’accès que vous avez accordé à ces noms d’identité de fonctionner","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Empêcher les charges de travail correspondantes d’obtenir une identité, afin qu’elles échouent à leur prochaine demande","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Empêcher la résolution des identités qu’il a générées","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Arrêter l’exécution de la charge de travail sous cette identité, afin qu’elle échoue lors de sa prochaine demande","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"La signature est arrêtée et n’est plus dans le bundle de confiance, donc rien ne s’y vérifie. La suppression d’un élément est sans risque.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"Signature arrêtée et n’est plus dans le bundle de confiance.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"A cessé de signer, mais toujours publié dans le bundle de confiance. Les certificats émis précédemment continuent donc à être vérifiés.",Subject:eRt,Success:tRt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Les clés de balise n’ont pas pu être récupérées","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Les valeurs de balise n’ont pas pu être récupérées",Tags:nRt,"Tags could not be loaded":"Les balises n’ont pas pu être chargées","Tags not saved":"Balises non enregistrées",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Modèle « {{templateId}} » introuvable.","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Le modèle {{templateName}} a été supprimé.","Template name":"Nom du modèle","Template name values":"Valeurs du nom de modèle","Template: {{name}}":"Modèle : {{name}}",Templates:aRt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Les modèles attribuent automatiquement un nom d’identité propre aux charges de travail correspondantes. Chacune utilise le préfixe du nom de ce fournisseur, suivi d’un chemin d’accès et d’un modèle.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Le compte propriétaire de l’autorité de certification.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"Le certificateur atteste de la charge de travail, qui doit répondre à toutes les conditions pour qu’une identité soit émise à partir de ce modèle.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"L’attestateur garantit la charge de travail, et celle-ci doit satisfaire à toutes les conditions pour s’exécuter avec cette identité.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"L’autorité de certification est toujours en cours de configuration.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"L’ID à la fin de l’ARN de l’autorité de certification dans AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Le nom d’identité est le schéma de dénomination du fournisseur, un préfixe de chemin et un modèle de chemin.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Une clé de balise peut comporter au maximum 128 caractères.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Une valeur de balise peut comporter jusqu’à 256 caractères.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Les préfixes de chemin autorisés par votre politique","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Les autorisations définies dans cette politique pour <b>{{providerName}}</b> cessent de s’appliquer.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"C’est la date la plus proche à laquelle ce certificat peut commencer à signer. Il est d’abord publié dans le bundle de confiance, afin que chaque vérificateur puisse le vérifier avant que quoi que ce soit ne soit signé sous celui-ci. La signature peut commencer plus tard, jamais plus tôt.",Theme:iRt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Une erreur s’est produite lors du chargement de l’éditeur de code.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Ce compte ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"Cette action supprime le fournisseur d’identités de charge de travail {{providerName}} et l’ensemble des éléments qui y sont configurés.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"Cette action supprime le fournisseur d’identité de charge de travail <b>{{providerName}}</b> et tout ce qui est configuré sous celui-ci.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Cette action est irréversible, et la création ultérieure d’un fournisseur portant le même nom ne restaure aucun élément. Pour continuer, effectuez les étapes ci-dessous.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Cette action ne peut pas être annulée et le chemin réservé par ce modèle reste réservé. Aucun modèle futur ne pourra générer d’identités sous ce chemin.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Cette opération ne peut pas être annulée et ce nom reste réservé. Il n’est plus jamais émis, vous ne pouvez donc pas recréer cette identité sous le même nom.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"Cette autorité de certification fonctionne uniquement dans USA Est (Virginie du Nord) us-east-1. Pour l’utiliser dans d’autres régions, répliquez-la dans la console de l’autorité de certification privée AWS.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Ce certificat est en cours de validation, donc sa suppression interrompt immédiatement la vérification","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"La chaîne de ce certificat est à nouveau publiée dans le bundle de confiance en premier, et la signature reprend une fois que chaque région en dispose.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Cette combinaison de clé de condition et d’opérateur existe déjà","This management account and delegated administrators":"Ce compte de gestion et les administrateurs délégués","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Cette organisation ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Ce fournisseur arrête immédiatement d’émettre des SVID X.509, et les charges de travail nécessitant un certificat client commenceront à échouer lors de leur prochaine demande. Le certificat ci-dessous reste configuré. Les certificats déjà émis continuent à être vérifiés pendant environ 12 heures, et Activer reprend la signature.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Cela supprime le certificat du fournisseur et retire immédiatement sa chaîne du bundle de confiance. L’autorité de certification elle-même reste inchangée dans la CA privée AWS.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Cela supprime le certificat du fournisseur. Sa chaîne a déjà quitté le bundle de confiance, donc rien de ce qui est vérifié aujourd’hui ne change. L’autorité de certification elle-même reste inchangée dans la CA privée AWS.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Cette balise sera supprimée lors de l’enregistrement des modifications","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Cela prend généralement quelques minutes. Gardez cette page ouverte jusqu’à la fin.",Today:rRt,"Too many requests":"Trop de requêtes","Trust bundle endpoint":"Point de terminaison du bundle de confiance","trust domain":"domaine de confiance","Trust domain":"Domaine de confiance","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Le domaine de confiance est la racine de confiance du schéma de dénomination SPIFFE. Il s’agit d’un nom logique qui suit le style de dénomination DNS, par exemple prod.acme.com, mais qui n’a pas besoin de correspondre à un enregistrement DNS réel.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Essayez de nouveau. Si le problème persiste, veuillez contacter AWS Support.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Deux comptes ne doivent pas pouvoir afficher le même nom d’identité.","Unable to load templates":"Impossible de charger les modèles",Undo:oRt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"Préfixe unique pour différents chemins",Update:sRt,"Update certificate signer":"Mettre à jour le signataire du certificat",'Use "{{key}}"':"Utiliser « {{key}} »",'Use "{{value}}"':"Utiliser « {{value}} »","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"Utilisez un préfixe de chemin reconnu par votre organisation, comme un domaine d’activité ou une équipe. Il doit être unique au sein de votre organisation. Vous pouvez rédiger une politique qui régit les comptes autorisés à émettre des identités sous ce préfixe.","Use cases":"Cas d’utilisation","Use one from another account":"Utilisez-en un depuis un autre compte",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Utiliser : « {{text}} »","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Utilisé comme nom commun dans l’objet de l’autorité de certification.",Validating:lRt,Value:cRt,Values:uRt,"View all":"Voir tout","View all notifications":"Afficher toutes les notifications","View JSON":"Voir le JSON",Visual:dRt,Warning:pRt,Warnings:mRt,"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"En l’absence de politique, aucun autre compte ne peut créer de modèles sous ce fournisseur, bien que les administrateurs délégués puissent déjà créer les deux. Ajoutez une déclaration pour chaque compte, unité organisationnelle ou principal IAM autorisé à le faire, et limitez chacun à un préfixe de chemin.",Workload:hRt,"Workload identities":"Identités de la charge de travail","Workload identity":"Identité de charge de travail","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identité de charge de travail {{workloadIdentifier}} supprimée.","Workload identity providers":"Fournisseurs d’identité de charge de travail","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Identité de charge de travail : {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"Les charges de travail sont nommées automatiquement","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Les charges de travail s’exécutant dans ce compte peuvent utiliser les identités générées par ce modèle à l’aide d’informations vérifiées par {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Les charges de travail s’exécutant dans votre organisation peuvent utiliser les identités générées par ce modèle à l’aide d’informations vérifiées par {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Les charges de travail qui utilisent ces identités ne recevront plus d’informations d’identification et échoueront lors de leur prochaine requête","Wrap lines":"Renvoyer à la ligne","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Écrivez une politique pour permettre à un autre compte de créer des modèles ou pour empêcher un administrateur délégué d’accéder à une partie de l’espace de noms. Chaque instruction nomme une unité organisationnelle, des comptes spécifiques ou des principaux IAM individuels, autorise ou refuse, et peut être limitée à un préfixe de chemin.","Yes by default":"Oui par défaut","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu’à {{availableTags}} balise supplémentaire.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Vous pouvez ajouter jusqu’à {{availableTags}} balises supplémentaires.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"Vous choisissez un préfixe par cas d’utilisation et le nom le porte à la place. Les noms sont plus courts et le préfixe doit être unique au sein de votre organisation.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Vous avez dépassé la limite de {{tagLimit}} balise.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Vous avez dépassé la limite de {{tagLimit}} balises.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Vous avez plus de clés qu’il n’est possible d’en afficher","You have more values than can be displayed":"Vous avez plus de valeurs qu’il n’est possible d’en afficher","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Vous avez atteint la limite de {{tagLimit}} balise.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Vous avez atteint la limite de {{tagLimit}} balises.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Vous avez des modifications de balises non enregistrées. Quitter cette page et les ignorer ?","You must choose a path segment":"Vous devez choisir un segment de chemin","You must specify a condition key":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de condition","You must specify a tag key":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de balise","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Vous devez spécifier une clé de balise unique.","You must specify a value":"Vous devez spécifier une valeur","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"C’est votre administrateur qui décide des préfixes que ce compte peut utiliser. Cela est vérifié lors de la création.","YYYY/MM/DD":"AAAA/MM/JJ","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},vRt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:iNt,Active:rNt,Add:oNt,Apply:sNt,Attestation:lNt,Cancel:cNt,Clear:uNt,Close:dNt,Condition:pNt,Configured:mNt,Confirm:hNt,Contains:gNt,Created:vNt,Delete:fNt,Description:yNt,Details:bNt,Disable:wNt,Dismiss:SNt,Edit:_Nt,Editing:kNt,Enable:xNt,Equals:ENt,Errors:CNt,Format:ANt,Inactive:INt,Info:DNt,JWKS:LNt,Key:"Clé",Name:"Nom",None:PNt,Notifications:NNt,Operator:RNt,Operators:MNt,Path:FNt,Preferences:BNt,Preview:$Nt,Properties:jNt,Property:WNt,Provided:UNt,Provider:qNt,Providers:VNt,Ready:HNt,Remove:GNt,Retry:KNt,Save:YNt,Scheme:ZNt,Scope:QNt,Status:XNt,Subject:eRt,Success:tRt,Tags:nRt,Templates:aRt,Theme:iRt,Today:rRt,Undo:oRt,Update:sRt,Validating:lRt,Value:cRt,Values:uRt,Visual:dRt,Warning:pRt,Warnings:mRt,Workload:hRt,and:"et",default:gRt,hours:TNt,optional:zNt,or:"ou",path:ONt,scheme:JNt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),fRt="Tindakan",yRt="Aktif",bRt="Tambahkan",wRt="Terapkan",SRt="Verifikasi",_Rt="Batalkan",kRt="Hapus",xRt="Tutup",ERt="Kondisi",CRt="Dikonfigurasi",ARt="Konfirmasikan",TRt="Berisi",IRt="Dibuat",DRt="Hapus",LRt="Deskripsi",PRt="Detail",NRt="Nonaktifkan",RRt="Abaikan",MRt="Edit",zRt="Pengeditan",ORt="Aktifkan",FRt="Sama dengan",BRt="Kesalahan",$Rt="Format",jRt="Tidak aktif",WRt="Info",URt="JWKS",qRt="Kunci",VRt="Nama",HRt="Tidak ada",GRt="Notifikasi",KRt="Operator",YRt="Operator",JRt="opsional",ZRt="atau",QRt="jalur",XRt="Jalur",eMt="Preferensi",tMt="Pratinjau",nMt="Properti",aMt="Properti",iMt="Disediakan",rMt="Penyedia",oMt="Penyedia",sMt="Siap",lMt="Hapus",cMt="Coba lagi",uMt="Simpan",dMt="skema",pMt="Skema",mMt="Lingkup",hMt="Status",gMt="Subjek",vMt="Berhasil",fMt="Templat",yMt="Tema",bMt="Hari ini",wMt="Batalkan",SMt="Perbarui",_Mt="Memvalidasi",kMt="Nilai",xMt="Nilai",EMt="Visual",CMt="Peringatan",AMt="Peringatan",TMt="Beban kerja",IMt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}' tidak ada di akun Anda","(earliest)":"(terawal)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag ditambahkan atau diubah","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag ditambahkan atau diubah","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identitas","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identitas","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} disalin","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} gagal disalin","{{label}} template":"Templat {{label}}","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} kecocokan","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} kecocokan","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} tag dihapus","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} tag dihapus","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} templat","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} templat","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 hingga 48 jam, dalam jam penuh. Penerbitan biasanya jauh lebih cepat, tetapi dapat memerlukan waktu hingga 24 jam.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Pilih semua kotak centang untuk mengonfirmasi dampak dari penghapusan {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Konfirmasikan bahwa Anda ingin menghapus penyedia ini dengan mengetik {{providerName}} di bawah ini.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Penolakan, dan hanya untuk administrator terdelegasi","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"Penyedia adalah penerbit dan batas kepercayaan untuk identitas beban kerja di bawahnya. Satu penyedia mencakup identitas yang dihasilkan templat dan identitas yang Anda deklarasikan secara manual.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"Pemilik sumber daya dapat memberikan akses ke nama sebelum beban kerjanya online.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Tag adalah label yang Anda berikan pada sumber daya AWS. Setiap tag terdiri dari kunci dan nilai opsional. Gunakan tag untuk mencari dan memfilter penyedia ini, atau untuk melacak biaya AWS Anda.","A template with this name already exists.":"Templat dengan nama ini sudah ada.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Akses API partner, titik akhir SaaS, atau layanan OIDC. Tidak perlu pengaturan.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Akses jala layanan, basis data, atau sistem on-premise.","Access denied":"Akses ditolak","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"Akses yang Anda berikan ke identitas-identitas ini akan berhenti berfungsi","Account scoped":"Lingkup akun",Actions:fRt,"Activating it":"Mengaktifkannya",Active:yRt,Add:bRt,"Add {{label}} template":"Tambahkan templat {{label}}","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Tambahkan setidaknya 1 segmen jalur.","Add attestation rules":"Tambahkan aturan verifikasi","Add condition":"Tambahkan kondisi","Add new tag":"Tambahkan tag baru","Add path segment":"Tambahkan segmen jalur","Add policy":"Tambahkan kebijakan","Add tags":"Tambahkan tag","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke penyedia ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke templat ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Tambahkan tag ke identitas beban kerja ini untuk manajemen biaya dan kontrol akses.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"Tambahkan fakta yang diverifikasi oleh tipe beban kerja ini, sesuai urutan yang seharusnya muncul dalam nama.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"Tag yang ditambahkan atau diubah tidak disimpan","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Semua penandatangan keluar di bawah penyedia ini akan dihapus","All properties":"Semua properti","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Semua templat dan identitas beban kerja di bawah penyedia ini akan dihapus",and:"dan","Any value":"Nilai apa pun",Apply:wRt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN disalin","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"Saat runtime, platform mengesahkan fakta-fakta ini tentang beban kerja. Setiap beban kerja yang pengesahannya memuat fakta-fakta tersebut akan menghasilkan identitas dari templat ini.",Attestation:SRt,"Attestation rules":"Aturan pengesahan","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Aturan pengesahan adalah fakta yang harus dibuktikan oleh beban kerja sebelum penyedia ini mengeluarkan identitas untuk aturan pengesahan tersebut. Platform komputasi menjamin hal tersebut sehingga beban kerja tidak dapat mengklaim identitas yang bukan miliknya.","Attested by":"Diverifikasi oleh","Auto generated identity name":"Nama identitas yang dihasilkan secara otomatis","Automatically generate from a template":"Hasilkan secara otomatis dari templat","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Tersedia untuk setiap akun di organisasi Anda ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Tersedia untuk akun ini ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID akun AWS","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA tidak dapat menyiapkan otoritas sertifikat ini. Hapus otoritas sertifikat tersebut di konsol AWS Private CA, lalu coba lagi.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA membuat otoritas sertifikat untuk IAM dan mengembalikan ID untuk otoritas tersebut.",Cancel:_Rt,"Cannot start with aws:":"Tidak dapat diawali dengan aws:","Certificate authority":"Otoritas sertifikat","Certificate authority created":"Otoritas sertifikat dibuat","Certificate authority ID":"ID otoritas sertifikasi","Certificate authority name":"Nama otoritas sertifikat","Certificate deleted.":"Sertifikat dihapus.","Certificate signer":"Penanda tangan sertifikat","Certificate signer disabled.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat dinonaktifkan.","Certificate signer enabled.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat diaktifkan.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"Penanda tangan sertifikat diperbarui. Rantai sertifikat baru diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan sebelum mengambil alih penandatanganan.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Penandatanganan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikat diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai dalam sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Penandatanganan sertifikat diaktifkan. Rantai sertifikat diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dimulai dalam waktu sekitar {{hours}} jam, setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","Certificate verifier information":"Informasi pemverifikasi sertifikat","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Ubah fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk diberi identitas dari templat ini. Identitas yang sudah dihasilkan oleh templat ini tidak terpengaruh.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Ubah fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk dijalankan sebagai identitas ini. Beban kerja yang sudah memegang sesi menyimpannya sampai sesi berakhir.","Check again":"Periksa lagi","Choose a condition key":"Pilih kunci kondisi","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Pilih jalur dan pola untuk nama. Mulai dari default atau sesuaikan sendiri.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"Pilih nama tertentu untuk beban kerja agar Anda dapat memetakannya ke konvensi Anda sendiri.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Pilih nama tertentu di awal agar Anda dapat memberinya akses atau mencocokkan konvensi penamaan yang ada sebelum beban kerja berjalan.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Pilih kasus penggunaan di atas untuk menambahkan templat.","Choose from this account":"Pilih dari akun ini","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Pilih kunci kondisi untuk digunakan sebagai fakta pengesahan. Platform harus mengesahkan semuanya sebelum templat ini menghasilkan identitas untuk beban kerja.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Pilih fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk diberi identitas dari templat ini. Tidak ada yang dihasilkan darinya sampai Anda melakukannya.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Pilih fakta yang harus diverifikasi oleh beban kerja untuk berjalan sebagai identitas ini. Tidak ada yang dapat dikeluarkan untuknya sampai Anda melakukannya.",Clear:kRt,"Clear filters":"Hapus filter",Close:xRt,"Close modal":"Tutup modal","Code editor":"Editor kode",Condition:ERt,"Condition key":"Kunci kondisi","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Konfigurasikan templat identitas untuk kasus penggunaan beban kerja Anda. Setiap templat menentukan pola jalur yang digunakan untuk menerbitkan identitas secara unik dan fakta yang harus dibuktikan oleh beban kerja sebelum identitas diterbitkan.",Configured:CRt,Confirm:ARt,Contains:TRt,"Continue setup":"Lanjutkan penyiapan","Copy {{label}}":"Salin {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Salin ARN","Copy JSON":"Salin JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Buat templat untuk mengotomatiskan pembuatan identitas","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"Buat identitas untuk memberikan akses sebelum beban kerja berjalan","Create identity":"Buat identitas","Create new":"Buat baru","Create provider":"Buat penyedia","Create template":"Buat templat","Create templates":"Buat templat","Create the certificate authority first.":"Buat otoritas sertifikat terlebih dahulu.","Create workload identities":"Buat identitas beban kerja",Created:IRt,"Created through":"Dibuat melalui","Created time":"Waktu yang dibuat","Created values":"Nilai yang dibuat","Creating certificate authority":"Membuat otoritas sertifikat","Creating the certificate authority":"Membuat otoritas sertifikat","Current CA":"CA saat ini","Current provider":"Penyedia saat ini","Custom tag key":"Kunci tag kustom","Custom tag value":"Nilai tag kustom","Dark themes":"Tema gelap","Default permissions without a policy":"Izin default tanpa kebijakan","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"Tentukan beban kerja mana yang diizinkan untuk dijalankan sebagai nama ini.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Tentukan beban kerja mana yang diizinkan untuk menggunakan templat ini.",Delete:DRt,"Delete certificate?":"Hapus sertifikat?","Delete provider":"Hapus penyedia","Delete provider?":"Hapus penyedia?","Delete template":"Hapus templat","Delete template?":"Hapus templat?","Delete workload identity?":"Hapus identitas beban kerja?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"Menghapus <b>{{templateName}}</b> akan:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"Menghapus <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> akan:",Description:LRt,Details:PRt,Disable:NRt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Nonaktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat?","Discovery expiration time":"Waktu kedaluwarsa penemuan",Dismiss:RRt,"Does not contain":"Tidak berisi","Does not equal":"Tidak sama dengan","Drag or select to resize":"Seret atau pilih untuk mengubah ukuran","Drag to reorder":"Seret untuk mengurutkan ulang","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"Setiap nama identitas menyertakan region dan sumber daya yang menghasilkannya sehingga dua akun tidak dapat menghasilkan nama yang sama.",Edit:MRt,"Edit attestation rules":"Edit aturan verifikasi","Edit filter":"Edit filter","Edit identity path and attestation":"Edit jalur identitas dan pengesahan",Editing:zRt,Enable:ORt,"Enable certificate signer":"Aktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat","Enable certificate signer?":"Aktifkan penanda tangan sertifikat?","End signing time":"Akhir waktu penandatanganan","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Masukkan ID akun AWS 12 digit.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Masukkan ID otoritas sertifikat.","Enter a name":"Masukkan nama","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Masukkan nama untuk otoritas sertifikat.","Enter a path prefix":"Masukkan prefiks jalur","Enter a path prefix value":"Masukkan nilai prefiks jalur","Enter a value":"Masukkan nilai","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Masukkan bilangan bulat jumlah jam dari 1 hingga 48.","Enter key":"Masukkan kunci","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Masukkan ID otoritas sertifikat atau pilih dari bawah","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Masukkan kebijakan sebagai JSON yang valid.","Enter value":"Masukkan nilai",Equals:FRt,Error:"Kesalahan","Error fetching the details":"Terjadi kesalahan saat mengambil detail",Errors:BRt,"Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"Setiap rantai sertifikat yang diterbitkan. Pemverifikasi yang menerima X.509-SVID dari penyedia ini mengambil root-nya dari sini.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"Setiap templat dan identitas beban kerja di bawah {{providerName}} dihapus bersamanya, dan nama identitasnya tidak pernah dikeluarkan ulang. Beban kerja yang bergantung padanya tidak lagi diberikan kredensial.","Failed to copy":"Gagal disalin","Failed to copy JSON":"Gagal menyalin JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Gagal memuat kebijakan verifikasi.","Failed to load templates.":"Gagal memuat templat.","Filter identities":"Filter identitas","Filter providers":"Filter penyedia","Filter templates":"Filter templat","Filter themes":"Filter tema","Find identities":"Temukan identitas","Find providers":"Temukan penyedia","Find templates":"Temukan templat","Find theme":"Temukan tema","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Untuk TLS bersama, lampirkan otoritas sertifikat","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Untuk layanan berbasis token, keluarkan JWT",Format:$Rt,"Generating its key":"Membuat kunci","Get started":"Mulai","Give your workloads an identity":"Berikan identitas pada beban kerja Anda","Govern who can create resources":"Atur siapa yang dapat membuat sumber daya","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Atur siapa yang dapat membuat templat yang merujuk ke penyedia ini","Grant access up front":"Berikan akses di muka","Greater than":"Lebih besar dari","Greater than or equal":"Lebih besar dari atau sama dengan",hours:"jam","How identities are kept unique":"Cara identitas tetap unik",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':'Identitas "{{identityId}}" tidak ditemukan.',"Identity name":"Nama identitas","Identity name pattern":"Pola nama identitas","Identity path and attestation":"Jalur identitas dan pengesahan","Identity selection":"Pemilihan identitas","In transition":"Dalam transisi",Inactive:jRt,"Incoming CA":"CA masuk",Info:WRt,"Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"ID Infrastruktur (ID akun) dalam pola jalur templat","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Kunci tidak valid. Kunci hanya boleh berisi huruf Unicode, digit, spasi, dan salah satu dari karakter berikut ini: _.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"Permintaan tidak valid","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Nilai tidak valid. Nilai hanya dapat berisi huruf Unicode, digit, spasi, dan salah satu dari karakter berikut ini: _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"Menerbitkan X.509-SVID yang digunakan oleh beban kerja penyedia ini sebagai sertifikat klien untuk sistem di luar AWS. Fitur ini memerlukan otoritas sertifikat AWS Private CA yang terafiliasi dengan IAM.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Menerbitkan X.509-SVID, untuk peer mTLS yang memverifikasi sertifikat klien.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Menerbitkan sertifikat CA","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Proses penandatanganan sudah berhenti, tetapi rantainya masih dipublikasikan, jadi beban kerja mengandalkannya untuk memverifikasi kredensial yang dikeluarkan sebelumnya. Menghapusnya sekarang akan menarik rantai sekaligus dan kredensial tersebut mulai gagal. Biarkan saja dan hal tersebut akan menjadi tidak aktif dengan sendirinya, setelah itu menghapusnya tidak mengubah apa pun.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Item dipindahkan dari posisi {{initialPosition}} ke posisi {{finalPosition}} dari {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON disalin",JWKS:URt,"JWKS popover":"Setiap kunci penandatanganan aktif, dipilih oleh kid. AWS memublikasikan kunci baru di sini sebelum penandatanganan beralih ke kunci tersebut.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritma penandatanganan","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritma utama","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Penandatanganan kunci saat ini sejak","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS menghasilkan kunci dan merotasinya sesuai jadwalnya sendiri, memublikasikan setiap kunci baru ke JWKS sebelum mulai menandatangani. Algoritma tetap sama di seluruh rotasi, agar pemverifikasi yang membaca JWKS tidak membutuhkan perubahan di pihak Anda.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Menandatangani JWT-SVID, untuk sistem yang memverifikasi token yang ditandatangani.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Penemuan OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Dokumen penemuan standar. Sebagian besar pemverifikasi hanya membutuhkan URL ini, karena mereka menemukan kunci darinya.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Penerbit OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Klaim iss dari setiap JWT-SVID yang ditandatangani di sini. Pemverifikasi yang menyematkan penerbit akan menyematkan nilai ini.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informasi pemverifikasi token","JWT Outbound signers status":"Default yang disediakan oleh AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Penanda tangan JWT",Key:qRt,"Last updated time":"Waktu terakhir diperbarui","Learn more":"Pelajari selengkapnya","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Pelajari selengkapnya tentang menghapus penyedia (buka di tab baru)","Less than":"Kurang dari","Less than or equal":"Kurang dari atau sama dengan","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Biarkan akun atau principal lain di organisasi Anda membuat templat dan identitas di bawah penyedia ini, dalam prefiks jalur yang Anda pilih.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Biarkan beban kerja menjangkau sumber daya non-AWS","Light themes":"Tema terang","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Baris {{row}}, Kolom {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"Memuat otoritas sertifikat","Loading code editor":"Memuat editor kode","Loading tag keys":"Memuat kunci tag","Loading tag values":"Memuat nilai tag","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Memuat tag yang terkait dengan sumber daya ini","Loading workload identities":"Memuat identitas beban kerja","Manage tags":"Kelola tag","Manage the provider":"Kelola penyedia","Manual creation":"Pembuatan secara manual","Manually create":"Buat secara manual","Manually created identities":"Identitas yang dibuat secara manual","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"Beban kerja yang sesuai mendapatkan nama identitasnya sendiri saat dimulai, pada skala apa pun.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"Akun anggota tidak dapat lagi membuat atau menggunakan apa pun di bawah penyedia ini","Minimum signing delay":"Penundaan penandatanganan minimum","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"Memindahkan penandatanganan ke otoritas sertifikat lain. Rantainya menerbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan sertifikat saat ini masih menandatangani sampai mengambil alih.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Memindahkan item ke posisi {{currentPosition}} dari {{total}}",Name:VRt,"Name must be 256 characters or less.":"Nama harus terdiri dari 256 karakter atau kurang.","Name pattern":"Pola nama","Name pattern values":"Nilai pola nama","Name values":"Nilai nama","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Menamai identitas secara otomatis saat beban kerja dimulai, jadi Anda tidak perlu membuat atau mengelolanya satu per satu.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"Nama yang Anda buat secara manual di bawah penyedia ini. Pemilik sumber daya dapat memberikan akses ke nama sebelum beban kerjanya berjalan.","naming prefix":"prefiks penamaan","Naming scheme":"Skema penamaan","Next month":"Bulan berikutnya","Next page":"Halaman berikutnya","Next step":"Langkah berikutnya","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Tidak ada kebijakan pengesahan yang diatur. Tentukan satu agar beban kerja dapat berjalan sebagai identitas ini.","No by default, but can add a policy":"Tidak secara default, tetapi dapat menambahkan kebijakan","No certificate authorities in this account":"Tidak ada otoritas sertifikat di akun ini","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"Tidak ada kondisi. Tidak ada yang dapat berjalan sebagai identitas ini sampai Anda menambahkan setidaknya 1.","no domain":"tidak ada domain","No match found":"Tidak ada kecocokan yang ditemukan","No matches":"Tidak ada kecocokan","No tags associated with the resource.":"Tidak ada tag yang terkait dengan sumber daya.","No templates added yet":"Belum ada templat yang ditambahkan","No workload identity providers":"Tidak ada penyedia identitas beban kerja","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Tidak ada beban kerja yang cocok dengan templat ini, jadi tidak ada identitas yang dihasilkan.","No, and cannot be granted":"Tidak, dan tidak dapat diberikan",None:HRt,"Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Tidak disimpan: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Tidak diatur",Notifications:GRt,"Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus penyedia tingkat organisasi.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus templat tingkat organisasi.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Hanya akun manajemen atau administrator terdelegasi yang dapat menghapus identitas beban kerja tingkat organisasi.","Open in AWS Private CA":"Buka di AWS Private CA",Operator:KRt,Operators:YRt,optional:JRt,or:ZRt,"Organization scoped":"Lingkup organisasi","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Atur penyedia dan lacak biayanya dengan tag.","Other accounts in your organization":"Akun lain di organisasi Anda","Other condition keys":"Kunci kondisi lainnya","Outbound signers":"Penandatangan outbound","Outbound signers page desc":"Penanda tangan keluar menandatangani kredensial yang disajikan beban kerja penyedia ini ke sistem di luar AWS. Mengakses AWS itu sendiri tidak membutuhkan penanda tangan: beban kerja sudah memiliki SigV4 untuk hal tersebut.","Outbound signers page title":"Penanda tangan keluar","Owning account":"Akun pemilik","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Halaman {{pageNumber}} dari semua halaman",path:QRt,Path:XRt,"path from templates":"jalur dari templat","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Jalur adalah bagian nama identitas khusus untuk setiap beban kerja. Jalur ini diisi saat runtime berdasarkan fakta yang dibuktikan oleh beban kerja.","Path pattern":"Pola jalur","Path prefix":"Prefiks jalur","Path segment {{index}}":"Segmen jalur {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Item yang diambil pada posisi {{position}} dari {{total}}","Policy details":"Detail kebijakan","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Kebijakan: Tentukan bagaimana beban kerja memverifikasi untuk mendapatkan identitas",Preferences:eMt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Gunakan spasi atau enter untuk mengaktifkan seret, gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah, lalu tekan spasi atau enter untuk mengonfirmasi",Preview:tMt,"Previous CA":"CA sebelumnya","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Sertifikat sebelumnya ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Bulan sebelumnya","Previous page":"Halaman sebelumnya",Properties:nMt,Property:aMt,Provided:iMt,Provider:rMt,"Provider name":"Nama penyedia","Provider not found":"Penyedia tidak ditemukan","Provider overview":"Gambaran umum penyedia","Provider selection":"Pemilihan penyedia","Provider settings":"Pengaturan penyedia","Provider values":"Nilai penyedia",Providers:oMt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"Menerbitkan ke paket kepercayaan. Penandatanganan dimulai setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","Quick create":"Buat cepat",Ready:sMt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Direkomendasikan untuk sebagian besar beban kerja","Refresh certificate authorities":"Segarkan otoritas sertifikat",Remove:lMt,"Remove {{name}}":"Hapus {{name}}","Remove condition":"Hapus kondisi","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Hapus filter {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Hapus kebijakan tata kelola?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Hapus tag {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"Tag yang dihapus tidak disimpan","Reordering canceled":"Pengurutan ulang dibatalkan","Resize handle":"Handel ubah ukuran","Restricted by":"Dibatasi oleh",Retry:cMt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Tinjau tag dan simpan lagi.",Save:uMt,"Save changes":"Simpan perubahan",scheme:dMt,Scheme:pMt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Skema menentukan format yang digunakan penyedia ini untuk memberi nama identitas.",Scope:mMt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"Cakupan menentukan akun mana yang diizinkan untuk menggunakan penyedia ini.","Scope values":"Nilai lingkup","Search tags":"Cari tag","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmen yang melakukan partisi identitas.","Select {{name}}":"Pilih {{name}}",Set:"Atur","Set a naming pattern":"Atur pola penamaan","Set an attestation rule":"Atur aturan verifikasi","Set by your provider.":"Diatur oleh penyedia Anda.","Set the name":"Atur nama","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"Tetapkan pola jalur unik dan aturan pengesahan yang digunakan oleh setiap identitas beban kerja yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Siapkan cara untuk mengeluarkan identitas beban kerja","Set up for your use cases":"Siapkan untuk kasus penggunaan Anda","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"Penyiapan otoritas sertifikat dihentikan. Anda dapat melanjutkan dari bagian terakhir.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Pengaturan dari penyedia Anda {{providerName}}","Show fewer":"Tampilkan lebih sedikit","Show more":"Tampilkan lebih banyak","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"Menandatangani sertifikat baru, dan diterbitkan dalam paket kepercayaan.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"Penandatanganan dilanjutkan segera, karena sertifikat ini masih diterbitkan dalam paket kepercayaan.","Signing start time":"Waktu mulai penandatanganan","Something went wrong":"Terjadi kesalahan",Status:hMt,"Status bar":"Bilah status","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Hentikan akses yang Anda berikan ke nama identitas ini agar tidak berfungsi","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Hentikan akses yang Anda berikan ke nama-nama identitas tersebut agar tidak berfungsi","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Hentikan pencocokan beban kerja untuk mendapatkan identitas, agar gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Hentikan identitas yang dihasilkannya agar tidak dapat diselesaikan","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Hentikan beban kerja yang berjalan sebagai identitas ini, agar gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"Berhenti menandatangani dan tidak ada lagi dalam paket kepercayaan, jadi tidak ada yang memverifikasi terhadapnya. Menghapusnya merupakan tindakan yang aman.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"Berhenti menandatangani dan tidak ada lagi dalam paket kepercayaan.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"Berhenti menandatangani, tetapi masih dipublikasikan dalam paket kepercayaan, agar sertifikat yang diterbitkan sebelumnya masih dapat diverifikasi.",Subject:gMt,Success:vMt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Kunci tag tidak dapat diambil","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Nilai tag tidak dapat diambil",Tags:"Tag","Tags could not be loaded":"Tag tidak dapat dimuat","Tags not saved":"Tag tidak disimpan",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':'Templat "{{templateId}}" tidak ditemukan.',"Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Templat {{templateName}} dihapus.","Template name":"Nama templat","Template name values":"Nilai nama templat","Template: {{name}}":"Templat: {{name}}",Templates:fMt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"Templat secara otomatis memberikan nama identitas tersendiri bagi beban kerja yang sesuai. Setiap templat menggunakan prefiks nama penyedia ini, ditambah jalur dan pola.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"Akun yang memiliki otoritas sertifikat.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"Verifikatur menjamin beban kerja, dan beban kerja tersebut harus memenuhi setiap kondisi agar identitas dapat dikeluarkan dari templat ini.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"Attester menjamin beban kerja, dan beban kerja tersebut harus memenuhi setiap kondisi agar dapat berjalan sebagai identitas ini.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"Otoritas sertifikat masih disiapkan.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"ID di akhir ARN otoritas sertifikat di AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Nama identitas terdiri dari skema penamaan penyedia, prefiks jalur, dan pola jalur.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Jumlah maksimum karakter yang dapat Anda gunakan dalam kunci tag adalah 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Jumlah maksimum karakter yang dapat Anda gunakan dalam nilai tag adalah 256.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"Prefiks jalur yang diizinkan oleh kebijakan Anda","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Izin yang ditentukan dalam kebijakan ini untuk <b>{{providerName}}</b> berhenti diterapkan.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"Paling cepat sertifikat ini dapat mulai menandatangani. Rantai sertifikat tersebut diterbitkan ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, agar setiap pemverifikasi dapat memeriksanya sebelum ada yang ditandatangani di bawahnya. Penandatanganan mungkin dimulai lebih lambat dari ini, tidak lebih cepat.",Theme:yMt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Terjadi kesalahan saat memuat editor kode.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Akun ini ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"Tindakan ini menghapus penyedia identitas beban kerja {{providerName}} dan semua yang dikonfigurasi di bawahnya.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"Tindakan ini menghapus penyedia identitas beban kerja <b>{{providerName}}</b> dan semua yang dikonfigurasi di bawahnya.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan membuat penyedia dengan nama yang sama nanti tidak mengembalikan apa pun. Untuk melanjutkan, selesaikan langkah-langkah di bawah ini.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan jalur yang dipesan templat ini tetap terpesan. Tidak ada templat masa mendatang yang dapat menghasilkan identitas di bawahnya.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Ini tidak dapat dibatalkan, dan nama ini tetap terpesan. Nama tersebut tidak akan pernah diterbitkan lagi, jadi Anda tidak dapat membuat ulang identitas ini dengan nama yang sama.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"Otoritas sertifikat ini hanya berfungsi di AS Timur (Virginia Utara) us-east-1. Untuk menggunakannya di Region lain, replikasikan otoritas sertifikat tersebut di konsol AWS Private CA.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Sertifikat ini sedang divalidasi, jadi menghapusnya akan segera menghentikan verifikasi","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"Rantai sertifikat ini diterbitkan lagi ke paket kepercayaan terlebih dahulu, dan penandatanganan dilanjutkan setelah setiap wilayah memilikinya.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Kombinasi kunci kondisi dan operator ini sudah ada","This management account and delegated administrators":"Akun manajemen ini dan administrator terdelegasi","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Organisasi ini ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"Penyedia ini berhenti menerbitkan X.509-SVID segera, dan beban kerja yang membutuhkan sertifikat klien akan mulai gagal pada permintaan berikutnya. Sertifikat di bawah ini tetap dikonfigurasi. Sertifikat yang sudah diterbitkan masih dapat diverifikasi selama sekitar 12 jam, dan Aktifkan melanjutkan penandatanganan.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Ini menghapus sertifikat dari penyedia dan segera menarik rantainya dari paket kepercayaan. Otoritas sertifikat itu sendiri tetap berada di AWS Private CA, tidak berubah.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Ini menghapus sertifikat dari penyedia. Rantainya sudah tidak ada dalam paket kepercayaan, jadi tidak ada perubahan pada proses verifikasi yang berlangsung saat ini. Otoritas sertifikat itu sendiri tetap berada di AWS Private CA, tidak berubah.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Tag ini akan dihapus setelah perubahan disimpan","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Proses ini biasanya memerlukan waktu beberapa menit. Biarkan halaman ini tetap terbuka hingga proses selesai.",Today:bMt,"Too many requests":"Terlalu banyak permintaan","Trust bundle endpoint":"Titik akhir paket kepercayaan","trust domain":"domain kepercayaan","Trust domain":"Domain kepercayaan","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Domain kepercayaan adalah akar kepercayaan untuk skema penamaan SPIFFE. Domain ini merupakan nama logis yang mengikuti gaya penamaan DNS, misalnya prod.acme.com, tetapi tidak harus cocok dengan catatan DNS yang sebenarnya.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Coba lagi. Jika masalah berlanjut, hubungi Dukungan AWS.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Dua akun tidak boleh dapat menghasilkan nama identitas yang sama.","Unable to load templates":"Tidak dapat memuat templat",Undo:wMt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"Prefiks unik untuk jalur yang berbeda",Update:SMt,"Update certificate signer":"Perbarui penanda tangan sertifikat",'Use "{{key}}"':'Gunakan "{{key}}"','Use "{{value}}"':'Gunakan "{{value}}"',"Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"Gunakan prefiks jalur yang dikenali organisasi Anda, seperti area bisnis atau tim. Prefiks tersebut harus unik di seluruh organisasi Anda. Anda dapat menulis kebijakan yang mengatur akun mana yang dapat menerbitkan identitas di bawah prefiks ini.","Use cases":"Kasus penggunaan","Use one from another account":"Gunakan satu dari akun lain",'Use: "{{text}}"':'Gunakan: "{{text}}"',"Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Digunakan sebagai nama umum dalam subjek otoritas sertifikat.",Validating:_Mt,Value:kMt,Values:xMt,"View all":"Lihat semua","View all notifications":"Lihat semua notifikasi","View JSON":"Lihat JSON",Visual:EMt,Warning:CMt,Warnings:AMt,"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Tanpa kebijakan, tidak ada akun lain yang dapat membuat templat di bawah penyedia ini, meskipun administrator terdelegasi sudah dapat membuat keduanya. Tambahkan pernyataan untuk setiap akun, unit organisasi, atau principal IAM yang seharusnya dapat melakukannya, dan batasi masing-masing ke prefiks jalur.",Workload:TMt,"Workload identities":"Identitas beban kerja","Workload identity":"Identitas beban kerja","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identitas beban kerja {{workloadIdentifier}} dihapus.","Workload identity providers":"Penyedia identitas untuk beban kerja","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Identitas beban kerja: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"Beban kerja diberi nama secara otomatis","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di akun ini dapat menggunakan identitas yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini menggunakan informasi yang diverifikasi oleh {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Beban kerja yang berjalan di organisasi Anda dapat menggunakan identitas yang dihasilkan oleh templat ini menggunakan informasi yang diverifikasi oleh {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Beban kerja yang menggunakan identitas ini akan berhenti diberikan kredensial, dan gagal pada permintaan berikutnya","Wrap lines":"Bungkus baris","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Tulis kebijakan untuk mengizinkan akun lain membuat templat, atau untuk menghentikan administrator terdelegasi dari bagian ruang nama. Setiap pernyataan memberi nama unit organisasi, akun tertentu, atau principal IAM individu, mengizinkan atau menolak, dan dapat dibatasi pada prefiks jalur.","Yes by default":"Ya secara default","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Anda dapat menambahkan hingga {{availableTags}} tag lagi.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Anda dapat menambahkan hingga {{availableTags}} tag lagi.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"Anda memilih prefiks per kasus penggunaan, dan nama membawa prefiks tersebut sebagai gantinya. Nama lebih pendek, dan prefiks harus unik di seluruh organisasi Anda.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Anda telah melampaui batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Anda telah melampaui batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Kunci yang Anda miliki lebih banyak dari yang dapat ditampilkan","You have more values than can be displayed":"Nilai yang Anda miliki lebih banyak dari yang dapat ditampilkan","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Anda telah mencapai batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Anda telah mencapai batas {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Anda memiliki perubahan tag yang belum disimpan. Tinggalkan halaman ini dan buang perubahan tersebut?","You must choose a path segment":"Anda harus memilih segmen jalur","You must specify a condition key":"Anda harus menentukan kunci kondisi","You must specify a tag key":"Anda harus menentukan kunci tag","You must specify a unique tag key.":"Anda harus menentukan kunci tag unik.","You must specify a value":"Anda harus menentukan nilai","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Administrator Anda menentukan prefiks mana yang dapat digunakan akun ini. Ini diperiksa saat Anda membuat.","YYYY/MM/DD":"HH/BB/TTTT","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},DMt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:fRt,Active:yRt,Add:bRt,Apply:wRt,Attestation:SRt,Cancel:_Rt,Clear:kRt,Close:xRt,Condition:ERt,Configured:CRt,Confirm:ARt,Contains:TRt,Created:IRt,Delete:DRt,Description:LRt,Details:PRt,Disable:NRt,Dismiss:RRt,Edit:MRt,Editing:zRt,Enable:ORt,Equals:FRt,Errors:BRt,Format:$Rt,Inactive:jRt,Info:WRt,JWKS:URt,Key:qRt,Name:VRt,None:HRt,Notifications:GRt,Operator:KRt,Operators:YRt,Path:XRt,Preferences:eMt,Preview:tMt,Properties:nMt,Property:aMt,Provided:iMt,Provider:rMt,Providers:oMt,Ready:sMt,Remove:lMt,Retry:cMt,Save:uMt,Scheme:pMt,Scope:mMt,Status:hMt,Subject:gMt,Success:vMt,Tags:"Tag",Templates:fMt,Theme:yMt,Today:bMt,Undo:wMt,Update:SMt,Validating:_Mt,Value:kMt,Values:xMt,Visual:EMt,Warning:CMt,Warnings:AMt,Workload:TMt,and:"dan",default:IMt,hours:"jam",optional:JRt,or:ZRt,path:QRt,scheme:dMt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),LMt="Operazioni",PMt="Attivo",NMt="Aggiungi",RMt="Applica",MMt="Attestazione",zMt="Annulla",OMt="Cancella",FMt="Chiudi",BMt="Condizione",$Mt="Configurato",jMt="Conferma",WMt="Contiene",UMt="Creato",qMt="Elimina",VMt="Descrizione",HMt="Dettagli",GMt="Disabilita",KMt="Ignora",YMt="Modifica",JMt="Modifica in corso",ZMt="Attiva",QMt="Uguale a",XMt="Errori",ezt="Formato",tzt="Inattivo",nzt="Informazioni",azt="JWKS",izt="Chiave",rzt="Nome",ozt="Nessuno",szt="Notifiche",lzt="Operatore",czt="Operatori",uzt="facoltativo",dzt="percorso",pzt="Percorso",mzt="Preferenze",hzt="Anteprima",gzt="Proprietà",vzt="Proprietà",fzt="Fornito",yzt="Provider",bzt="Fornitori",wzt="Pronto",Szt="Rimuovi",_zt="Riprova",kzt="Salva",xzt="Schema",Ezt="Schema",Czt="Ambito",Azt="Stato",Tzt="Oggetto",Izt="Completato correttamente",Dzt="Modelli",Lzt="Tema",Pzt="Oggi",Nzt="Annulla",Rzt="Aggiorna",Mzt="Convalida in corso",zzt="Valore",Ozt="Valori",Fzt="Visivo",Bzt="Avviso",$zt="Avvisi",jzt="Carico di lavoro",Wzt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}” non esiste nel tuo account","(earliest)":"(il più vecchio)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tag aggiunto o modificato","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} tags aggiunti o modificati","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} identità","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} identità","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} copiato","{{label}} failed to copy":"Impossibile copiare {{label}}","{{label}} template":"{{label}} modello","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} corrispondenza","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} corrispondenze","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} tag rimosso","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} tags rimossi","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} tag","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} modello","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} modelli","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"Da 1 a 48 ore, in ore intere. La pubblicazione è in genere molto più veloce, ma può richiedere fino a 24 ore.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. Seleziona tutte le caselle di controllo per confermare le conseguenze dell'eliminazione di {{providerName}}.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. Conferma di voler eliminare questo provider digitando {{providerName}} qui sotto.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"Un rifiuto, e solo per gli amministratori delegati","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"Un provider funge da emittente e da confine di attendibilità per le identità dei carichi di lavoro a esso associate. Un singolo provider gestisce sia le identità generate da un modello, sia quelle dichiarate manualmente.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"Il proprietario di una risorsa può concedere l’accesso al nome prima che il carico di lavoro sia online.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"Un tag è un’etichetta che viene assegnata a una risorsa AWS. Ogni tag è composto da una chiave e da un valore facoltativo. È possibile utilizzare i tag per cercare e filtrare questo provider o per monitorare i costi di AWS.","A template with this name already exists.":"Esiste già un modello con questo nome.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"Accedi a un’API partner, a un endpoint SaaS o a un servizio OIDC. Non è necessaria alcuna configurazione.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"Accedi a una mesh di servizi, a un database o a un sistema on-premises.","Access denied":"Accesso negato","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"L’accesso che hai concesso a queste identità smetterà di funzionare","Account scoped":"Con ambito a livello di account",Actions:LMt,"Activating it":"Attivazione in corso",Active:PMt,Add:NMt,"Add {{label}} template":"Aggiungi {{label}} modello","Add at least 1 path segment.":"Aggiungi almeno 1 segmento di percorso.","Add attestation rules":"Aggiungi regole di attestazione","Add condition":"Aggiungi condizione","Add new tag":"Aggiungi nuovo tag","Add path segment":"Aggiungi segmento di percorso","Add policy":"Aggiungi policy","Add tags":"Aggiungi tag","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questo provider per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questo modello per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"Aggiungi tag a questa identità del carico di lavoro per la gestione dei costi e il controllo degli accessi.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"Aggiungi i fatti attestati da questo tipo di carico di lavoro, nell’ordine in cui devono apparire nel nome.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"I tag aggiunti o modificati non sono stati salvati","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"Tutti i firmatari in uscita con questo provider verranno eliminati","All properties":"Tutte le proprietà","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"Tutti i modelli e le identità dei carichi di lavoro di questo provider verranno eliminati",and:"e","Any value":"Qualsiasi valore",Apply:RMt,ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN copiato","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"In fase di runtime, la piattaforma attesta questi fatti relativi al carico di lavoro. Qualsiasi carico di lavoro la cui attestazione li comporta genera un’identità da questo modello.",Attestation:MMt,"Attestation rules":"Regole di attestazione","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"Le regole di attestazione sono i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve dimostrare prima che questo provider gli conferisca un’identità. La piattaforma di calcolo li garantisce, quindi un carico di lavoro non può rivendicare un’identità che non sia la sua.","Attested by":"Attestato da","Auto generated identity name":"Nome di identità generato automaticamente","Automatically generate from a template":"Genera automaticamente da un modello","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"Disponibile per tutti gli account della tua organizzazione ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"Disponibile per questo account ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"ID account AWS","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA non è riuscita a configurare questa autorità di certificazione. Eliminala nella console AWS Private CA e riprova.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA crea un’autorità di certificazione per IAM e ne restituisce un ID.",Cancel:zMt,"Cannot start with aws:":"Non può iniziare con aws:","Certificate authority":"Autorità del certificato","Certificate authority created":"Autorità di certificazione creata","Certificate authority ID":"ID autorità di certificazione","Certificate authority name":"Nome autorità di certificazione","Certificate deleted.":"Certificato eliminato.","Certificate signer":"Firmatario del certificato","Certificate signer disabled.":"Firmatario del certificato disabilitato.","Certificate signer enabled.":"Firmatario del certificato abilitato.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"Firmatario del certificato aggiornato. La nuova catena di certificati viene pubblicata nel trust bundle prima che subentri alla firma.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"Firma del certificato abilitata. La catena di certificati viene prima pubblicata nel trust bundle e la firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ora, una volta disponibile in ogni regione.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"Firma del certificato abilitata. La catena di certificati effettua prima la pubblicazione nel trust bundle e la firma inizia dopo circa {{hours}} ore, una volta disponibile in ogni regione.","Certificate verifier information":"Informazioni sul verificatore del certificato","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"Modifica i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per ricevere un’identità da questo modello. Le identità che questo modello ha già generato non vengono modificate.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"Modifica le informazioni che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per operare con questa identità. Un carico di lavoro che dispone già di una sessione la mantiene fino alla scadenza della sessione.","Check again":"Ricontrolla","Choose a condition key":"Scegli una chiave condizionale","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"Scegli un percorso e uno schema per i nomi. Inizia da un'impostazione predefinita o personalizza la tua.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"Scegli un nome specifico per il carico di lavoro in modo da poterlo associare alle tue convenzioni.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"Scegli un nome specifico in anticipo in modo da potergli concedere l’accesso o abbinare una convenzione di denominazione esistente prima dell’esecuzione del carico di lavoro.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"Scegli un caso d’uso qui sopra per aggiungere un modello.","Choose from this account":"Scegli da questo account","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"Scegli le chiavi di condizione da utilizzare come fatti di attestazione. La piattaforma deve attestarli tutti prima che questo modello crei un’identità per un carico di lavoro.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"Scegli i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per ottenere l’identità da questo modello. Non verrà generato nulla da esso finché non lo avrai fatto.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"Scegli le informazioni che un carico di lavoro deve aver attestato per operare con questa identità. Non è possibile emettere alcun elemento finché non lo fai.",Clear:OMt,"Clear filters":"Cancella filtri",Close:FMt,"Close modal":"Chiudi modale","Code editor":"Editor di codice",Condition:BMt,"Condition key":"Chiave di condizione","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"Configura i modelli di identità per i casi d’uso del tuo carico di lavoro. Ogni modello definisce un modello di percorso utilizzato per emettere identità in modo univoco e i fatti che un carico di lavoro deve dimostrare prima che venga emessa un’identità.",Configured:$Mt,Confirm:jMt,Contains:WMt,"Continue setup":"Continua la configurazione","Copy {{label}}":"Copia {{label}}","Copy ARN":"Copia ARN","Copy JSON":"Copia JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"Crea un modello per automatizzare la generazione di identità","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"Crea un’identità per concedere l’accesso prima dell’esecuzione di un carico di lavoro","Create identity":"Crea identità","Create new":"Crea nuovo","Create provider":"Crea un provider","Create template":"Crea un modello","Create templates":"Crea modelli","Create the certificate authority first.":"Crea prima l’autorità di certificazione.","Create workload identities":"Crea identità per i carichi di lavoro",Created:UMt,"Created through":"Creato tramite","Created time":"Ora di creazione","Created values":"Valori creati","Creating certificate authority":"Creazione dell’autorità di certificazione","Creating the certificate authority":"Creazione dell’autorità di certificazione in corso","Current CA":"CA corrente","Current provider":"Provider attuale","Custom tag key":"Chiave di tag personalizzata","Custom tag value":"Valore di tag personalizzato","Dark themes":"Temi scuri","Default permissions without a policy":"Autorizzazioni predefinite senza una policy","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"Definisci quale carico di lavoro può essere eseguito con questo nome.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"Definisci quali carichi di lavoro sono autorizzati a utilizzare questo modello.",Delete:qMt,"Delete certificate?":"Eliminare il certificato?","Delete provider":"Elimina il provider","Delete provider?":"Eliminare il provider?","Delete template":"Elimina modello","Delete template?":"Eliminare il modello?","Delete workload identity?":"Eliminare l’identità del carico di lavoro?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"L’eliminazione di <b>{{templateName}}</b> comporterà:","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"L’eliminazione di <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> comporterà:",Description:VMt,Details:HMt,Disable:GMt,"Disable certificate signer?":"Disabilitare il firmatario del certificato?","Discovery expiration time":"Ora di scadenza di Discovery",Dismiss:KMt,"Does not contain":"Non contiene","Does not equal":"Non è uguale","Drag or select to resize":"Trascina o seleziona per ridimensionare","Drag to reorder":"Trascina per riordinare","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"Ogni nome di identità riporta la regione e la risorsa che lo ha prodotto, quindi due account non possono generare lo stesso nome.",Edit:YMt,"Edit attestation rules":"Modifica regole di attestazione","Edit filter":"Modifica filtro","Edit identity path and attestation":"Modifica il percorso di identità e l’attestazione",Editing:JMt,Enable:ZMt,"Enable certificate signer":"Abilita il firmatario del certificato","Enable certificate signer?":"Abilitare il firmatario del certificato?","End signing time":"Ora di fine della firma","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"Inserisci un ID account AWS di 12 cifre.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"Inserisci un ID autorità di certificazione.","Enter a name":"Inserisci un nome","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"Inserisci un nome per l’autorità di certificazione.","Enter a path prefix":"Inserisci un valore di prefisso del percorso","Enter a path prefix value":"Inserisci un valore di prefisso del percorso","Enter a value":"Inserisci un valore","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"Inserisci un numero intero di ore compreso tra 1 e 48.","Enter key":"Inserisci la chiave","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"Inserisci l’ID di un’autorità di certificazione o scegli una delle seguenti opzioni","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"Inserisci la policy come JSON valido.","Enter value":"Inserisci un valore",Equals:QMt,Error:"Errore","Error fetching the details":"Errore durante il recupero dei dettagli",Errors:XMt,"Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"Ogni catena di certificati pubblicata. Un verificatore che accetta gli X.509-SVID di questo provider recupera le sue radici da qui.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"Tutti i modelli e le identità del carico di lavoro contenuti in {{providerName}} vengono eliminati e i relativi nomi di identità non vengono mai riemessi. I carichi di lavoro che si basano su di essi non ricevono più credenziali.","Failed to copy":"Copia non riuscita","Failed to copy JSON":"Impossibile copiare JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"Impossibile caricare la policy di attestazione.","Failed to load templates.":"Impossibile caricare i modelli.","Filter identities":"Filtra le identità","Filter providers":"Filtra i provider","Filter templates":"Filtra i modelli","Filter themes":"Filtra temi","Find identities":"Trova le identità","Find providers":"Trova i provider","Find templates":"Trova modelli","Find theme":"Trova il tema","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"Per il TLS reciproco, collega un’autorità di certificazione","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"Per i servizi basati su token, emetti un JWT",Format:ezt,"Generating its key":"Generazione della relativa chiave in corso","Get started":"Inizia","Give your workloads an identity":"Assegna un’identità ai tuoi carichi di lavoro","Govern who can create resources":"Stabilisci chi può creare risorse","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"Stabilisci chi può creare modelli riferiti a questo provider","Grant access up front":"Concedi l’accesso in anticipo","Greater than":"Maggiore di","Greater than or equal":"Maggiore o uguale",hours:"ore","How identities are kept unique":"In che modo le identità vengono mantenute univoche",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"Identità “{{identityId}}” non trovata.","Identity name":"Nome dell'identità","Identity name pattern":"Modello del nome di identità","Identity path and attestation":"Percorso di identità e attestazione","Identity selection":"Selezione dell’identità","In transition":"In transizione",Inactive:tzt,"Incoming CA":"CA in arrivo",Info:nzt,"Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"ID dell’infrastruttura (ID account) nel modello di percorso","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Chiave non valida. Le chiavi possono contenere solo lettere Unicode, cifre, spazi bianchi e uno dei seguenti simboli: _.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"Richiesta non valida","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"Valore non valido. I valori possono contenere solo lettere Unicode, cifre, spazi bianchi e uno dei seguenti simboli: _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"Emette gli X.509-SVID che i carichi di lavoro di questo provider presentano come certificati client verso sistemi esterni ad AWS. Richiede un’autorità di certificazione AWS Private CA associata a IAM.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"Emette X.509-SVID, per i peer mTLS che verificano un certificato client.","Issuing its CA certificate":"Emissione del relativo certificato CA in corso","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"Ha smesso di firmare, ma la sua catena è ancora pubblicata, quindi i carichi di lavoro si affidano a essa per verificare le credenziali rilasciate in precedenza. Eliminarla ora rimuove subito la catena e quelle credenziali iniziano a non funzionare. Se invece la si lascia stare, diventa inattiva da sola; a quel punto, eliminarla non cambia nulla.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"Elemento spostato dalla posizione {{initialPosition}} alla posizione {{finalPosition}} di {{total}}","JSON copied":"JSON copiato",JWKS:azt,"JWKS popover":"Ogni chiave di firma attiva, selezionata tramite kid. AWS pubblica qui una nuova chiave prima che la firma passi a essa.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"Algoritmo di firma","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"Algoritmi chiave","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"Firma chiave attuale dal","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS genera le chiavi e le ruota secondo una propria pianificazione, pubblicando ogni nuova chiave nel JWKS prima che inizi la firma. Gli algoritmi rimangono invariati durante una rotazione, quindi un verificatore che legge il JWKS non richiede alcuna modifica da parte tua.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"Firma JWT-SVID, per i sistemi che verificano token firmati.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"Scoperta OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"Il documento di individuazione standard. La maggior parte dei verificatori ha bisogno solo di questo URL, perché ne trovano le chiavi.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"Emittente OIDC","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"Il claim iss di ogni JWT-SVID firmato qui. Un verificatore che fissa un emittente fissa questo valore.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"Informazioni sul verificatore del token","JWT Outbound signers status":"Predefinito fornito da AWS","JWT Outbound signers title":"Firmatario JWT",Key:izt,"Last updated time":"Ora dell’ultimo aggiornamento","Learn more":"Scopri di più","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"Scopri di più sull’eliminazione di un provider (si apre in una nuova scheda)","Less than":"Minore di","Less than or equal":"Minore o uguale","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"Consenti ad altri account o principali della tua organizzazione di creare modelli e identità con questo provider, all’interno dei prefissi di percorso scelti.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"Consenti ai carichi di lavoro di raggiungere risorse non AWS","Light themes":"Temi chiari","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"Riga {{row}}, Colonna {{column}}\n        ","Loading certificate authorities":"Caricamento delle autorità di certificazione","Loading code editor":"Caricamento dell’editor di codice in corso","Loading tag keys":"Caricamento delle chiavi di tag in corso","Loading tag values":"Caricamento dei valori di tag in corso","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"Caricamento dei tag associati a questa risorsa","Loading workload identities":"Caricamento delle identità dei carichi di lavoro","Manage tags":"Gestisci i tag","Manage the provider":"Gestisci il provider","Manual creation":"Creazione manuale","Manually create":"Crea manualmente","Manually created identities":"Identità create manualmente","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"I carichi di lavoro corrispondenti ottengono il proprio nome identificativo nel momento in cui iniziano, su qualsiasi scala.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"Gli account membri non possono più creare o utilizzare nulla con questo provider","Minimum signing delay":"Ritardo minimo per la firma","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"Sposta la firma a un’altra autorità di certificazione. La catena esegue prima la pubblicazione nel trust bundle e il certificato corrente continua a firmare finché non subentra.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"Spostamento dell'elemento nella posizione {{currentPosition}} di {{total}}",Name:rzt,"Name must be 256 characters or less.":"Il nome deve contenere al massimo 256 caratteri.","Name pattern":"Schema del nome","Name pattern values":"Valori degli schemi di denominazione","Name values":"Valori dei nomi","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"Assegna un nome alle identità automaticamente all’avvio dei carichi di lavoro in modo da non doverle creare o gestire una per una.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"Nomi creati manualmente con questo provider. Il proprietario di una risorsa può concedere l’accesso a un nome prima dell’esecuzione del carico di lavoro.","naming prefix":"prefisso di denominazione","Naming scheme":"Schema di denominazione","Next month":"Mese successivo","Next page":"Pagina successiva","Next step":"Fase successiva","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"Nessuna policy di attestazione impostata. Definiscine una affinché un carico di lavoro possa operare con questa identità.","No by default, but can add a policy":"No per impostazione predefinita, ma puoi aggiungere una policy","No certificate authorities in this account":"Nessuna autorità di certificazione in questo account","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"Nessuna condizione. Nulla può essere eseguito con questa identità finché non ne aggiungi almeno una.","no domain":"nessun dominio","No match found":"Nessuna corrispondenza trovata","No matches":"Nessuna corrispondenza","No tags associated with the resource.":"Nessun tag associato alla risorsa.","No templates added yet":"Nessun modello aggiunto","No workload identity providers":"Nessun provider di identità del carico di lavoro","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"Nessun carico di lavoro corrisponde a questo modello, quindi non genera identità.","No, and cannot be granted":"No e non può essere concesso",None:ozt,"Not saved: {{keys}}.":"Non salvato: {{keys}}.","Not set":"Non impostato",Notifications:szt,"Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare i provider a livello di organizzazione.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare i modelli a livello di organizzazione.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"Solo l’account di gestione o un amministratore delegato può eliminare le identità dei carichi di lavoro a livello di organizzazione.","Open in AWS Private CA":"Apri in AWS Private CA",Operator:lzt,Operators:czt,optional:uzt,or:"o","Organization scoped":"Con ambito a livello di organizzazione","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"Organizza il provider e monitora i suoi costi con i tag.","Other accounts in your organization":"Altri account nella tua organizzazione","Other condition keys":"Altre chiavi di condizione","Outbound signers":"Firmatari in uscita","Outbound signers page desc":"I firmatari in uscita firmano le credenziali che i carichi di lavoro di questo provider presentano ai sistemi esterni ad AWS. Per raggiungere AWS stesso non è necessario alcun firmatario: un carico di lavoro dispone già di SigV4 per questo scopo.","Outbound signers page title":"Firmatari in uscita","Owning account":"Account proprietario","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"Pagina {{pageNumber}} di tutte le pagine",path:dzt,Path:pzt,"path from templates":"percorso dai modelli","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"Il percorso è la parte relativa al carico di lavoro di un nome di identità. Viene compilato in fase di runtime in base ai fatti dimostrati da un carico di lavoro.","Path pattern":"Modello di percorso","Path prefix":"Prefisso del percorso","Path segment {{index}}":"Segmento di percorso {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"Oggetto prelevato nella posizione {{position}} di {{total}}","Policy details":"Dettagli della policy","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"Policy: definisci in che modo un carico di lavoro attesta l’ottenimento dell’identità",Preferences:mzt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Usa Spazio o Invio per attivare il trascinamento, quindi usa i tasti freccia per spostarti e Spazio o Invio per confermare",Preview:hzt,"Previous CA":"CA precedente","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"Certificati precedenti ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"Mese precedente","Previous page":"Pagina precedente",Properties:gzt,Property:vzt,Provided:fzt,Provider:yzt,"Provider name":"Nome del provider","Provider not found":"Provider non trovato","Provider overview":"Panoramica del provider","Provider selection":"Selezione del provider","Provider settings":"Impostazioni del provider","Provider values":"Valori del provider",Providers:bzt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"Pubblicazione nel trust bundle. La firma inizia una volta che ogni regione lo possiede.","Quick create":"Creazione rapida",Ready:wzt,"Recommended for most workloads":"Consigliato per la maggior parte dei carichi di lavoro","Refresh certificate authorities":"Aggiorna le autorità di certificazione",Remove:Szt,"Remove {{name}}":"Rimuovi {{name}}","Remove condition":"Rimuovi condizione","Remove filter {{filter}}":"Rimuovi il filtro {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"Rimuovere la policy di governance?","Remove tag {{key}}":"Rimuovi tag {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"I tag rimossi non sono stati salvati","Reordering canceled":"Riordino annullato","Resize handle":"Handle di ridimensionamento","Restricted by":"Limitato da",Retry:_zt,"Review the tags and save again.":"Esamina i tag e salva di nuovo.",Save:kzt,"Save changes":"Salva le modifiche",scheme:xzt,Scheme:Ezt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"Lo schema imposta il formato utilizzato da questo provider per denominare le identità.",Scope:Czt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"L’ambito stabilisce quali account sono autorizzati a utilizzare questo provider.","Scope values":"Valori dell’ambito","Search tags":"Cerca tag","Segment that partitions identities.":"Segmento che suddivide le identità.","Select {{name}}":"Seleziona {{name}}",Set:"Imposta","Set a naming pattern":"Imposta uno schema di denominazione","Set an attestation rule":"Imposta una regola di attestazione","Set by your provider.":"Impostato dal tuo provider.","Set the name":"Imposta il nome","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"Imposta il modello di percorso univoco e le regole di attestazione utilizzate da ciascuna identità del carico di lavoro generata da questo modello.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"Configura un modo per emettere le identità dei carichi di lavoro","Set up for your use cases":"Configura in base ai tuoi casi d’uso","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"La configurazione dell’autorità di certificazione è stata interrotta. Puoi continuare dal punto in cui era stata interrotta.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"Impostazioni del tuo provider {{providerName}}","Show fewer":"Mostra meno","Show more":"Mostra altro","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"Firma di nuovi certificati e pubblicazione nel trust bundle.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"La firma riprende immediatamente, poiché questo certificato è ancora pubblicato nel trust bundle.","Signing start time":"Ora di inizio della firma","Something went wrong":"Qualcosa è andato storto",Status:Azt,"Status bar":"Barra di stato","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"Interrompi l’accesso concesso a questo nome di identità","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"Interrompi l’accesso concesso a quei nomi di identità","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"Interrompi l’assegnazione di un’identità ai carichi di lavoro corrispondenti in modo che falliscano alla richiesta successiva","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"Interrompi la risoluzione delle identità che ha generato","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"Interrompi l’esecuzione del carico di lavoro con questa identità, in modo che fallisca alla richiesta successiva","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"La firma è stata interrotta e non è più presente nel trust bundle, pertanto nulla viene verificato tramite di essi. Eliminarne uno è un’operazione sicura.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"Firma interrotta e non più presente nel trust bundle.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"La firma è stata interrotta, ma il certificato rimane presente nel trust bundle; di conseguenza, i certificati emessi in precedenza continuano a essere verificati correttamente.",Subject:Tzt,Success:Izt,"Tag keys could not be retrieved":"Impossibile recuperare le chiavi di tag","Tag values could not be retrieved":"Impossibile recuperare i valori di tag",Tags:"Tag","Tags could not be loaded":"Non è stato possibile caricare i tag","Tags not saved":"Tag non salvati",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"Modello “{{templateId}}” non trovato.","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"Modello {{templateName}} eliminato.","Template name":"Nome del modello","Template name values":"Valori dei nomi dei modelli","Template: {{name}}":"Modello: {{name}}",Templates:Dzt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"I modelli assegnano automaticamente ai carichi di lavoro corrispondenti il proprio nome di identità. Ognuno di essi utilizza il prefisso del nome di questo fornitore, oltre a un percorso e uno schema.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"L’account proprietario dell’autorità di certificazione.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"Il certificatore garantisce il carico di lavoro e deve soddisfare tutte le condizioni per ricevere un’identità da questo modello.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"L'attestatore garantisce per il carico di lavoro, che deve soddisfare ogni condizione per operare con questa identità.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"L’autorità di certificazione è ancora in fase di configurazione.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"L’ID alla fine dell’ARN dell’autorità di certificazione in AWS Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"Il nome di identità è lo schema di denominazione del provider, un prefisso di percorso e un modello di percorso.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"Il numero massimo di caratteri che è possibile utilizzare in una chiave di tag è 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"Il numero massimo di caratteri che è possibile utilizzare in un valore di tag è 256.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"I prefissi di percorso consentiti dalla tua policy","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"Le autorizzazioni definite in questa policy per <b>{{providerName}}</b> non vengono più applicate.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"È il momento più ravvicinato in cui questo certificato può iniziare a effettuare firme. Esso viene innanzitutto pubblicato nel bundle di attendibilità (trust bundle), in modo che ogni verificatore possa controllarlo prima che venga utilizzato per firmare alcunché. Le operazioni di firma possono avere inizio in un momento successivo, ma mai prima.",Theme:Lzt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"Si è verificato un errore durante il caricamento dell’editor di codice.","This account ({{accountId}})":"Questo account ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"Questa azione elimina il provider di identità del carico di lavoro {{providerName}} e tutto ciò che è configurato al suo interno.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"Questa azione elimina il provider di identità del carico di lavoro <b>{{providerName}}</b> e tutto ciò che è configurato al suo interno.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"Questa operazione non potrà essere annullata e la creazione di un provider con lo stesso nome in un secondo momento non ripristinerà nulla. Per procedere, completa i passaggi seguenti.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"Questa operazione non può essere annullata e il percorso riservato da questo modello rimane riservato. Nessun modello futuro può generare identità al suo interno.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"Questa operazione non potrà essere annullata e questo nome rimarrà riservato. Non sarà mai più emesso, quindi non potrai creare nuovamente questa identità con lo stesso nome.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"Questa autorità di certificazione funziona solo negli Stati Uniti orientali (Virginia settentrionale) us-east-1. Per utilizzarla in altre regioni, replicala nella console AWS Private CA.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"Questo certificato viene usato per la convalida, quindi eliminarlo interrompe immediatamente la verifica","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"La catena di questo certificato viene prima pubblicata nuovamente nel trust bundle e la firma riprende una volta che ogni regione la possiede.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"Esiste già una condizione con questa combinazione chiave e operatore","This management account and delegated administrators":"Questo account di gestione e gli amministratori delegati","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"Questa organizzazione ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":" Questo provider interrompe immediatamente l’emissione di X.509-SVID e i carichi di lavoro che richiedono un certificato client inizieranno a non riuscire alla richiesta successiva. Il certificato riportato di seguito rimane configurato. I certificati già emessi continuano a essere verificati per circa 12 ore e Abilita riprende la firma.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Questa operazione rimuove il certificato dal provider e ne estrae immediatamente la catena dal trust bundle. L’autorità di certificazione stessa rimane in AWS Private CA, invariata.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"Questa operazione rimuove il certificato dal provider. Poiché la sua catena è già stata rimossa dal trust bundle, non vi sono cambiamenti per i processi di verifica attualmente in corso. L’autorità di certificazione stessa rimane in AWS Private CA, invariata.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"Questo tag verrà rimosso al momento del salvataggio delle modifiche","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"Questa operazione richiede in genere alcuni minuti. Tieni aperta questa pagina fino al termine.",Today:Pzt,"Too many requests":"Troppe richieste","Trust bundle endpoint":"Endpoint trust bundle","trust domain":"dominio di attendibilità","Trust domain":"Dominio di attendibilità","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Il dominio di fiducia è la radice dell’attendibilità per lo schema di denominazione SPIFFE. È un nome logico che segue lo stile di denominazione DNS, ad esempio prod.acme.com, ma non deve necessariamente corrispondere a un record DNS reale.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Riprova. Se il problema persiste, contatta il supporto AWS.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Due account non devono poter generare lo stesso nome di identità.","Unable to load templates":"Impossibile caricare i modelli",Undo:Nzt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"Prefisso univoco per percorsi diversi",Update:Rzt,"Update certificate signer":"Aggiorna il firmatario del certificato",'Use "{{key}}"':"Usa “{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"Usa “{{value}}”","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"Usa un prefisso di percorso riconosciuto dalla tua organizzazione, ad esempio un’area aziendale o un team. Deve essere univoco in tutta l’organizzazione. Puoi scrivere una policy che stabilisca quali account possono emettere identità con questo prefisso.","Use cases":"Casi d’uso","Use one from another account":"Usane uno di un altro account",'Use: "{{text}}"':"Usa: “{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"Utilizzato come nome comune nell’oggetto dell’autorità di certificazione.",Validating:Mzt,Value:zzt,Values:Ozt,"View all":"Visualizza tutto","View all notifications":"Visualizza tutte le notifiche","View JSON":"Visualizza JSON",Visual:Fzt,Warning:Bzt,Warnings:$zt,"Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"Senza una policy, nessun altro account può creare modelli in questo provider, sebbene gli amministratori delegati possano già crearli entrambi. Aggiungi un'istruzione per ogni account, unità organizzativa o principale IAM che dovrebbe essere in grado di farlo e limita ciascuna istruzione a un prefisso di percorso.",Workload:jzt,"Workload identities":"Identità del carico di lavoro","Workload identity":"Identità del carico di lavoro","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Identità del carico di lavoro {{workloadIdentifier}} eliminata.","Workload identity providers":"Provider di identità del carico di lavoro","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Identità del carico di lavoro: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"I carichi di lavoro vengono denominati automaticamente","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione in questo account possono utilizzare le identità generate da questo modello utilizzando informazioni verificate da {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"I carichi di lavoro in esecuzione nella tua organizzazione possono utilizzare le identità generate da questo modello utilizzando informazioni verificate da {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Ai carichi di lavoro che utilizzano queste identità non verranno più rilasciate credenziali e falliranno alla richiesta successiva","Wrap lines":"Righe a capo","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Scrivi una policy per consentire a un altro account di creare modelli o per impedire a un amministratore delegato di utilizzare parte dello spazio dei nomi. Ogni istruzione specifica un’unità organizzativa, account specifici o singoli principali IAM, consente o nega e può essere limitata a un prefisso di percorso.","Yes by default":"Sì per impostazione predefinita","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"Puoi aggiungere fino a {{availableTags}} altro tag.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"Puoi aggiungere fino a {{availableTags}} altri tag.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"Tu scegli un prefisso per caso d’uso e il nome riporta invece quello. I nomi sono più brevi e il prefisso deve essere univoco all’interno dell’organizzazione.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Hai superato il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Hai superato il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"Sono presenti più chiavi di quelle che possono essere visualizzate","You have more values than can be displayed":"Sono presenti più valori di quelli che possono essere visualizzati","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"Hai raggiunto il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"Hai raggiunto il limite di {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"Sono state apportate modifiche ai tag non salvate. Uscire da questa pagina e scartarle?","You must choose a path segment":"È necessario scegliere un segmento di percorso","You must specify a condition key":"È necessario specificare una chiave di condizione","You must specify a tag key":"È necessario specificare una chiave di tag","You must specify a unique tag key.":"È necessario specificare una chiave di tag univoca.","You must specify a value":"È necessario specificare un valore","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"L’amministratore decide quali prefissi può utilizzare questo account. Questo viene verificato al momento della creazione.","YYYY/MM/DD":"GG/MM/AAAA","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},Uzt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:LMt,Active:PMt,Add:NMt,Apply:RMt,Attestation:MMt,Cancel:zMt,Clear:OMt,Close:FMt,Condition:BMt,Configured:$Mt,Confirm:jMt,Contains:WMt,Created:UMt,Delete:qMt,Description:VMt,Details:HMt,Disable:GMt,Dismiss:KMt,Edit:YMt,Editing:JMt,Enable:ZMt,Equals:QMt,Errors:XMt,Format:ezt,Inactive:tzt,Info:nzt,JWKS:azt,Key:izt,Name:rzt,None:ozt,Notifications:szt,Operator:lzt,Operators:czt,Path:pzt,Preferences:mzt,Preview:hzt,Properties:gzt,Property:vzt,Provided:fzt,Provider:yzt,Providers:bzt,Ready:wzt,Remove:Szt,Retry:_zt,Save:kzt,Scheme:Ezt,Scope:Czt,Status:Azt,Subject:Tzt,Success:Izt,Tags:"Tag",Templates:Dzt,Theme:Lzt,Today:Pzt,Undo:Nzt,Update:Rzt,Validating:Mzt,Value:zzt,Values:Ozt,Visual:Fzt,Warning:Bzt,Warnings:$zt,Workload:jzt,and:"e",default:Wzt,hours:"ore",optional:uzt,or:"o",path:dzt,scheme:xzt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),qzt="アクション",Vzt="アクティブ",Hzt="アテステーション",Gzt="キャンセル",Kzt="設定済み",Yzt="次を含む",Jzt="作成済み",Zzt="次に等しい",Qzt="フォーマット",Xzt="非アクティブ",eOt="JWKS",tOt="オプション",nOt="詳細設定",aOt="プレビュー",iOt="プロパティ",rOt="プロパティ",oOt="指定済み",sOt="プロバイダー",lOt="プロバイダー",cOt="準備完了",uOt="スキーム",dOt="スキーム",pOt="スコープ",mOt="ステータス",hOt="テンプレート",gOt="元に戻す",vOt="ビジュアル",fOt="ワークロード",yOt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}' はアカウントに存在しません","(earliest)":"(最も早い)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個のタグが追加または変更されました","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個のタグが追加または変更されました","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 件の ID","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 件の ID","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} がコピーされました","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} のコピーに失敗しました","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 件のテンプレート","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 件の一致","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 件の一致","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} 個のタグが削除されました","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} 個のタグが削除されました","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 個のタグ","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 個のタグ","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 件のテンプレート","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 件のテンプレート","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1～48 時間 (整数時間単位)。通常、発行ははるかに高速ですが、最大 24 時間かかる場合があります。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. すべてのチェックボックスをオンにして、{{providerName}} を削除するとどうなるかを確認します。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 以下に {{providerName}} と入力して、このプロバイダーを削除することを確認します。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒否 (委任管理者のみ)","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"プロバイダーは、配下のワークロード ID の発行者および信頼の境界です。単一のプロバイダーは、テンプレートが生成する ID と手動で宣言する ID の両方を保持します。","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"リソース所有者は、ワークロードがオンラインになる前に名前へのアクセス権を付与できます。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"タグとは、AWS リソースに割り当てるラベルのことです。各タグにはキーと、オプションで値が設定されます。タグを使用して、このプロバイダーの検索やフィルタリングを行ったり、AWS のコストを追跡したりできます。","A template with this name already exists.":"同じ名前のテンプレートが既に存在します。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"パートナー API、SaaS エンドポイント、または OIDC サービスにアクセスします。セットアップは不要です。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"サービスメッシュ、データベース、またはオンプレミスシステムにアクセスします。","Access denied":"アクセスが拒否されました","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"これらの ID に付与したアクセスは機能しなくなります","Account scoped":"アカウントスコープ",Actions:qzt,"Activating it":"アクティブ化",Active:Vzt,Add:"追加","Add {{label}} template":"{{label}} テンプレートを追加","Add at least 1 path segment.":"少なくとも 1 つのパスセグメントを追加してください。","Add attestation rules":"アテステーションルールを追加","Add condition":"条件を追加","Add new tag":"新しいタグを追加","Add path segment":"パスセグメントを追加","Add policy":"ポリシーを追加","Add tags":"タグを追加","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このプロバイダーにタグを追加してください。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このテンプレートにタグを追加してください。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"コスト管理とアクセスコントロールのために、このワークロード ID にタグを追加してください。","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"このワークロードタイプが証明するファクトを、名前に表示する順序で追加します。","Added or changed tags were not saved":"追加または変更されたタグは保存されませんでした","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"このプロバイダーのすべてのアウトバウンド署名者が削除されます","All properties":"すべてのプロパティ","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"このプロバイダーのすべてのテンプレートとワークロード ID は削除されます",and:"および","Any value":"任意の値",Apply:"適用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN がコピーされました","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"ランタイムに、プラットフォームはワークロードに関するこれらの事実を証明します。証明にこれらの事実が含まれているワークロードには、このテンプレートに基づく ID が発行されます。",Attestation:Hzt,"Attestation rules":"アテステーションルール","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"認証ルールは、このプロバイダーが ID を発行する前にワークロードが証明する必要がある事実です。コンピューティングプラットフォームがそれらを保証するため、ワークロードは自身のものではない ID を要求できません。","Attested by":"証明者","Auto generated identity name":"自動生成された ID 名","Automatically generate from a template":"テンプレートから自動的に生成する","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"組織内のすべてのアカウントで使用可能 ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"このアカウントで使用可能 ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWSアカウント ID","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA はこの認証機関を設定できませんでした。AWS Private CA コンソールで削除して、もう一度試してください。","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA は IAM の認証機関を作成し、その ID を返します。",Cancel:Gzt,"Cannot start with aws:":"aws で始めることはできません:","Certificate authority":"認証局","Certificate authority created":"認証局が作成されました","Certificate authority ID":"認証機関 ID","Certificate authority name":"認証機関名","Certificate deleted.":"証明書が削除されました。","Certificate signer":"証明書署名者","Certificate signer disabled.":"証明書署名者が無効になっています。","Certificate signer enabled.":"証明書署名者が有効になりました。","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"証明書署名者が更新されました。新しい証明書チェーンは、署名を引き継ぐ前に信頼バンドルに発行されます。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンはまず信頼バンドルに発行され、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"証明書署名が有効になりました。証明書チェーンは最初に信頼バンドルにパブリッシュされ、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、約 {{hours}} 時間で署名が開始されます。","Certificate verifier information":"証明書検証情報","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"このテンプレートに基づいて ID が付与されるためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を変更します。このテンプレートが既に生成した ID には影響しません。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"この ID として実行するためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を変更します。すでにセッションを保持しているワークロードは、セッションの有効期限が切れるまでそのセッションを保持します。","Check again":"再確認","Choose a condition key":"条件キーを選択する","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"名前のパスとパターンを選択します。デフォルトから開始するか、独自の設定をカスタマイズできます。","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"ワークロードの特定の名前を選択して、独自の規則にマッピングできるようにします。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"ワークロードの実行前にアクセスを許可したり、既存の命名規則と一致させたりできるように、事前に特定の名前を選択してください。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"上記のユースケースを選択して、テンプレートを追加します。","Choose from this account":"このアカウントから選択","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"証明の事実として使用する条件キーを選択します。このテンプレートがワークロードの ID を発行する前に、プラットフォームはそれらすべてを証明する必要があります。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"このテンプレートから ID が付与されるためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を選択してください。選択するまで、このテンプレートからは何も生成されません。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"この ID として実行するためにワークロードが証明する必要がある事実を選択してください。選択するまで、この ID に対して何も発行されません。",Clear:"クリア","Clear filters":"フィルターをクリア",Close:"閉じる","Close modal":"モーダルを閉じる","Code editor":"コードエディタ",Condition:"条件","Condition key":"条件キー","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"ワークロードのユースケースに合わせて ID テンプレートを設定します。各テンプレートは、ID を一意に発行するために使用されるパスパターンと、ID が発行される前にワークロードが証明する必要がある情報を定義します。",Configured:Kzt,Confirm:"確認",Contains:Yzt,"Continue setup":"セットアップを続行する","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} をコピー","Copy ARN":"ARN をコピー","Copy JSON":"JSON をコピー","Create a template to automate identity generation":"識別名の生成を自動化するテンプレートを作成する","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"ワークロードの実行前にアクセス権を付与する ID を作成する","Create identity":"ID を作成","Create new":"新規作成","Create provider":"プロバイダーの作成","Create template":"テンプレートを作成","Create templates":"テンプレートを作成","Create the certificate authority first.":"最初に認証機関を作成します。","Create workload identities":"ワークロードIDを作成する",Created:Jzt,"Created through":"作成元","Created time":"作成時刻","Created values":"作成された値","Creating certificate authority":"認証機関を作成中","Creating the certificate authority":"認証機関を作成中","Current CA":"現在の CA","Current provider":"現在のプロバイダー","Custom tag key":"カスタムタグキー","Custom tag value":"カスタムタグ値","Dark themes":"ダークテーマ","Default permissions without a policy":"ポリシーのないデフォルトのアクセス許可","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"この名前として実行できるワークロードを定義します。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"このテンプレートの使用を許可するワークロードを定義します。",Delete:"削除","Delete certificate?":"証明書を削除しますか?","Delete provider":"プロバイダーを削除する","Delete provider?":"プロバイダーを削除しますか?","Delete template":"テンプレートを削除","Delete template?":"テンプレートを削除しますか?","Delete workload identity?":"ワークロード ID を削除しますか?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"<b>{{templateName}}</b> を削除すると、次のようになります。","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"<b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> を削除すると、次のようになります。",Description:"説明",Details:"詳細",Disable:"無効化","Disable certificate signer?":"証明書署名者を無効にしますか?","Discovery expiration time":"検出の有効期限",Dismiss:"閉じる","Does not contain":"次を含まない","Does not equal":"次と等しくない","Drag or select to resize":"ドラッグまたは選択してサイズを変更する","Drag to reorder":"ドラッグして順序を変更する","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"各 ID 名にはリージョンとそれを生成したリソースが含まれているため、2 つのアカウントで同じ名前をレンダリングすることはできません。",Edit:"編集","Edit attestation rules":"アテステーションルールを編集","Edit filter":"フィルターを編集","Edit identity path and attestation":"ID パスとアテステーションの編集",Editing:"編集中",Enable:"有効化","Enable certificate signer":"証明書署名者を有効にする","Enable certificate signer?":"証明書署名者を有効にしますか?","End signing time":"署名終了時刻","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"12 桁の AWS アカウント ID を入力します。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"認証機関 ID を入力してください。","Enter a name":"名前を入力","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"認証機関の名前を入力します。","Enter a path prefix":"パスプレフィックスを入力する","Enter a path prefix value":"パスプレフィックス値を入力する","Enter a value":"値を入力","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"1～48 の整数を入力してください。","Enter key":"キーの入力","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"認証機関の ID を入力するか、以下から選択してください。","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"ポリシーを有効な JSON として入力します。","Enter value":"値の入力",Equals:Zzt,Error:"エラー","Error fetching the details":"詳細の取得中にエラーが発生しました",Errors:"エラー","Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"発行されたすべての証明書チェーン。このプロバイダーの X.509-SVID を受け入れる検証者は、ここからルートを取得します。","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"{{providerName}} 下のすべてのテンプレートとワークロード ID は削除され、そのアイデンティティ名は再発行されません。それらに依存するワークロードは、認証情報の発行が停止されます。","Failed to copy":"コピーできませんでした","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON をコピーできませんでした","Failed to load attestation policy.":"アテステーションポリシーのロードに失敗しました。","Failed to load templates.":"テンプレートの読み込みに失敗しました。","Filter identities":"ID をフィルタリング","Filter providers":"プロバイダーのフィルタリング","Filter templates":"テンプレートをフィルタリング","Filter themes":"テーマをフィルタリング","Find identities":"ID を検索","Find providers":"プロバイダーを検索","Find templates":"テンプレートを検索","Find theme":"テーマの検索","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"相互 TLS の場合は、認証機関をアタッチします","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"トークンベースのサービスの場合は、JWT を発行します。",Format:Qzt,"Generating its key":"キーを生成中","Get started":"使用を開始する","Give your workloads an identity":"ワークロードに ID を付与する","Govern who can create resources":"リソースを作成できるユーザーを管理する","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"このプロバイダーを参照するテンプレートを作成できるユーザーを管理する","Grant access up front":"事前にアクセス権を付与する","Greater than":"次より大きい","Greater than or equal":"次の値以上",hours:"時間","How identities are kept unique":"ID を一意に保つ方法",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"ID「{{identityId}}」が見つかりません。","Identity name":"ID 名","Identity name pattern":"ID 名パターン","Identity path and attestation":"ID パスとアテステーション","Identity selection":"ID の選択","In transition":"移行中",Inactive:Xzt,"Incoming CA":"受信 CA",Info:"情報","Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"テンプレートパスパターンのインフラストラクチャ ID (アカウント ID)","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"キーが無効です。キーには Unicode 文字、数字、空白、および _ . : / = + @ - のいずれかしか使用できません","Invalid request":"無効なリクエスト","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"値が無効です。値には Unicode 文字、数字、空白、および _ . : / = + @ - のいずれかしか使用できません","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"このプロバイダーのワークロードが AWS 外のシステムへのクライアント証明書として提示する X.509-SVID を発行します。IAM と連携した AWS Private CA 認証機関が必要です。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"クライアント証明書を検証する mTLS ピアの X.509-SVID を発行します。","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA 証明書の発行","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"署名は停止しましたが、チェーンはまだ公開されているため、ワークロードは以前に発行された認証情報の検証をこのチェーンに依存しています。今すぐ削除するとチェーンが即座に削除され、それらの認証情報が機能しなくなります。そのままにしておくと、チェーンは自動的に非アクティブになり、その後に削除しても何も変わりません。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"項目が、全 {{total}} 個中の{{initialPosition}} 番目から {{finalPosition}} 番目へ移動しました。","JSON copied":"JSON がコピーされました",JWKS:eOt,"JWKS popover":"kid によって選択されたすべてのライブ署名キー。AWS は、署名が切り替わる前に、ここで新しいキーを発行します。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"署名アルゴリズム","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"キーアルゴリズム","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"以降の現在のキー署名","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS はキーを生成して独自のスケジュールでローテーションし、署名を開始する前に新しいキーを JWKS に公開します。アルゴリズムはローテーション全体で同じままであるため、JWKS を読み取る検証者はユーザー側で変更する必要はありません。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"署名済みトークンを検証するシステムの JWT-SVID に署名します。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 検出","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"標準の検出ドキュメント。ほとんどの検証者はこの URL からキーを検索するため、必要な URL はこれだけです。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 発行者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"ここで署名されたすべての JWT-SVID の iss クレーム。発行者をピン留めする検証者は、この値をピン留めします。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"トークン検証情報","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS が提供するデフォルト","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 署名者",Key:"キー","Last updated time":"最終更新日時","Learn more":"詳細はこちら","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"プロバイダーの削除の詳細 (新しいタブで開く)","Less than":"次より小さい","Less than or equal":"次の値以下","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"組織内の他のアカウントまたはプリンシパルが、選択したパスプレフィックス内で、このプロバイダーの下にテンプレートと ID を作成できるようにします。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"ワークロードが AWS 以外のリソースに到達できるようにする","Light themes":"ライトテーマ","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}、列 {{column}}\n        ","Loading certificate authorities":"認証機関をロード中","Loading code editor":"コードエディタのロード中","Loading tag keys":"タグキーをロード中","Loading tag values":"タグ値をロード中","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"このリソースに関連付けられているタグを読み込んでいます","Loading workload identities":"ワークロード ID のロード中","Manage tags":"タグの管理","Manage the provider":"プロバイダーを管理する","Manual creation":"手動作成","Manually create":"手動作成","Manually created identities":"手動で作成した ID","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"一致するワークロードは、規模にかかわらず起動時に独自の識別名を取得します。","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"メンバーアカウントは、このプロバイダーで何も作成または使用できなくなります","Minimum signing delay":"最小署名遅延","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"署名を別の認証機関に移動します。そのチェーンは最初に信頼バンドルに発行され、現在の証明書は引き継がれるまで署名を続けます。","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"{{currentPosition}}/{{total}} の位置に項目を移動しています",Name:"名前","Name must be 256 characters or less.":"名前は 256 文字以下である必要があります。","Name pattern":"命名パターン","Name pattern values":"名前パターンの値","Name values":"名前の値","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"ワークロードの開始時に ID に自動的に名前を付けるため、ID を 1 つずつ作成または管理する必要はありません。","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"このプロバイダーの下で手動で作成する名前。リソース所有者は、ワークロードを実行する前に名前へのアクセス権を付与できます。","naming prefix":"命名プレフィックス","Naming scheme":"命名スキーム","Next month":"来月","Next page":"次のページ","Next step":"次のステップ","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"アテステーションポリシーが設定されていません。ワークロードがこの ID として実行できるように定義してください。","No by default, but can add a policy":"デフォルトではいいえ。ただし、ポリシーを追加できます。","No certificate authorities in this account":"このアカウントには認証機関がありません","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"条件がありません。少なくとも 1 つ追加するまで、この ID として何も実行できません。","no domain":"ドメインなし","No match found":"一致が見つかりません","No matches":"一致なし","No tags associated with the resource.":"リソースに関連付けられたタグはありません。","No templates added yet":"テンプレートはまだ追加されていません","No workload identity providers":"ワークロード ID プロバイダーなし","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"このテンプレートに一致するワークロードがないため、ID は生成されません。","No, and cannot be granted":"いいえ、付与できません",None:"なし","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"保存されていません: {{keys}}。","Not set":"未設定",Notifications:"通知","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"組織レベルのプロバイダーを削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任管理者のみです。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"組織レベルのテンプレートを削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任された管理者のみです。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"組織レベルのワークロード ID を削除できるのは、管理アカウントまたは委任管理者のみです。","Open in AWS Private CA":"AWS Private CA で開く",Operator:"演算子",Operators:"演算子",optional:tOt,or:"または","Organization scoped":"組織スコープ","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"タグを使用してプロバイダーを整理し、コストを追跡してください。","Other accounts in your organization":"組織内の他のアカウント","Other condition keys":"その他の条件キー","Outbound signers":"アウトバウンド署名者","Outbound signers page desc":"アウトバウンド署名者は、このプロバイダーのワークロードが AWS 外のシステムに提示する認証情報に署名します。AWS 自体へのアクセスに署名者は不要です。ワークロードにはすでに SigV4 が備わっています。","Outbound signers page title":"アウトバウンド署名者","Owning account":"所有アカウント","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"全ページ中 {{pageNumber}} ページ目",path:"パス",Path:"パス","path from templates":"テンプレートからのパス","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"パスは、ID 名のワークロードごとの部分です。ワークロードが証明した事実から実行時に入力されます。","Path pattern":"パスパターン","Path prefix":"パスプレフィックス","Path segment {{index}}":"パスセグメント {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"全 {{total}} 個中の {{position}} 番目にある項目を選択しました","Policy details":"ポリシーの詳細","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"ポリシー: ワークロードが ID を取得するための証明方法を定義する",Preferences:nOt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"[Space] または [Enter] を押してドラッグをアクティブ化し、矢印キーで移動して、[Space] または [Enter] を押して確定します。",Preview:aOt,"Previous CA":"以前の CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"以前の証明書 ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"前月","Previous page":"前のページ",Properties:iOt,Property:rOt,Provided:oOt,Provider:sOt,"Provider name":"プロバイダー名","Provider not found":"プロバイダーが見つかりません","Provider overview":"プロバイダーの概要","Provider selection":"プロバイダーの選択","Provider settings":"プロバイダー設定","Provider values":"プロバイダーの値",Providers:lOt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"信頼バンドルへの発行。署名は、すべてのリージョンに発行された後に開始されます。","Quick create":"クイック作成",Ready:cOt,"Recommended for most workloads":"ほとんどのワークロードに推奨","Refresh certificate authorities":"認証機関を更新",Remove:"削除","Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} を削除","Remove condition":"条件を削除","Remove filter {{filter}}":"フィルター {{filter}} を削除","Remove governance policy?":"ガバナンスポリシーを削除しますか?","Remove tag {{key}}":"タグ {{key}} を削除","Removed tags were not saved":"削除されたタグは保存されませんでした","Reordering canceled":"並べ替えをキャンセルしました","Resize handle":"サイズ変更ハンドル","Restricted by":"制限される要因",Retry:"再試行","Review the tags and save again.":"タグを確認して、もう一度保存してください。",Save:"保存","Save changes":"変更を保存",scheme:uOt,Scheme:dOt,"Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"スキームは、このプロバイダーが ID の命名に使用する形式を設定します。",Scope:pOt,"Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"スコープは、このプロバイダーを使用できるアカウントを設定します。","Scope values":"スコープの値","Search tags":"タグを検索","Segment that partitions identities.":"ID を分割するセグメント。","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} を選択",Set:"設定","Set a naming pattern":"命名パターンを設定する","Set an attestation rule":"アテステーションルールを設定する","Set by your provider.":"プロバイダーによって設定されます。","Set the name":"名前を設定","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"このテンプレートによって生成されたすべてのワークロード ID が使用する一意のパスパターンと認証ルールを設定します。","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"ワークロード ID を発行する方法を設定する","Set up for your use cases":"ユースケース用にセットアップする","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"認証機関の設定が停止しました。中断した箇所から続行できます。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"お使いのプロバイダー {{providerName}} の設定","Show fewer":"少なく表示","Show more":"さらに表示","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"新しい証明書に署名し、信頼バンドルに公開します。","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"この証明書は信頼バンドルに公開されているため、署名はすぐに再開されます。","Signing start time":"署名開始時刻","Something went wrong":"エラーが発生しました",Status:mOt,"Status bar":"ステータスバー","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"この ID 名に付与したアクセスが機能しなくなる","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"これらの ID 名に付与したアクセスを無効にする","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"一致するワークロードが ID を取得するのを停止し、次のリクエストで失敗するようにします","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"生成した ID の解決を停止する","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"この ID として実行中のワークロードを停止し、次のリクエストで失敗させる","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"署名が停止し、信頼バンドルに含まれなくなったため、これらに対して検証されるものはありません。削除しても安全です。","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"署名が停止され、信頼バンドルに含まれなくなりました。","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"署名は停止しましたが、まだ信頼バンドルに公開されているため、以前に発行された証明書は引き続き検証されます。",Subject:"件名",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"タグキーを取得できませんでした","Tag values could not be retrieved":"タグ値を取得できませんでした",Tags:"タグ","Tags could not be loaded":"タグをロードできませんでした","Tags not saved":"タグは保存されていません",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"テンプレート 「{{templateId}}」が見つかりません。","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"テンプレート {{templateName}} が削除されました。","Template name":"テンプレート名","Template name values":"テンプレート名の値","Template: {{name}}":"テンプレート: {{name}}",Templates:hOt,"Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"テンプレートを使用すると、一致するワークロードに独自の識別名が自動的に付与されます。各ワークロードは、このプロバイダーの名前のプレフィックス、パス、およびパターンを使用します。","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"認証機関を所有するアカウント。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"認証者はワークロードを保証するものであり、このテンプレートに基づいて ID を発行するには、すべての条件に一致する必要があります。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"認証者はワークロードを保証するものであり、この ID として実行するには、すべての条件に一致する必要があります。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"認証機関はまだセットアップ中です。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA の認証機関の ARN の末尾にある ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"ID 名は、プロバイダーの命名スキーム、パスプレフィックス、およびパスパターンで構成されます。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"タグキーで使用できる最大文字数は 128 です。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"タグ値に使用できる最大文字数は 256 です。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"ポリシーが許可するパスプレフィックス","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"このポリシーで定義されている <b>{{providerName}}</b> のアクセス許可は適用されなくなります。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"この証明書が署名を開始できる最も早い時刻です。最初に信頼バンドルに発行されるため、すべての検証者がその証明書で署名される前に確認できます。署名はこの時刻以降に開始され、それより前に開始されることはありません。",Theme:"テーマ","There was an error loading the code editor.":"コードエディタの読み込み中にエラーが発生しました。","This account ({{accountId}})":"このアカウント ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"このアクションにより、ワークロード ID プロバイダー {{providerName}} とその下で設定されているすべてが削除されます。","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"このアクションにより、ワークロード ID プロバイダー <b>{{providerName}}</b> とその下で設定されているすべてが削除されます。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"この操作は元に戻すことができません。後で同じ名前のプロバイダーを作成しても、何も復元されません。続行するには、以下の手順を実行します。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"これは元に戻すことができません。このテンプレートが予約したパスは予約されたままになります。今後のテンプレートでは、このパス配下で ID を生成することはできません。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"これは元に戻すことができません。この名前は予約されたままになります。この名前は二度と発行されないため、同じ名前でこの ID を再作成することはできません。","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"この認証機関は、米国東部 (バージニア北部) us-east-1 でのみ機能します。他のリージョンで使用するには、AWS Private CA コンソールでレプリケートします。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"この証明書は検証中であるため、削除するとすぐに検証が停止します","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"この証明書のチェーンはまず信頼バンドルに再度公開され、すべてのリージョンに反映された後、署名が再開されます。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"この条件キーと演算子の組み合わせはすでに存在します。","This management account and delegated administrators":"この管理アカウントと委任管理者","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"この組織 ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"このプロバイダーはすぐに X.509-SVID の発行を停止し、クライアント証明書を必要とするワークロードは次のリクエストで失敗し始めます。以下の証明書は引き続き設定されます。すでに発行された証明書は約 12 時間検証を継続し、[有効化] により署名が再開されます。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"これにより、プロバイダーから証明書が削除され、そのチェーンが信頼バンドルから即座に削除されます。認証機関自体は AWS Private CA に残り、変更されません。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"これにより、プロバイダーから証明書が削除されます。そのチェーンはすでに信頼バンドルから削除されているため、現在検証中の内容は変更されません。認証機関自体は AWS Private CA にそのまま残ります。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"このタグは、変更を保存すると削除されます","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"これには通常数分かかります。完了するまでこのページを開いたままにしてください。",Today:"今日","Too many requests":"リクエストが多すぎます","Trust bundle endpoint":"信頼バンドルエンドポイント","trust domain":"信頼ドメイン","Trust domain":"信頼ドメイン","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信頼ドメインは、SPIFFE 命名スキームの信頼のルートです。これは、prod.acme.com などの DNS 命名スタイルに従う論理名ですが、実際の DNS レコードと一致する必要はありません。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"もう一度試してください。問題が解決しない場合は、AWS サポートにお問い合わせください。","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"2 つのアカウントで同じ ID 名をレンダリングできないようにする必要があります。","Unable to load templates":"テンプレートを読み込めません。",Undo:gOt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"異なるパスの一意のプレフィックス",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"証明書署名者の更新",'Use "{{key}}"':"「{{key}}」を使用",'Use "{{value}}"':"「{{value}}」を使用","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"ビジネスエリアやチームなど、組織が認識するパスプレフィックスを使用します。組織全体で一意である必要があります。このプレフィックスで ID を発行できるアカウントを管理するポリシーを作成できます。","Use cases":"ユースケース","Use one from another account":"別のアカウントから使用する",'Use: "{{text}}"':"{{text}} を使用","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"認証機関のサブジェクトのコモンネームとして使用されます。",Validating:"検証中",Value:"値",Values:"値","View all":"すべて表示","View all notifications":"すべての通知を表示","View JSON":"JSON を表示",Visual:vOt,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"ポリシーがない場合、このプロバイダーの下にテンプレートを作成できる他のアカウントはありませんが、委任された管理者は両方を既に作成できます。実行できるアカウント、組織単位、または IAM プリンシパルごとにステートメントを追加し、それぞれをパスプレフィックスに制限します。",Workload:fOt,"Workload identities":"ワークロード ID","Workload identity":"ワークロード ID","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"ワークロード ID {{workloadIdentifier}} が削除されました。","Workload identity providers":"ワークロード ID プロバイダー","Workload identity: {{name}}":"ワークロード ID: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"ワークロードには自動的に名前が付けられます。","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"このアカウントで実行されているワークロードは、{{workloadLabel}} によって検証された情報を使用して、このテンプレートによって生成された ID を使用できます。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"組織で実行されているワークロードは、{{workloadLabel}} によって検証された情報を使用して、このテンプレートによって生成された ID を使用できます。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"これらの ID を使用するワークロードは、認証情報の発行が停止され、次のリクエストで失敗します。","Wrap lines":"行を折り返す","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"別のアカウントがテンプレートを作成できるようにするか、委任された管理者が名前空間の一部にアクセスできないようにするポリシーを作成します。各ステートメントでは、組織単位、特定のアカウント、または個々の IAM プリンシパルを指定し、許可または拒否を設定でき、パスプレフィックスで制限することもできます。","Yes by default":"デフォルトでは「はい」","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"最大 {{availableTags}} 個のタグをさらに追加できます。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"最大 {{availableTags}} 個のタグをさらに追加できます。","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"ユースケースごとにプレフィックスを選択すると、代わりに名前にそのプレフィックスが付きます。名前は短くなり、プレフィックスは組織全体で一意である必要があります。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"タグの数が上限である {{tagLimit}} 個を超えました。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"タグの上限数である {{tagLimit}} 個を超えました。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"キーの数が表示可能な数を超えています","You have more values than can be displayed":"値の数が表示可能な数を超えています","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"タグの数が上限である {{tagLimit}} 個に達しました。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"タグの上限数である {{tagLimit}} 個に達しました。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"タグの変更が保存されていません。このページを離れて変更を破棄しますか。","You must choose a path segment":"パスセグメントを選択する必要があります","You must specify a condition key":"条件キーを指定する必要があります。","You must specify a tag key":"タグキーを指定する必要があります","You must specify a unique tag key.":"一意のタグキーを指定する必要があります。","You must specify a value":"値を指定する必要があります","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"管理者は、このアカウントで使用できるプレフィックスを決定します。これは作成時に確認されます。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and workload identities":"Deleting templates and workload identities","Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected":"Deleting the provider is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},bOt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:qzt,Active:Vzt,Add:"追加",Apply:"適用",Attestation:Hzt,Cancel:Gzt,Clear:"クリア",Close:"閉じる",Condition:"条件",Configured:Kzt,Confirm:"確認",Contains:Yzt,Created:Jzt,Delete:"削除",Description:"説明",Details:"詳細",Disable:"無効化",Dismiss:"閉じる",Edit:"編集",Editing:"編集中",Enable:"有効化",Equals:Zzt,Errors:"エラー",Format:Qzt,Inactive:Xzt,Info:"情報",JWKS:eOt,Key:"キー",Name:"名前",None:"なし",Notifications:"通知",Operator:"演算子",Operators:"演算子",Path:"パス",Preferences:nOt,Preview:aOt,Properties:iOt,Property:rOt,Provided:oOt,Provider:sOt,Providers:lOt,Ready:cOt,Remove:"削除",Retry:"再試行",Save:"保存",Scheme:dOt,Scope:pOt,Status:mOt,Subject:"件名",Success:"成功",Tags:"タグ",Templates:hOt,Theme:"テーマ",Today:"今日",Undo:gOt,Update:"更新",Validating:"検証中",Value:"値",Values:"値",Visual:vOt,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告",Workload:fOt,and:"および",default:yOt,hours:"時間",optional:tOt,or:"または",path:"パス",scheme:uOt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),wOt="세부 정보",SOt="비활성화",_Ot="편집 중",kOt="JWKS",xOt="선택 사항",EOt="기본 설정",COt="미리 보기",AOt="제공업체",TOt="실행 취소",IOt="업데이트",DOt="검증 중",LOt="워크로드",POt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"'{{providerName}}'이(가) 계정에 존재하지 않습니다.","(earliest)":"(가장 이른 시점)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}}개의 태그 추가 또는 변경됨","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}}개의 태그 추가 또는 변경됨","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}}개의 ID","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}}개의 ID","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 복사됨","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 복사 실패","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 템플릿","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}}개 항목 일치","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}}개 항목 일치","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}}개의 태그 제거됨","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}}개의 태그 제거됨","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}}개의 태그","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}}개의 태그","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}}개 템플릿","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}}개의 템플릿","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1시간~48시간(정수 단위). 게시는 대개 훨씬 빠르지만, 최대 24시간까지 걸릴 수 있습니다.","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 모든 확인란을 선택하여 {{providerName}}을 삭제하면 어떤 작업이 수행되는지 확인합니다.","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 아래에 {{providerName}}을(를) 입력하여 이 제공업체를 삭제하겠다는 의사를 확인합니다.","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"거부(위임된 관리자만 해당)","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"공급자는 그 아래에 있는 워크로드 자격 증명의 발급자이자 신뢰 경계입니다. 단일 공급자는 템플릿이 생성하는 자격 증명과 사용자가 직접 선언하는 자격 증명을 모두 보유합니다.","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"리소스 소유자는 워크로드가 온라인 상태가 되기 전에 이름에 대한 액세스 권한을 부여할 수 있습니다.","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"태그는 AWS 리소스에 할당하는 레이블입니다. 각 태그는 키와 선택적 값으로 구성됩니다. 태그를 사용하여 이 공급자를 검색 및 필터링하거나 AWS 비용을 추적하세요.","A template with this name already exists.":"이 이름의 템플릿이 이미 존재합니다.","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"파트너 API, SaaS 엔드포인트 또는 OIDC 서비스에 액세스하세요. 설정은 필요하지 않습니다.","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"서비스 메시, 데이터베이스 또는 온프레미스 시스템에 액세스하세요.","Access denied":"액세스 거부됨","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"이 ID에 부여한 액세스 권한이 작동하지 않게 됩니다.","Account scoped":"계정 범위 지정됨",Actions:"작업","Activating it":"활성화",Active:"활성",Add:"추가","Add {{label}} template":"{{label}} 템플릿 추가","Add at least 1 path segment.":"하나 이상의 경로 세그먼트를 추가하세요.","Add attestation rules":"증명 규칙 추가","Add condition":"조건 추가","Add new tag":"새 태그 추가","Add path segment":"경로 세그먼트 추가","Add policy":"개 정책 추가","Add tags":"태그 추가","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 공급자에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 템플릿에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"비용 관리 및 액세스 제어를 위해 이 워크로드 ID에 태그를 추가하세요.","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"이 워크로드 유형이 증명하는 사실을 이름에 표시할 순서대로 추가하세요.","Added or changed tags were not saved":"추가되거나 변경된 태그가 저장되지 않음","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"이 제공업체의 모든 아웃바운드 서명자가 삭제됩니다.","All properties":"모든 속성","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"이 제공업체의 모든 템플릿 및 워크로드 ID가 삭제됩니다.",and:"및","Any value":"모든 값",Apply:"적용",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 복사됨","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"런타임 시 플랫폼은 워크로드에 대한 이러한 사실을 증명합니다. 증명에 이러한 사실이 포함된 모든 워크로드에는 이 템플릿에서 생성한 ID가 발급됩니다.",Attestation:"증명","Attestation rules":"증명 규칙","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"증명 규칙은 이 제공자가 워크로드에 ID를 발급하기 전에 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실들입니다. 컴퓨팅 플랫폼이 이를 보증하므로, 워크로드는 자신의 것이 아닌 ID를 요구할 수 없습니다.","Attested by":"증명한 사람","Auto generated identity name":"자동 생성된 ID 이름","Automatically generate from a template":"템플릿에서 자동으로 생성","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"조직({{organizationId}}) 내 모든 계정에서 사용 가능","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"이 계정({{accountId}})에서 사용 가능","AWS account ID":"AWS 계정 ID","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA에서 이 인증 기관을 설정할 수 없습니다. AWS Private CA 콘솔에서 이를 삭제한 후 다시 시도하세요.","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA는 IAM용 인증 기관을 생성하고 해당 ID를 반환합니다.",Cancel:"취소","Cannot start with aws:":"aws:로 시작할 수 없음","Certificate authority":"인증 기관","Certificate authority created":"인증 기관 생성됨","Certificate authority ID":"인증 기관 ID","Certificate authority name":"인증 기관 이름","Certificate deleted.":"인증서가 삭제되었습니다.","Certificate signer":"인증서 서명자","Certificate signer disabled.":"인증서 서명자가 비활성화되었습니다.","Certificate signer enabled.":"인증서 서명자가 활성화되었습니다.","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"인증서 서명자가 업데이트되었습니다. 새로운 인증서 체인은 서명 기능을 인수하기 전에 신뢰 번들에 게시됩니다.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"인증서 서명이 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 체인은 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"인증서 서명 기능이 활성화되었습니다. 인증서 체인은 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되면 약 {{hours}}시간 후에 서명이 시작됩니다.","Certificate verifier information":"인증서 검증자 정보","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"워크로드가 이 템플릿에서 ID를 부여받기 위해 증명해야 하는 사실을 변경하세요. 이 템플릿이 이미 생성한 ID는 영향을 받지 않습니다.","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"워크로드가 이 자격 증명으로 실행되기 위해 증명해야 하는 사실을 변경합니다. 이미 세션을 보유한 워크로드는 세션이 만료될 때까지 해당 세션을 유지합니다.","Check again":"다시 확인","Choose a condition key":"조건 키 선택","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"이름의 경로와 패턴을 선택합니다. 기본값에서 시작하거나 직접 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다.","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"자체 규칙에 매핑할 수 있도록 워크로드의 특정 이름을 선택하세요.","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"워크로드가 실행되기 전에 액세스 권한을 부여하거나 기존 명명 규칙을 일치시킬 수 있도록 특정 이름을 미리 선택하세요.","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"위의 사용 사례를 선택하여 템플릿을 추가하세요.","Choose from this account":"이 계정에서 선택","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"증명 사실로 사용할 조건 키를 선택하세요. 이 템플릿이 워크로드에 대한 ID를 생성하기 전에 플랫폼은 이러한 모든 사실을 증명해야 합니다.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"이 템플릿에서 ID를 부여받기 위해 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실을 선택하세요. 그전까지는 아무것도 생성되지 않습니다.","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"이 ID로 실행되기 위해 워크로드가 증명해야 하는 사실을 선택하세요. 증명하기 전까지는 아무것도 발급할 수 없습니다.",Clear:"지우기","Clear filters":"필터 지우기",Close:"닫기","Close modal":"모달 닫기","Code editor":"Code Editor",Condition:"조건","Condition key":"조건 키","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"워크로드 사용 사례에 맞게 ID 템플릿을 구성하세요. 각 템플릿은 ID를 고유하게 발급하는 데 사용되는 경로 패턴과 ID가 발급되기 전에 워크로드에서 증명해야 하는 사실을 정의합니다.",Configured:"구성됨",Confirm:"확인",Contains:"포함","Continue setup":"계속 설정","Copy {{label}}":"{{label}} 복사","Copy ARN":"ARN 복사","Copy JSON":"JSON 복사","Create a template to automate identity generation":"ID 생성을 자동화하는 템플릿 생성","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"워크로드 실행 전에 액세스 권한을 부여하는 ID 생성","Create identity":"ID 생성","Create new":"새로 생성","Create provider":"공급자 생성","Create template":"템플릿 생성","Create templates":"템플릿 생성","Create the certificate authority first.":"먼저 인증 기관을 생성하세요.","Create workload identities":"워크로드 ID 생성",Created:"생성됨","Created through":"다음을 통해 생성","Created time":"생성 시간","Created values":"생성된 값","Creating certificate authority":"인증 기관 생성 중","Creating the certificate authority":"인증 기관 생성 중","Current CA":"현재 CA","Current provider":"현재 공급자","Custom tag key":"사용자 지정 태그 키","Custom tag value":"사용자 지정 태그 값","Dark themes":"다크 테마","Default permissions without a policy":"정책이 없는 기본 권한","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"이 이름으로 실행할 수 있는 워크로드를 정의하세요.","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"이 템플릿을 사용할 수 있는 워크로드를 정의합니다.",Delete:"삭제","Delete certificate?":"인증서를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete provider":"공급자 삭제","Delete provider?":"제공업체를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete template":"템플릿 삭제","Delete template?":"템플릿을 삭제하시겠습니까?","Delete workload identity?":"워크로드 ID를 삭제하시겠습니까?","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"<b>{{templateName}}</b>을(를) 삭제하면 다음과 같은 결과가 발생합니다.","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"<b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b>을(를) 삭제하면 다음과 같은 결과가 발생합니다.",Description:"설명",Details:wOt,Disable:SOt,"Disable certificate signer?":"인증서 서명자를 비활성화하시겠습니까?","Discovery expiration time":"탐지 만료 시간",Dismiss:"무시","Does not contain":"포함하지 않음","Does not equal":"같지 않음","Drag or select to resize":"드래그하거나 선택하여 크기 조정","Drag to reorder":"끌어서 재정렬","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"각 ID 이름에는 리전과 이를 생성한 리소스가 포함되어 있으므로, 두 계정에서 동일한 이름을 렌더링할 수 없습니다.",Edit:"편집","Edit attestation rules":"증명 규칙 편집","Edit filter":"필터 편집","Edit identity path and attestation":"ID 경로 및 증명 편집",Editing:_Ot,Enable:"활성화","Enable certificate signer":"인증서 서명자 활성화","Enable certificate signer?":"인증서 서명자를 활성화하시겠습니까?","End signing time":"서명 종료 시간","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"12자리 AWS 계정 ID를 입력하세요.","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"인증 기관 ID를 입력하세요.","Enter a name":"이름 입력","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"인증 기관 이름을 입력하세요.","Enter a path prefix":"경로 접두사 입력","Enter a path prefix value":"경로 접두사 값 입력","Enter a value":"값 입력","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"시간을 1~48 범위의 정수로 입력하세요.","Enter key":"키 입력","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"인증 기관의 ID를 입력하거나 아래에서 선택하세요","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"정책을 유효한 JSON으로 입력하세요.","Enter value":"값 입력",Equals:"같음",Error:"오류","Error fetching the details":"세부 정보를 가져오는 동안 오류 발생",Errors:"오류","Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"게시된 모든 인증서 체인입니다. 이 제공자의 X.509-SVID를 수락하는 검증자는 여기서 루트 인증서를 가져옵니다.","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"{{providerName}} 아래의 모든 템플릿과 워크로드 ID는 함께 삭제되며 해당 ID 이름은 다시 발급되지 않습니다. 이를 사용하는 워크로드는 자격 증명 발급을 중지합니다.","Failed to copy":"복사 실패","Failed to copy JSON":"JSON을 복사하지 못함","Failed to load attestation policy.":"증명 정책을 로드하지 못했습니다.","Failed to load templates.":"템플릿을 로드하지 못했습니다.","Filter identities":"ID 필터링","Filter providers":"공급자 필터링","Filter templates":"템플릿 필터링","Filter themes":"테마 필터링","Find identities":"ID 찾기","Find providers":"공급자 찾기","Find templates":"템플릿 찾기","Find theme":"테마 찾기","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"상호 TLS의 경우 인증 기관 연결","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"토큰 기반 서비스의 경우 JWT 발급",Format:"형식","Generating its key":"키 생성","Get started":"시작하기","Give your workloads an identity":"워크로드에 ID 부여","Govern who can create resources":"리소스를 생성할 수 있는 사용자 관리","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"이 공급자를 참조하는 템플릿을 생성할 수 있는 사용자 관리","Grant access up front":"사전에 액세스 권한 부여","Greater than":"보다 큼","Greater than or equal":"보다 크거나 같음",hours:"시간","How identities are kept unique":"ID를 고유하게 유지하는 방법",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':'ID "{{identityId}}"을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.',"Identity name":"ID 이름","Identity name pattern":"ID 이름 패턴","Identity path and attestation":"ID 경로 및 증명","Identity selection":"ID 선택","In transition":"전환 중",Inactive:"비활성","Incoming CA":"수신 CA",Info:"정보","Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"템플릿 경로 패턴의 인프라 ID(계정 ID)","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"잘못된 키입니다. 키에는 유니코드 문자, 숫자, 공백 및 _.:/=+@- 중 하나만 사용할 수 있습니다.","Invalid request":"잘못된 요청","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"잘못된 값입니다. 값에는 유니코드 문자, 숫자, 공백 및 다음 중 하나만 사용할 수 있습니다. _.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"이 제공자의 워크로드가 AWS 외부 시스템에 클라이언트 인증서로 제시하는 X.509-SVID를 발급합니다. IAM에 연결된 AWS Private CA 인증 기관이 필요합니다.","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"클라이언트 인증서를 검증하는 mTLS 피어를 위해 X.509-SVID를 발급합니다.","Issuing its CA certificate":"CA 인증서 발급","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"서명 기능은 중지되었지만 인증 체인은 여전히 게시된 상태이므로, 워크로드는 이전에 발급된 자격 증명을 확인하기 위해 이 체인에 의존하고 있습니다. 지금 이를 삭제하면 인증 체인이 즉시 제거되어 해당 자격 증명이 유효하지 않게 됩니다. 그대로 두면 자동으로 비활성화되며, 그 후 삭제하더라도 아무런 변화가 없습니다.","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"항목이 {{initialPosition}} 위치에서 {{finalPosition}}/{{total}} 위치로 이동했습니다.","JSON copied":"JSON 복사됨",JWKS:kOt,"JWKS popover":"kid에서 선택한 모든 라이브 서명 키입니다. AWS는 서명이 전환되기 전에 여기에 새 키를 게시합니다.","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"서명 알고리즘","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"키 알고리즘","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"다음 이후 현재 키 서명:","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS는 자체 일정에 따라 키를 생성하고 교체하며, 서명을 시작하기 전에 각 새 키를 JWKS에 게시합니다. 알고리즘은 교체 후에도 동일하게 유지되므로 JWKS를 읽는 검증기는 사용자 측에서 변경할 필요가 없습니다.","JWT Outbound signers desc":"서명된 토큰을 확인하는 시스템의 경우 JWT-SVID에 서명합니다.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 검색","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"표준 검색 문서입니다. 대부분의 검증기는 이 URL에서 키를 찾기 때문에 이 URL만 있으면 됩니다.","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 발급자","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"여기에서 서명된 모든 JWT-SVID의 iss 클레임입니다. 발급자를 고정하는 검증기가 이 값을 고정합니다.","JWT Outbound signers section title":"토큰 검증기 정보","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS에서 제공하는 기본값","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 서명자",Key:"키","Last updated time":"마지막 업데이트 시간","Learn more":"자세히 알아보기","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"공급자 삭제 자세히 알아보기(새 탭에서 열림)","Less than":"보다 작음","Less than or equal":"보다 작거나 같음","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"조직의 다른 계정 또는 위탁자가 선택한 경로 접두사 내에서 이 공급자로 템플릿과 ID를 생성하게 합니다.","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"워크로드가 비AWS 리소스에 도달하도록 허용","Light themes":"라이트 테마","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"행 {{row}}, 열 {{column}}        ","Loading certificate authorities":"인증 기관 로드 중","Loading code editor":"Code Editor 로드 중","Loading tag keys":"태그 키 로드 중","Loading tag values":"태그 값 로드 중","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"이 리소스와 연결된 태그 로드 중","Loading workload identities":"워크로드 ID 로드 중","Manage tags":"태그 관리","Manage the provider":"공급자 관리","Manual creation":"수동으로 생성","Manually create":"수동으로 생성","Manually created identities":"수동으로 생성된 ID","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"일치하는 워크로드는 규모에 상관없이 시작되는 즉시 자체 ID 이름을 가져옵니다.","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"멤버 계정은 더 이상 이 제공업체에서 어떤 항목도 생성하거나 사용할 수 없습니다.","Minimum signing delay":"최소 서명 지연 시간","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"서명 기능을 다른 인증 기관으로 이전합니다. 해당 인증 기관의 체인이 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되며, 현재 인증서는 새로운 인증 기관이 기능을 인수할 때까지 계속 서명 작업을 수행합니다.","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"항목을 {{currentPosition}}/{{total}}의 위치로 이동 중",Name:"이름","Name must be 256 characters or less.":"이름은 256자 이내여야 합니다.","Name pattern":"이름 패턴","Name pattern values":"이름 패턴 값","Name values":"이름 값","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"워크로드가 시작될 때 ID의 이름을 자동으로 지정하므로 하나씩 생성하거나 관리하지 않습니다.","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"이 제공업체 아래에서 직접 생성한 이름입니다. 리소스 소유자는 워크로드 실행 전에 이름에 대한 액세스 권한을 부여할 수 있습니다.","naming prefix":"명명 접두사","Naming scheme":"이름 지정 체계","Next month":"다음 달","Next page":"다음 페이지","Next step":"다음 단계","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"증명 정책이 설정되지 않았습니다. 워크로드가 이 ID로 실행될 수 있도록 정의하세요.","No by default, but can add a policy":"아니요(기본값, 단, 정책 추가 가능)","No certificate authorities in this account":"이 계정에 인증 기관이 없습니다","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"조건이 없습니다. 1개 이상을 추가할 때까지 아무것도 이 ID로 실행할 수 없습니다.","no domain":"도메인 없음","No match found":"일치 항목을 찾을 수 없음","No matches":"일치 항목 없음","No tags associated with the resource.":"리소스와 연결된 태그가 없습니다.","No templates added yet":"아직 추가된 템플릿이 없음","No workload identity providers":"워크로드 ID 공급자 없음","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"이 템플릿과 일치하는 워크로드가 없으므로 ID를 생성하지 않습니다.","No, and cannot be granted":"아니요, 부여할 수 없음",None:"없음","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"저장되지 않음: {{keys}}.","Not set":"설정되지 않음",Notifications:"알림","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 공급자를 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 템플릿을 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"관리 계정 또는 위임된 관리자만 조직 수준 워크로드 ID를 삭제할 수 있습니다.","Open in AWS Private CA":"AWS Private CA에서 열기",Operator:"운영자",Operators:"운영자",optional:xOt,or:"또는","Organization scoped":"조직 범위 지정됨","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"공급자를 구성하고 태그를 사용하여 비용을 추적하세요.","Other accounts in your organization":"조직의 다른 계정","Other condition keys":"기타 조건 키","Outbound signers":"아웃바운드 서명자","Outbound signers page desc":"아웃바운드 서명자는 이 제공업체의 워크로드가 AWS 외부 시스템에 제시하는 자격 증명에 서명합니다. AWS 자체에 도달하는 데는 서명자가 필요하지 않습니다. 워크로드에 이미 이를 위한 SigV4가 있기 때문입니다.","Outbound signers page title":"아웃바운드 서명자","Owning account":"소유 계정","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"모든 페이지 중 {{pageNumber}} 페이지",path:"경로",Path:"경로","path from templates":"템플릿의 경로","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"경로는 ID 이름 중 워크로드별 부분을 의미합니다. 이는 런타임 시 워크로드가 증명하는 사실에 따라 채워집니다.","Path pattern":"경로 패턴","Path prefix":"경로 접두사","Path segment {{index}}":"경로 세그먼트 {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"{{total}}개 중 위치 {{position}}의 항목을 선택했습니다.","Policy details":"정책 세부 정보","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"정책: 워크로드가 ID를 얻는 방법을 정의합니다.",Preferences:EOt,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"Space 또는 Enter를 눌러 드래그를 활성화하고, 화살표 키로 이동한 후 Space 또는 Enter를 눌러 확인하세요.",Preview:COt,"Previous CA":"이전 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"이전 인증서({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"이전 달","Previous page":"이전 페이지",Properties:"속성",Property:"속성",Provided:"제공됨",Provider:"공급자","Provider name":"공급자 이름","Provider not found":"공급자를 찾을 수 없습니다.","Provider overview":"공급자 개요","Provider selection":"공급자 선택","Provider settings":"공급자 설정","Provider values":"공급자 값",Providers:AOt,"Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"신뢰 번들에 게시 중입니다. 모든 리전에 배포가 완료되면 서명이 시작됩니다.","Quick create":"빠른 생성",Ready:"준비됨","Recommended for most workloads":"대부분의 워크로드에 권장됨","Refresh certificate authorities":"인증 기관 새로고침",Remove:"제거","Remove {{name}}":"{{name}} 제거","Remove condition":"조건 제거","Remove filter {{filter}}":"{{filter}} 필터 제거","Remove governance policy?":"거버넌스 정책을 제거하시겠습니까?","Remove tag {{key}}":"태그 {{key}} 제거","Removed tags were not saved":"제거된 태그가 저장되지 않음","Reordering canceled":"재정렬 취소됨","Resize handle":"크기 조정 핸들","Restricted by":"다음에 의해 제한됨",Retry:"재시도","Review the tags and save again.":"태그를 검토하고 다시 저장하세요.",Save:"저장","Save changes":"변경 사항 저장",scheme:"스키마",Scheme:"체계","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"스키마는 이 제공자가 ID 이름을 지정하는 데 사용하는 형식을 설정합니다.",Scope:"범위","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"범위는 이 제공업체를 사용할 수 있는 계정을 지정합니다.","Scope values":"범위 값","Search tags":"태그 검색","Segment that partitions identities.":"ID를 분할하는 세그먼트입니다.","Select {{name}}":"{{name}} 선택",Set:"설정","Set a naming pattern":"이름 지정 패턴 설정","Set an attestation rule":"증명 규칙 설정","Set by your provider.":"제공업체가 설정합니다.","Set the name":"이름 설정","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"이 템플릿에서 생성된 모든 워크로드 ID가 사용하는 고유한 경로 패턴 및 증명 규칙을 설정하세요.","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"워크로드 ID를 발급하는 방법 설정","Set up for your use cases":"사용 사례에 맞게 설정","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"인증 기관 설정이 중지되었습니다. 중단된 지점부터 계속 진행할 수 있습니다.","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"{{providerName}} 제공업체의 설정","Show fewer":"간단히 표시","Show more":"더 표시","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"새 인증서에 서명 중이며, 신뢰 번들에 게시되었습니다.","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"이 인증서는 여전히 신뢰 번들에 게시되어 있으므로 서명이 즉시 재개됩니다.","Signing start time":"서명 시작 시간","Something went wrong":"문제 발생",Status:"상태","Status bar":"상태 표시줄","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"이 ID 이름에 부여한 액세스 권한의 작동 중지","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"해당 ID 이름에 부여한 액세스 권한의 작동 중지","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"일치하는 워크로드가 ID를 가져오지 못하도록 중지하여 다음 요청 시 실패하도록 함","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"이 템플릿이 생성한 ID가 확인되지 않도록 중지","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"이 ID로 실행 중인 워크로드를 중지하여 다음 요청 시 실패하도록 설정","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"서명 기능을 중지했으며 더 이상 신뢰 번들에 포함되어 있지 않으므로, 이를 기준으로 검증되는 항목이 없습니다. 삭제해도 안전합니다.","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"서명 기능이 중지되었으며 더 이상 신뢰 번들에 포함되어 있지 않습니다.","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"서명 기능이 중지되었으나, 여전히 신뢰 번들에 게시되어 있으므로 이전에 발급된 인증서는 계속 유효합니다.",Subject:"제목",Success:"성공","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"태그 키를 검색할 수 없음","Tag values could not be retrieved":"태그 값을 검색할 수 없음",Tags:"태그","Tags could not be loaded":"태그를 로드할 수 없음","Tags not saved":"태그가 저장되지 않음",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"템플릿 '{{templateId}}'을(를) 찾을 수 없습니다.","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"템플릿 {{templateName}}을(를) 삭제했습니다.","Template name":"템플릿 이름","Template name values":"템플릿 이름 값","Template: {{name}}":"템플릿: {{name}}",Templates:"템플릿","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"템플릿은 일치하는 워크로드에 자체 ID 이름을 자동으로 부여합니다. 각 템플릿은 이 제공업체의 이름 접두사와 경로 및 패턴을 사용합니다.","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"인증 기관을 소유한 계정입니다.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"증명자는 워크로드를 보증하며, 이 템플릿에서 ID를 발급받으려면 모든 조건과 일치해야 합니다.","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"증명자는 워크로드를 보증하며, 이 ID로 실행되려면 모든 조건과 일치해야 합니다.","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"인증 기관이 아직 설정 중입니다.","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA에서 인증 기관의 ARN 끝에 있는 ID입니다.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"ID 이름은 제공업체의 이름 지정 체계, 경로 접두사 및 경로 패턴으로 구성됩니다.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"태그 키에 사용할 수 있는 최대 문자 수는 128자입니다.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"태그 값에 사용할 수 있는 최대 문자 수는 256자입니다.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"정책에서 허용하는 경로 접두사","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"이 정책에 정의된 <b>{{providerName}}</b>에 대한 권한이 더 이상 적용되지 않습니다.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"이 인증서가 서명을 시작할 수 있는 가장 빠른 시점입니다. 이 인증서는 먼저 신뢰 번들에 게시되므로, 해당 인증서로 서명이 이루어지기 전에 모든 검증자가 이를 확인할 수 있습니다. 서명은 이 시점보다 늦게 시작될 수는 있지만, 결코 더 일찍 시작되지는 않습니다.",Theme:"테마","There was an error loading the code editor.":"Code Editor를 로드하는 중 오류가 발생했습니다.","This account ({{accountId}})":"이 계정({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"이 작업을 수행하면 워크로드 ID 제공업체 {{providerName}}과(와) 해당 제공업체 아래에 구성된 모든 항목이 삭제됩니다.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"이 작업은 워크로드 ID 제공업체 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 및 그 아래에 구성된 모든 항목을 삭제합니다.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"이 작업은 취소할 수 없으며 나중에 같은 이름의 제공업체를 생성해도 복원되지 않습니다. 계속하려면 아래의 단계를 완료하세요.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"이 작업은 되돌릴 수 없으며, 이 템플릿이 예약한 경로는 계속 예약된 상태로 유지됩니다. 향후 어떤 템플릿도 이 경로 아래에서 ID를 생성할 수 없습니다.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"이 작업은 되돌릴 수 없으며, 이 이름은 계속 예약된 상태로 유지됩니다. 이 이름은 다시 발급되지 않으므로, 동일한 이름으로 이 ID를 다시 생성할 수 없습니다.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"이 인증 기관은 미국 동부(버지니아 북부) us-east-1 리전에서만 작동합니다. 다른 리전에서 사용하려면 AWS Private CA 콘솔에서 이를 복제하세요.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"이 인증서는 검증 중이므로 삭제하면 검증이 즉시 중단됩니다","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"이 인증서의 체인은 먼저 신뢰 번들에 다시 게시되며, 모든 리전이 이를 확보하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"이 조건 키와 연산자 조합이 이미 존재함","This management account and delegated administrators":"이 관리 계정 및 위임된 관리자","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"이 조직({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"이 제공자는 즉시 X.509-SVID 발급을 중단하며, 클라이언트 인증서가 필요한 워크로드는 다음 요청 시부터 오류가 발생하기 시작합니다. 아래 인증서는 계속 구성된 상태로 유지됩니다. 이미 발급된 인증서는 약 12시간 동안 계속 유효하며, ‘활성화’를 선택하면 서명이 재개됩니다.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"이렇게 하면 공급자에서 인증서가 제거되고, 신뢰 번들에서 해당 인증서 체인이 즉시 제거됩니다. 인증 기관 자체는 AWS Private CA에 그대로 유지됩니다.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"이렇게 하면 공급자에서 인증서가 제거됩니다. 해당 인증서 체인은 이미 신뢰 번들에서 제외되었으므로, 현재 수행 중인 인증에는 아무런 변화가 없습니다. 인증 기관 자체는 AWS Private CA에 그대로 남아 변경되지 않습니다.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"이 태그는 변경 사항을 저장할 때 제거됩니다","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"이 작업은 보통 몇 분 정도 소요됩니다. 작업이 완료될 때까지 이 페이지를 열어 두세요.",Today:"오늘","Too many requests":"요청이 너무 많음","Trust bundle endpoint":"신뢰 번들 엔드포인트","trust domain":"신뢰 도메인","Trust domain":"신뢰 도메인","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"신뢰 도메인은 SPIFFE 명명 체계의 신뢰 루트입니다. 이는 prod.acme.com과 같이 DNS 명명 방식을 따르는 논리명이지만, 실제 DNS 레코드와 일치할 필요는 없습니다.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"다시 시도하세요. 문제가 계속되면 AWS Support에 문의하세요.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"두 계정에서 동일한 ID 이름을 렌더링할 수 없어야 합니다.","Unable to load templates":"템플릿을 로드할 수 없음",Undo:TOt,"Unique prefix for different paths":"다른 경로의 고유한 접두사",Update:IOt,"Update certificate signer":"인증서 서명자 업데이트",'Use "{{key}}"':"‘{{key}}’ 사용",'Use "{{value}}"':"‘{{value}}’ 사용","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"비즈니스 영역 또는 팀과 같이 조직에서 인식하는 경로 접두사를 사용하세요. 조직 전체에서 고유해야 합니다. 이 접두사로 ID를 발급할 수 있는 계정을 관리하는 정책을 작성할 수 있습니다.","Use cases":"사용 사례","Use one from another account":"다른 계정의 인증 기관 사용",'Use: "{{text}}"':"사용: ‘{{text}}’","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"인증 기관의 주체에 공통 이름으로 사용됩니다.",Validating:DOt,Value:"값",Values:"값","View all":"모두 보기","View all notifications":"모든 알림 보기","View JSON":"JSON 보기",Visual:"시각적",Warning:"경고",Warnings:"경고","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"정책이 없으면 위임된 관리자만 두 유형의 템플릿을 모두 생성할 수 있으며, 다른 계정은 이 제공업체 아래에 템플릿을 생성할 수 없습니다. 템플릿을 생성할 수 있어야 하는 각 계정, 조직 단위 또는 IAM 위탁자에 대한 문을 추가하고, 각 항목의 허용 범위를 경로 접두사로 제한하세요.",Workload:LOt,"Workload identities":"워크로드 ID","Workload identity":"워크로드 ID","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"워크로드 ID {{workloadIdentifier}}이(가) 삭제되었습니다.","Workload identity providers":"워크로드 ID 공급자","Workload identity: {{name}}":"워크로드 ID: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"워크로드의 이름이 자동으로 지정됨","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"이 계정에서 실행되는 워크로드는 {{workloadLabel}}에서 검증한 정보를 사용하여 이 템플릿으로 생성된 ID를 사용할 수 있습니다.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"조직 내에서 실행되는 워크로드는 {{workloadLabel}}에서 검증한 정보를 사용하여 이 템플릿으로 생성된 ID를 사용할 수 있습니다.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"이 ID를 사용하는 워크로드는 자격 증명 발급이 중지되고 다음 요청 시에 실패합니다.","Wrap lines":"줄 바꿈","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"다른 계정이 템플릿을 생성하게 하거나 위임된 관리자가 이름 공간의 일부에서 제외되도록 정책을 작성합니다. 각 명령문은 조직 단위, 특정 계정 또는 개별 IAM 위탁자의 이름을 지정하고, 허용 또는 거부하며, 경로 접두사로 제한될 수 있습니다.","Yes by default":"예(기본값)","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"태그를 최대 {{availableTags}}개 더 추가할 수 있습니다.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"태그를 최대 {{availableTags}}개 더 추가할 수 있습니다.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"사용 사례별로 접두사를 선택합니다. 그러면 이름에 대신 접두사가 포함됩니다. 이름은 더 짧으며, 접두사는 조직 전체에서 고유해야 합니다.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)를 초과했습니다.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)를 초과했습니다.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"표시할 수 있는 것보다 많은 키가 있음","You have more values than can be displayed":"표시할 수 있는 값보다 많은 값이 있음","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)에 도달했습니다.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"태그 한도({{tagLimit}}개)에 도달했습니다.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"저장되지 않은 태그 변경 사항이 있습니다. 이 페이지를 벗어나 폐기하시겠어요?","You must choose a path segment":"경로 세그먼트를 선택해야 함","You must specify a condition key":"조건 키를 지정해야 함","You must specify a tag key":"태그 키를 지정해야 함","You must specify a unique tag key.":"고유한 태그 키를 지정해야 합니다.","You must specify a value":"값을 지정해야 함","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"관리자가 이 계정에서 사용할 수 있는 접두사를 결정합니다. 생성 시 확인됩니다.","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{