r is taking longer than expected","Enter a name.":"Enter a name.","Go to the providers list":"Go to the providers list","If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.":"If anything is still attached, deleting the provider fails.","Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.":"Invalid name. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters.","Opens in a new tab":"Opens in a new tab","Provider {{providerName}} deleted.":"Provider {{providerName}} deleted.","Provider not deleted":"Provider not deleted","Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.":"Save or cancel your edits before creating templates.","Show all {{errorCount}} errors":"Show all {{errorCount}} errors","Some templates could not be loaded":"Some templates could not be loaded","Template {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Template {{name}}: {{reason}}","Template {{templateNames}} created.":"Template {{templateNames}} created.","Templates ({{total}})":"Templates ({{total}})","Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.":"Templates are being created. Wait for the request to finish.","Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.":"Templates that member accounts created under this provider are not visible here and cannot be deleted from this account. If any exist, deleting the provider fails.","Templates: {{reason}}":"Templates: {{reason}}","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.":"Up to 256 characters. Use alphanumeric and '-_' characters. Must be unique per provider.","Value must be 256 characters or less.":"Value must be 256 characters or less.",'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.':'Wildcard "*" is only allowed with the StringLike, StringNotLike, ArnLike, or ArnNotLike operators.',"Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}"},g$t=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:"操作",Active:"活动",Add:"添加",Apply:"应用",Attestation:"证明",Cancel:"取消",Clear:"清除",Close:"关闭",Condition:"条件",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含",Created:o$t,Delete:"删除",Description:"描述",Details:s$t,Disable:"禁用",Dismiss:"关闭",Edit:"编辑",Editing:l$t,Enable:"启用",Equals:"等于",Errors:"错误",Format:"格式",Inactive:"非活动",Info:"信息",JWKS:c$t,Key:"键",Name:"名称",None:"无",Notifications:"通知",Operator:"运算符",Operators:"运算符",Path:"路径",Preferences:"首选项",Preview:"预览",Properties:"属性",Property:"属性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:u$t,Providers:"提供商",Ready:d$t,Remove:"移除",Retry:"重试",Save:"保存",Scheme:"方案",Scope:"范围",Status:"状态",Subject:"主题",Success:"成功",Tags:"标签",Templates:"模板",Theme:"主题",Today:"今天",Undo:"撤销",Update:"更新",Validating:p$t,Value:"值",Values:"值",Visual:"可视化",Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告",Workload:m$t,and:"与",default:h$t,hours:"小时",optional:"可选",or:"或",path:"路径",scheme:"方案"},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),v$t="詳細資訊",f$t="正在編輯",y$t="非作用中",b$t="JWKS",w$t="偏好設定",S$t="正在驗證",_$t="視覺效果",k$t="工作負載",x$t={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"您的帳戶中不存在 '{{providerName}}'","(earliest)":"(最早)","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個標籤已新增或變更","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"{{addedCount}} 個標籤已新增或變更","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 個身分","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 個身分","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 已複製","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 複製失敗","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 個範本","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 個相符項目","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 個相符項目","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"{{removedCount}} 個標籤已移除","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"{{removedCount}} 個標籤已移除","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 個標籤","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 個標籤","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 個範本","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 個範本","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 到 48 小時，以整數小時為單位。發佈通常快得多，但最多可能需要 24 小時。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 選取所有核取方塊以確認刪除 {{providerName}} 將執行的動作。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 在下方輸入 {{providerName}}，確認您想要刪除此提供者。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒絕，且僅適用於委派管理員","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"供應商是其下工作負載身分的發行者與信任界限。單一供應商同時包含範本產生的身分，以及您手動宣告的身分。","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"資源擁有者可以在其工作負載上線之前授予名稱存取權。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"標籤是您指派給 AWS 資源的標記。每個標籤皆包含一個索引鍵和一個選用的值。使用標籤來搜尋和篩選此提供者，或追蹤 AWS 成本。","A template with this name already exists.":"此名稱的範本已存在。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"存取合作夥伴 API、SaaS 端點或 OIDC 服務。無需任何設定。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"存取服務網格、資料庫或內部部署系統。","Access denied":"存取遭拒","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"您授予這些身分的存取權將停止運作","Account scoped":"帳戶範圍",Actions:"動作","Activating it":"啟用它",Active:"作用中",Add:"新增","Add {{label}} template":"新增 {{label}} 範本","Add at least 1 path segment.":"至少新增 1 個路徑區段。","Add attestation rules":"新增證明規則","Add condition":"新增條件","Add new tag":"新增標籤","Add path segment":"新增路徑區段","Add policy":"新增政策","Add tags":"新增標籤","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此提供者以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此範本以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"將標籤新增至此工作負載身分以進行成本管理和存取控制。","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"按照名稱內的顯示順序，新增此工作負載類型可證明的屬性。","Added or changed tags were not saved":"新增或變更的標籤未儲存","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"此提供者下的所有輸出簽署者都將被刪除","All properties":"所有屬性","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"此提供者下的所有範本和工作負載身分都將刪除",and:"且","Any value":"任何值",Apply:"套用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 已複製","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"在執行時期，平台會對工作負載證明這些事實。任何其證明帶有這些事實的工作負載，都會從此範本發出身分。",Attestation:"證明","Attestation rules":"證明規則","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"證明規則是工作負載在此提供者核發身分之前必須證明的事實。運算平台會為這些事實背書，因此工作負載無法宣稱不屬於自己的身分。","Attested by":"證明來源","Auto generated identity name":"自動產生的身分名稱","Automatically generate from a template":"從範本自動產生","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"可供您組織中的每個帳戶使用 ({{organizationId}})","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"可供此帳戶使用 ({{accountId}})","AWS account ID":"AWS 帳戶 ID","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"AWS Private CA 無法設定此憑證授權機構。請在 AWS Private CA 主控台中將其刪除，然後再試一次。","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"AWS Private CA 為 IAM 建立憑證授權機構並傳回其 ID。",Cancel:"取消","Cannot start with aws:":"開頭不能為 aws:","Certificate authority":"憑證授權機構","Certificate authority created":"憑證授權機構已建立","Certificate authority ID":"憑證認證機構 ID","Certificate authority name":"憑證授權機構名稱","Certificate deleted.":"憑證已刪除。","Certificate signer":"憑證簽署者","Certificate signer disabled.":"憑證簽署者已停用。","Certificate signer enabled.":"憑證簽署者已啟用。","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"憑證簽署者已更新。新的憑證鏈會先發佈到信任套件，之後才接手簽署。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署。憑證鏈會先發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"已啟用憑證簽署。憑證鏈會先發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後約 {{hours}} 小時開始簽署。","Certificate verifier information":"憑證驗證者資訊","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"變更工作負載若要從此範本取得身分，所必須完成證明的事項。此範本已產生的身分不會受到影響。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"變更工作負載必須證明具備哪些事實，才能以此身分執行。已取得工作階段的工作負載會保留該工作階段，直到工作階段到期為止。","Check again":"再次檢查","Choose a condition key":"選擇條件索引鍵","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"選取名稱的路徑與模式。可使用預設值，或是自訂專屬模式。","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"為工作負載選擇特定名稱，以便將其映射至自己的命名慣例。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"預先選擇特定名稱，以便在工作負載執行之前授予其存取權或符合現有的命名慣例。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"請在上方選擇使用案例以新增範本。","Choose from this account":"從此帳戶選擇","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"選擇要用來做為證明事實的條件索引鍵。平台必須先證明所有這些事實，此範本才會為工作負載發出身分。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"選取工作負載若要從此範本取得身分，所必須完成證明的事項。完成設定前，此範本不會產生任何身分。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"選擇工作負載必須證明具備哪些事實，才能以此身分執行。在完成這項設定之前，無法為其核發任何項目。",Clear:"清除","Clear filters":"清除篩選條件",Close:"關閉","Close modal":"關閉強制回應視窗","Code editor":"程式碼編輯器",Condition:"條件","Condition key":"條件鍵","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"為您的工作負載使用案例設定身分範本。每個範本會定義用於唯一核發身分的路徑模式，以及工作負載在核發身分前必須證明的事實。",Configured:"已設定",Confirm:"確認",Contains:"包含","Continue setup":"繼續設定","Copy {{label}}":"複製 {{label}}","Copy ARN":"複製 ARN","Copy JSON":"複製 JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"建立範本以自動化身分產生","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"在工作負載執行之前建立身分以授予存取權","Create identity":"建立身分","Create new":"建立新的","Create provider":"建立提供者","Create template":"建立範本","Create templates":"建立範本","Create the certificate authority first.":"請先建立憑證授權機構。","Create workload identities":"建立工作負載身分",Created:"已建立","Created through":"建立方式","Created time":"建立時間","Created values":"已建立的值","Creating certificate authority":"正在建立憑證授權機構","Creating the certificate authority":"建立憑證授權機構","Current CA":"目前的 CA","Current provider":"目前的提供者","Custom tag key":"自訂標籤索引鍵","Custom tag value":"自訂標籤值","Dark themes":"暗色主題","Default permissions without a policy":"沒有政策時的預設許可","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"定義得到允許以此名稱執行的工作負載。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"定義哪些工作負載可使用此範本。",Delete:"刪除","Delete certificate?":"刪除憑證？","Delete provider":"刪除提供者","Delete provider?":"刪除提供者？","Delete template":"刪除範本","Delete template?":"刪除範本？","Delete workload identity?":"刪除工作負載身分？","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"刪除 <b>{{templateName}}</b> 將：","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"刪除 <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> 將：",Description:"描述",Details:v$t,Disable:"停用","Disable certificate signer?":"要停用憑證簽署者嗎？","Discovery expiration time":"探索到期時間",Dismiss:"關閉","Does not contain":"不包含","Does not equal":"不等於","Drag or select to resize":"拖曳或選取以調整大小","Drag to reorder":"拖曳以重新排序","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"每個身分名稱都會包含區域與產生它的資源，因此兩個帳戶無法產生相同的名稱。",Edit:"編輯","Edit attestation rules":"編輯證明規則","Edit filter":"編輯篩選條件","Edit identity path and attestation":"編輯身分路徑與證明",Editing:f$t,Enable:"啟用","Enable certificate signer":"啟用憑證簽署者","Enable certificate signer?":"要啟用憑證簽署者嗎？","End signing time":"結束簽署時間","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"輸入 12 位數的 AWS 帳戶 ID。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"請輸入憑證授權機構 ID。","Enter a name":"輸入名稱","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"輸入憑證授權機構的名稱。","Enter a path prefix":"輸入路徑前綴","Enter a path prefix value":"輸入路徑前綴值","Enter a value":"輸入值","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"輸入 1 到 48 的整數小時。","Enter key":"輸入索引鍵","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"輸入憑證授權機構的 ID，或從下方選擇","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"以有效的 JSON 輸入政策。","Enter value":"輸入值",Equals:"等於",Error:"錯誤","Error fetching the details":"擷取詳細資訊時發生錯誤",Errors:"錯誤","Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"每個已發佈的憑證鏈。接受此提供者 X.509-SVID 的驗證者會從這裡擷取其根。","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"{{providerName}} 下的每個範本與工作負載身分都會隨之刪除，且其身分名稱永遠不會重新發行。依賴它們的工作負載將停止獲發憑證。","Failed to copy":"複製失敗","Failed to copy JSON":"複製 JSON 失敗","Failed to load attestation policy.":"證明政策載入失敗。","Failed to load templates.":"範本載入失敗。","Filter identities":"篩選身分","Filter providers":"篩選供應商","Filter templates":"篩選範本","Filter themes":"篩選主題","Find identities":"尋找身分","Find providers":"尋找供應商","Find templates":"尋找範本","Find theme":"尋找主題","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"若要使用雙向 TLS，請連接憑證授權機構","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"對於權杖型服務，發出 JWT",Format:"格式","Generating its key":"產生其金鑰","Get started":"開始使用","Give your workloads an identity":"為您的工作負載提供身分","Govern who can create resources":"管理誰可以建立資源","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"治理誰可以建立參照此提供者的範本","Grant access up front":"預先授予存取權","Greater than":"大於","Greater than or equal":"大於或等於",hours:"小時","How identities are kept unique":"如何維持身分唯一性",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"找不到身分「{{identityId}}」。","Identity name":"身分名稱","Identity name pattern":"身分名稱模式","Identity path and attestation":"身分路徑與證明","Identity selection":"身分選取","In transition":"轉換中",Inactive:y$t,"Incoming CA":"傳入 CA",Info:"資訊","Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"範本路徑模式中的基礎設施 ID (帳戶 ID)","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"無效的索引鍵。索引鍵只能包含 Unicode 字母、數字、空格和以下任何一項：_.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"請求無效","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"無效的值。值只能包含 Unicode 字母、數字、空格和以下任何一項：_.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"簽發此供應商工作負載作為用戶端憑證呈現給 AWS 外部系統的 X.509-SVID。它需要與 IAM 關聯的 AWS Private CA 憑證授權機構。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"為驗證用戶端憑證的 mTLS 對等端簽發 X.509-SVID。","Issuing its CA certificate":"簽發其 CA 憑證","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"它已停止簽署，但其鏈仍在發布，因此工作負載依賴它來驗證先前核發的登入憑證。現在刪除它會立即提取該鏈，那些憑證將開始失敗。不予理會，它會自行變為非作用中，之後刪除它不會產生任何變化。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"項目已從位置 {{initialPosition}} 移至位置 {{finalPosition}} (共 {{total}} 個)","JSON copied":"JSON 已複製",JWKS:b$t,"JWKS popover":"各個作用中簽署金鑰由 kid 選定。AWS 在切換使用新金鑰簽署前，會先於此處發布該金鑰。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"簽署演算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"金鑰演算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"目前金鑰開始簽署時間","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"AWS 會產生金鑰，並依自身排程執行金鑰輪換；開始使用新金鑰簽署前，會先將新金鑰發布到 JWKS。金鑰輪換時演算法維持不變，因此讀取 JWKS 的驗證器無需您這端做任何調整。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"為驗證已簽署權杖的系統簽署 JWT-SVID。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 探索","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"標準探索文件。多數驗證器僅需此 URL，即可從中取得金鑰。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 發行者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"此處簽署的每一筆 JWT-SVID 的 iss 宣告。鎖定發行者的驗證器會固定使用此值。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"權杖驗證器資訊","JWT Outbound signers status":"AWS 預設提供","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 簽署者",Key:"金鑰","Last updated time":"最後更新時間","Learn more":"進一步了解","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"進一步了解如何刪除提供者 (在新分頁中開啟)","Less than":"小於","Less than or equal":"小於或等於","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"讓組織中的其他帳戶或主體在您選擇的路徑字首內，於此供應商下建立範本和身分。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"讓工作負載存取非 AWS 資源","Light themes":"亮色主題","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}，欄 {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"正在載入憑證授權機構","Loading code editor":"正在載入程式碼編輯器","Loading tag keys":"正在載入標籤索引鍵","Loading tag values":"正在載入標籤值","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"正在載入與此資源相關聯的標籤","Loading workload identities":"正在載入工作負載身分","Manage tags":"管理標籤","Manage the provider":"管理供應商","Manual creation":"手動建立","Manually create":"手動建立","Manually created identities":"手動建立的身分","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"相符的工作負載於啟動時即取得專屬身分名稱，不受規模限制。","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"成員帳戶無法再在此提供者下建立或使用任何內容","Minimum signing delay":"最小簽署延遲","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"將簽署移至另一個憑證授權機構。其鏈會先發佈到信任套件，目前的憑證會繼續簽署，直到它接手。","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"正在將項目移至第 {{currentPosition}} 個位置 (共 {{total}} 個)",Name:"名稱","Name must be 256 characters or less.":"名稱必須為 256 個字元或以下。","Name pattern":"名稱模式","Name pattern values":"名稱模式值","Name values":"名稱值","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"在工作負載啟動時自動命名身分，讓您無需逐一建立或管理它們。","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"您在此供應商下手動建立的名稱。資源擁有者可以在其工作負載執行之前授予名稱的存取權。","naming prefix":"命名字首","Naming scheme":"命名方案","Next month":"下個月","Next page":"下一頁","Next step":"下一步","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"尚未設定證明原則。請定義一項原則，讓工作負載能以此身分執行。","No by default, but can add a policy":"預設為否，但可以新增政策","No certificate authorities in this account":"此帳戶中沒有憑證授權機構","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"尚未設定條件。在新增至少一項條件前，任何項目都無法以此身分執行。","no domain":"沒有網域","No match found":"找不到相符項目","No matches":"找不到相符項目","No tags associated with the resource.":"該資源未關聯任何標籤。","No templates added yet":"尚未新增任何範本","No workload identity providers":"無工作負載身分供應商","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"沒有工作負載符合此範本，故不會產生任何身分。","No, and cannot be granted":"否，且無法授與",None:"無","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"未儲存：{{keys}}。","Not set":"未設定",Notifications:"通知","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級提供者。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級範本。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"只有管理帳戶或委派管理員可以刪除組織層級工作負載身分。","Open in AWS Private CA":"在 AWS Private CA 中開啟",Operator:"運算子",Operators:"運算子",optional:"選用",or:"或","Organization scoped":"組織範圍","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"組織供應商並使用標籤追蹤其成本。","Other accounts in your organization":"您組織中的其他帳戶","Other condition keys":"其他條件索引鍵","Outbound signers":"傳出簽署者","Outbound signers page desc":"傳出簽署者會簽署本供應商工作負載出示給 AWS 外部系統的憑證。存取 AWS 本身無須簽署者，工作負載已可使用 SigV4 完成該作業。","Outbound signers page title":"傳出簽署者","Owning account":"擁有帳戶","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"所有頁面中的第 {{pageNumber}} 頁",path:"路徑",Path:"路徑","path from templates":"來自範本的路徑","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"路徑是身分名稱中每個工作負載的部分。它會在執行階段根據工作負載證明的事實填入。","Path pattern":"路徑模式","Path prefix":"路徑前綴","Path segment {{index}}":"路徑區段 {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"已選取第 {{position}} 個位置 (共 {{total}} 個) 的項目","Policy details":"政策詳細資訊","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"政策：定義工作負載取得身分所需的證明方式",Preferences:w$t,"Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"按空白鍵或 Enter 啟用拖曳，以方向鍵移動項目，再按空白鍵或 Enter 確認放置",Preview:"預覽","Previous CA":"先前的 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"先前的憑證 ({{certificateCount}})","Previous month":"上個月","Previous page":"上一頁",Properties:"屬性",Property:"屬性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:"供應商","Provider name":"提供者名稱","Provider not found":"找不到提供者","Provider overview":"提供者概觀","Provider selection":"供應商選取項","Provider settings":"提供者設定","Provider values":"供應商值",Providers:"提供者","Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"正在發佈到信任套件。每個區域都取得後就會開始簽署。","Quick create":"快速建立",Ready:"就緒","Recommended for most workloads":"建議大多數工作負載使用","Refresh certificate authorities":"重新整理憑證授權機構",Remove:"移除","Remove {{name}}":"移除 {{name}}","Remove condition":"移除條件","Remove filter {{filter}}":"移除篩選條件 {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"移除治理政策？","Remove tag {{key}}":"移除標籤 {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"移除的標籤未儲存","Reordering canceled":"重新排序已取消","Resize handle":"調整大小控點","Restricted by":"受下列限制",Retry:"重試","Review the tags and save again.":"檢閱標籤並再次儲存。",Save:"儲存","Save changes":"儲存變更",scheme:"方案",Scheme:"方案","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"方案會設定此提供者用來命名身分的格式。",Scope:"範圍","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"範圍會設定允許使用此提供者的帳戶。","Scope values":"範圍值","Search tags":"搜尋標籤","Segment that partitions identities.":"用以劃分身分的區段。","Select {{name}}":"選取 {{name}}",Set:"集合","Set a naming pattern":"設定命名模式","Set an attestation rule":"設定證明規則","Set by your provider.":"由您的提供者設定。","Set the name":"設定名稱","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"設定此範本所產生之每個工作負載身分都會使用的唯一路徑模式與證明規則。","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"設定發出工作負載身分的方法","Set up for your use cases":"針對您的使用案例進行設定","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"設定憑證授權機構已停止。您可以從中斷處繼續。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"來自您提供者 {{providerName}} 的設定","Show fewer":"顯示更少","Show more":"顯示更多","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"正在簽署新憑證，且已發佈於信任套件中。","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"簽署會立即恢復，因為此憑證仍發佈於信任套件中。","Signing start time":"簽署開始時間","Something went wrong":"發生錯誤",Status:"狀態","Status bar":"狀態列","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"讓您授予此身分名稱的存取權限停止運作","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"讓您授予這些身分名稱的存取權限停止運作","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"停止相符的工作負載取得身分，使其在下次請求時失敗","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"停止解析其所產生的身分","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"停止以此身分執行的工作負載，使其在下次請求時失敗","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"已停止簽署且不再位於信任套件中，因此沒有任何東西會依據它們進行驗證。刪除其中一個是安全的。","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"已停止簽署且不再位於信任套件中。","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"已停止簽署，但仍發佈於信任套件組合中，因此先前簽發的憑證會繼續驗證。",Subject:"主題",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"無法擷取標籤索引鍵","Tag values could not be retrieved":"無法擷取標籤值",Tags:"標籤","Tags could not be loaded":"無法載入標籤","Tags not saved":"標籤未儲存",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':'找不到範本 "{{templateId}}"。',"Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"範本 {{templateName}} 已刪除。","Template name":"範本名稱","Template name values":"範本名稱值","Template: {{name}}":"範本：{{name}}",Templates:"範本","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"範本會自動為相符的工作負載指派專屬身分名稱。各範本皆會使用此提供者的名稱前綴，搭配路徑與模式。","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"擁有憑證授權機構的帳號。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"證明者為工作負載做背書，必須符合全部條件，才能透過此範本核發身分。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"證明者會為工作負載背書，而工作負載必須符合所有條件，才能以此身分執行。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"憑證授權機構仍在設定中。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"AWS Private CA 中憑證授權機構 ARN 結尾的 ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"身分名稱由提供者的命名方案、路徑前綴與路徑模式組成。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"可在標籤索引鍵中使用的字元數量上限為 128 個。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"可在標籤值中使用的字元數量上限為 256 個。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"您的政策允許的路徑字首","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"此政策中為 {{providerName}} 定義的許可停止適用。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此憑證最早可以開始簽署的時間。它會先發佈到信任套件，因此每個驗證者都能在其底下簽署任何內容之前檢查它。簽署可能比此時間晚開始，絕不會更早。",Theme:"主題","There was an error loading the code editor.":"載入程式碼編輯器時發生錯誤。","This account ({{accountId}})":"此帳戶 ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"此動作會刪除工作負載身分提供者 {{providerName}} 及其下設定的所有項目。","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"此動作會刪除工作負載身分提供者 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 及其下設定的所有項目。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"此動作無法復原，之後建立同名提供者也無法還原任何內容。若要繼續，請完成下列步驟。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"此動作無法復原，此範本保留的路徑將保持保留狀態。未來的任何範本都無法在其下產生身分。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"此動作無法復原，此名稱將保持保留狀態。它永遠不會再被核發，因此您無法以相同名稱重新建立此身分。","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"此憑證授權機構僅適用於美國東部 (維吉尼亞北部) us-east-1。若要在其他區域使用，請在 AWS Private CA 主控台中複寫它。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"此憑證正在驗證，因此刪除它會立即停止驗證","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"此憑證的鏈會再次先發佈到信任套件，並在每個區域都取得後恢復簽署。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"此條件索引鍵與運算子的組合已存在","This management account and delegated administrators":"此管理帳戶與委派管理員","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"此組織 ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"此提供者會立即停止簽發 X.509-SVID，需要用戶端憑證的工作負載會在下一次請求時開始失敗。下方的憑證仍保持設定。已簽發的憑證會繼續驗證約 12 小時，啟用後會恢復簽署。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"這會從提供者中移除憑證，並立即將其鏈從信任套件組合中移除。憑證授權單位本身保留在 AWS Private CA 中，維持不變。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"這會從提供者中移除憑證。其鏈已離開信任套件組合，因此目前正在驗證的任何內容都不會改變。憑證授權單位本身保留在 AWS Private CA 中，維持不變。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"此標籤會在儲存變更後移除","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"這通常需要幾分鐘。請保持此頁面開啟直到完成。",Today:"今天","Too many requests":"請求過多","Trust bundle endpoint":"信任套件端點","trust domain":"信任網域","Trust domain":"信任網域","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信任網域是 SPIFFE 命名方案的信任根。它是一個遵循 DNS 命名風格的邏輯名稱，例如 prod.acme.com，但不需要符合真實的 DNS 記錄。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"請重試。若問題持續發生，請聯絡 AWS Support。","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"兩個帳戶不得產生相同的身分名稱。","Unable to load templates":"無法載入範本",Undo:"復原","Unique prefix for different paths":"不同路徑的唯一字首",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"更新憑證簽署者",'Use "{{key}}"':'使用 "{{key}}"','Use "{{value}}"':'使用 "{{value}}"',"Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"使用您組織可辨識的路徑字首，例如業務領域或團隊。它在整個組織中必須是唯一的。您可以撰寫政策，規範哪些帳戶可在此字首下核發身分。","Use cases":"使用案例","Use one from another account":"使用另一個帳戶的項目",'Use: "{{text}}"':'使用："{{text}}"',"Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"用作憑證授權機構主體中的一般名稱。",Validating:S$t,Value:"值",Values:"值","View all":"檢視全部","View all notifications":"檢視所有通知","View JSON":"檢視 JSON",Visual:_$t,Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"如果沒有政策，其他帳戶無法在此提供者下建立範本，儘管委派管理員仍然可以建立兩者。為每個應能夠執行的帳戶、組織單位或 IAM 主體新增陳述式，並將每個限制為路徑字首。",Workload:k$t,"Workload identities":"工作負載身分","Workload identity":"工作負載身分","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"工作負載身分 {{workloadIdentifier}} 已刪除。","Workload identity providers":"工作負載身分識別提供者","Workload identity: {{name}}":"工作負載身分：{{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"工作負載會自動命名","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在此帳戶中執行的工作負載可以使用此範本根據經 {{workloadLabel}} 驗證之資訊所產生的身分。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在您組織中執行的工作負載可以使用此範本根據經 {{workloadLabel}} 驗證之資訊所產生的身分。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"使用這些身分的工作負載將停止獲得憑證，並在下次請求時失敗","Wrap lines":"換行","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"撰寫政策以讓另一個帳戶建立範本，或阻止委派管理員使用部分命名空間。每個陳述式會指名組織單位、特定帳戶或個別 IAM 主體，允許或拒絕，並可限制於路徑字首。","Yes by default":"預設為是","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"您最多可以再新增 {{availableTags}} 個標籤。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"您最多可以再新增 {{availableTags}} 個標籤。","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"您會為每個使用案例選擇一個字首，而名稱會改為包含該字首。名稱較短，且字首在整個組織中必須是唯一的。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已超過 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已超過 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"您的索引鍵個數超過可顯示的數量","You have more values than can be displayed":"您的值個數超過可顯示的數量","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已達到 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的上限。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已達到 {{tagLimit}} 個標籤的限制。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"您有未儲存的標籤變更。要離開此頁面並捨棄變更嗎？","You must choose a path segment":"您必須選擇路徑區段","You must specify a condition key":"必須指定條件索引鍵","You must specify a tag key":"您必須指定標籤索引鍵","You must specify a unique tag key.":"您必須指定唯一的標籤索引鍵。","You must specify a value":"必須指定值","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"由管理員決定此帳戶可使用哪些前綴。建立時會執行檢查。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.":"{{failedCount}} templates could not be created. Review the following errors and try again.","{{providerName}} still has these resources:":"{{providerName}} still has these resources:","{{settled}} of {{total}}":"{{settled}} of {{total}}","Add at least 1 template to continue.":"Add at least 1 template to continue.","Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}":"Certificate {{name}} (account {{accountId}}): {{reason}}","Certificates ({{total}})":"Certificates ({{total}})","Certificates: {{reason}}":"Certificates: {{reason}}","Checking what is attached to this provider":"Checking what is attached to this provider","Choose a path segment":"Choose a path segment","Complete the confirmation to delete.":"Complete the confirmation to delete.","Could not check everything attached to this provider":"Could not check everything attached to this provider","Delete provider and resources":"Delete provider and resources","Deleting certificates":"Deleting certificates","Deleting provider":"Deleting provider","Deleting templates and work