azon Private CA.","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.","The path prefixes your policy allows":"The path prefixes your policy allows","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.","The provider could not be deleted. Try again.":"The provider could not be deleted. Try again.","The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.":"The provider might still be deleted. Check the providers list later.","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.",Theme:Cjt,"There was an error loading the code editor.":"There was an error loading the code editor.","These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.":"These resources need to be deleted before deleting the provider.","This account ({{accountId}})":"This account ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.":"This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b>.","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the Amazon Private CA console.","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"This condition key and operator combination already exists","This management account and delegated administrators":"This management account and delegated administrators","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"This organization ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in Amazon Private CA, unchanged.","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in Amazon Private CA, unchanged.","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"This tag will be removed upon saving changes","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.",Today:Ajt,"Too many requests":"Too many requests","Trust bundle endpoint":"Trust bundle endpoint","trust domain":"trust domain","Trust domain":"Trust domain","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"Try again. If the problem continues, contact Amazon Web Services Support.","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name