h. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.",Workload:zjt,"Workload identities":"Workload identities","Workload identities ({{total}})":"Workload identities ({{total}})","Workload identities: {{reason}}":"Workload identities: {{reason}}","Workload identity":"Workload identity","Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}":"Workload identity {{name}}: {{reason}}","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.","Workload identity providers":"Workload identity providers","Workload identity: {{name}}":"Workload identity: {{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"Workloads get named automatically","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request","Wrap lines":"Wrap lines","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.","Yes by default":"Yes by default","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have more keys than can be displayed":"You have more keys than can be displayed","You have more values than can be displayed":"You have more values than can be displayed","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?","You must choose a path segment":"You must choose a path segment","You must specify a condition key":"You must specify a condition key","You must specify a tag key":"You must specify a tag key","You must specify a unique tag key.":"You must specify a unique tag key.","You must specify a value":"You must specify a value","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD"},Fjt=Object.freeze(Object.defineProperty({__proto__:null,ARN:"ARN",Actions:C$t,Active:A$t,Add:"Add",Apply:T$t,Attestation:I$t,Cancel:D$t,Clear:L$t,Close:P$t,Condition:N$t,Configured:R$t,Confirm:M$t,Contains:z$t,Created:O$t,Delete:F$t,Description:B$t,Details:$$t,Disable:j$t,Dismiss:W$t,Edit:U$t,Editing:q$t,Enable:V$t,Equals:H$t,Errors:G$t,Format:K$t,Inactive:J$t,Info:Z$t,JWKS:Q$t,Key:"Key",Name:X$t,None:ejt,Notifications:tjt,Operator:njt,Operators:ajt,Path:ojt,Preferences:sjt,Preview:ljt,Properties:cjt,Property:ujt,Provided:djt,Provider:pjt,Providers:mjt,Ready:hjt,Remove:gjt,Retry:vjt,Save:fjt,Scheme:bjt,Scope:wjt,Status:Sjt,Subject:_jt,Success:kjt,Tags:xjt,Templates:Ejt,Theme:Cjt,Today:Ajt,Undo:Tjt,Update:Ijt,Validating:Djt,Value:Ljt,Values:Pjt,Visual:Njt,Warning:Rjt,Warnings:Mjt,Workload:zjt,and:"and",default:Ojt,hours:Y$t,optional:ijt,or:"or",path:rjt,scheme:yjt},Symbol.toStringTag,{value:"Module"})),Bjt="创建时间",$jt="详细信息",jjt="正在编辑",Wjt="JWKS",Ujt="提供程序",qjt="准备就绪",Vjt="正在验证",Hjt="工作负载",Gjt={"'{{providerName}}' does not exist in your account":"“{{providerName}}”在您的账户中不存在","(earliest)":"（最早）","{{addedCount}} tag added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{addedCount}} tags added or changed":"已添加或更改 {{addedCount}} 个标签","{{identityCount}} identities":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{identityCount}} identity":"{{identityCount}} 个身份","{{label}} copied":"{{label}} 已复制","{{label}} failed to copy":"{{label}} 复制失败","{{label}} template":"{{label}} 模板","{{label}}:":"{{label}}:","{{matchCount}} match":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{matchCount}} matches":"{{matchCount}} 个匹配项","{{removedCount}} tag removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{removedCount}} tags removed":"已移除 {{removedCount}} 个标签","{{scope}} · {{domain}}":"{{scope}} · {{domain}}","{{tagCount}} tag":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{tagCount}} tags":"{{tagCount}} 个标签","{{templateCount}} template":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{{templateCount}} templates":"{{templateCount}} 个模板","{defined by template}":"{defined by template}","1 to 48 hours, in whole hours. Publishing is usually much faster, but can take up to 24 hours.":"1 到 48 小时，以整小时为单位。发布通常快得多，但最长可能需要 24 小时。","1. Select all the check boxes to confirm what deleting {{providerName}} will do.":"1. 选中所有复选框以确认删除 {{providerName}} 将执行的操作。","2. Confirm that you want to delete this provider by typing {{providerName}} below.":"2. 在下方输入 {{providerName}} 以确认您要删除此提供者。","A deny, and only for delegated administrators":"拒绝权限，且仅适用于委派管理员","A provider is the issuer and trust boundary for the workload identities under it. A single provider holds both the identities a template generates and the ones you declare by hand.":"提供程序是其所管理的工作负载身份的颁发者，也是这些身份的信任边界。一个提供程序可以同时包含模板生成的身份和手动声明的身份。","A resource owner can grant the name access before its workload comes online.":"资源所有者可以在其工作负载上线之前授予对该名称的访问权限。","A tag is a label you assign to an AWS resource. Each tag has a key and an optional value. Use tags to search and filter this provider, or to track your AWS costs.":"标签是您分配给 亚马逊云科技 资源的标记。每个标签由一个键和一个可选值组成。使用标签搜索和筛选此提供商，或跟踪您的 亚马逊云科技 成本。","A template with this name already exists.":"同名模板已存在。","Access a partner API, a SaaS endpoint, or an OIDC service. No setup needed.":"访问合作伙伴 API、SaaS 端点或 OIDC 服务。无需进行任何配置。","Access a service mesh, a database, or an on-premises system.":"访问服务网格、数据库或本地系统。","Access denied":"访问被拒绝","Access you granted to these identities will stop working":"您授予这些身份的访问权限将停止生效","Account scoped":"账户范围内",Actions:"操作","Activating it":"正在激活它",Active:"活动",Add:"添加","Add {{label}} template":"添加 {{label}} 模板","Add at least 1 path segment.":"添加至少 1 个路径段。","Add attestation rules":"添加证明规则","Add condition":"添加条件","Add new tag":"添加新标签","Add path segment":"添加路径段","Add policy":"添加  项策略","Add tags":"添加标签","Add tags to this provider for cost management and access control.":"请向该提供商添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this template for cost management and access control.":"请向该模板添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add tags to this workload identity for cost management and access control.":"请向该工作负载标识添加标签，用于成本管理和访问控制。","Add the facts this workload type attests, in the order they should appear in the name.":"添加此工作负载类型证明的事实，按它们应在名称中出现的顺序排列。","Added or changed tags were not saved":"添加或更改的标签未保存","All outbound signers under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有出站签名者都将被删除","All properties":"所有属性","All templates and workload identities under this provider will be deleted":"该提供者下的所有模板和工作负载身份都将被删除",and:"与","Any value":"任何值",Apply:"应用",ARN:"ARN","ARN copied":"ARN 已复制","At runtime the platform attests these facts about the workload. Any workload whose attestation carries them issues an identity from this template.":"在运行时，平台会证明有关工作负载的这些事实。任何其证明包含这些事实的工作负载，都会基于此模板签发一个身份。",Attestation:"证明","Attestation rules":"证明规则","Attestation rules are the facts a workload must prove before this provider issues it an identity. The compute platform vouches for them, so a workload can't claim an identity that isn't its own.":"证明规则是工作负载在此提供商为其颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。计算平台为这些事实提供担保，因此工作负载无法声明不属于自己的身份。","Attested by":"证明者","Auto generated identity name":"自动生成的身份名称","Automatically generate from a template":"从模板自动生成","Available to every account in your organization ({{organizationId}})":"对您组织中的每个账户可用（{{organizationId}}）","Available to this account ({{accountId}})":"对此账户可用（{{accountId}}）","AWS account ID":"亚马逊云科技 账户 ID","AWS Private CA couldn't set up this certificate authority. Delete it in the AWS Private CA console and try again.":"Amazon Private CA 无法设置此证书颁发机构。请在 Amazon Private CA 控制台中将其删除，然后重试。","AWS Private CA creates a certificate authority for IAM and returns an ID for it.":"Amazon Private CA 为 IAM 创建证书颁发机构并返回其 ID。",Cancel:"取消","Cannot start with aws:":"不能以 aws: 开头","Certificate authority":"证书颁发机构","Certificate authority created":"证书颁发机构已创建。","Certificate authority ID":"证书颁发机构 ID","Certificate authority name":"证书颁发机构名称","Certificate deleted.":"证书已删除。","Certificate signer":"证书签名者","Certificate signer disabled.":"证书签名者已禁用。","Certificate signer enabled.":"证书签名者已启用。","Certificate signer updated. The new certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle before it takes over signing.":"证书签名者已更新。新的证书链在接管签名之前会先发布到信任包。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hour, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链首先发布到信任包，然后在每个区域都拥有它后，大约 {{hours}} 小时后开始签名。","Certificate signing enabled. The certificate chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and signing starts in about {{hours}} hours, once every region has it.":"证书签名已启用。证书链先发布到信任包，签名将在每个区域都拥有该证书链后大约 {{hours}} 小时开始。","Certificate verifier information":"证书验证程序信息","Change the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Identities this template has already generated are unaffected.":"更改工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。此模板已生成的身份不受影响。","Change the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. A workload already holding a session keeps it until the session expires.":"更改工作负载必须证明其满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。已获得会话的工作负载可继续使用该会话，直至会话过期。","Check again":"重新检查","Choose a condition key":"选择条件键","Choose a path and pattern for the names. Start from a default or customize your own.":"为名称选择路径和模式。可从默认设置开始，也可自定义。","Choose a specific name for the workload so you can map it to your own conventions.":"为工作负载选择特定名称，以便将其映射到您自己的命名规范。","Choose a specific name up front so you can grant it access or match an existing naming convention before the workload runs.":"请预先指定一个名称，以便在工作负载运行之前为其授予访问权限，或使其符合现有的命名规范。","Choose a use case above to add a template.":"选择上面的使用案例来添加模板。","Choose from this account":"从此账户中选择","Choose the condition keys to use as attestation facts. The platform must attest all of them before this template issues an identity for a workload.":"选择要用作证明事实的条件键。在此模板为工作负载签发身份之前，平台必须对所有这些事实完成证明。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to be given an identity from this template. Nothing is generated from it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明的事实，才能从此模板获得身份。在您完成此操作之前，不会基于此模板生成任何内容。","Choose the facts a workload must have attested to run as this identity. Nothing can be issued for it until you do.":"选择工作负载必须通过证明满足的条件，以便以此身份运行。在完成此设置之前，无法为该工作负载签发任何内容。",Clear:"清除","Clear filters":"清除筛选条件",Close:"关闭","Close modal":"关闭强制对话框","Code editor":"代码编辑器",Condition:"条件","Condition key":"条件键","Configure identity templates for your workload use cases. Each template defines a path pattern used to issue identities uniquely and the facts a workload must prove before an identity is issued.":"为您的工作负载使用案例配置身份模板。每个模板都定义了用于唯一颁发身份的路径模式以及工作负载在颁发身份之前必须证明的事实。",Configured:"已配置",Confirm:"确认",Contains:"包含","Continue setup":"继续设置","Copy {{label}}":"复制 {{label}}","Copy ARN":"复制 ARN","Copy JSON":"复制 JSON","Create a template to automate identity generation":"创建模板以自动生成身份","Create an identity to grant access before a workload runs":"在工作负载运行之前创建身份以授予访问权限","Create identity":"创建身份","Create new":"新建","Create provider":"创建提供商","Create template":"创建模板","Create templates":"创建模板","Create the certificate authority first.":"请先创建证书颁发机构。","Create workload identities":"创建工作负载身份",Created:Bjt,"Created through":"创建方式","Created time":"创建时间","Created values":"已创建的值","Creating certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Creating the certificate authority":"正在创建证书颁发机构","Current CA":"当前 CA","Current provider":"当前提供商","Custom tag key":"自定义标签键","Custom tag value":"自定义标签值","Dark themes":"深色主题","Default permissions without a policy":"没有策略的默认权限","Define which workload is allowed to run as this name.":"定义允许以此名称运行的工作负载。","Define which workloads are allowed to use this template.":"定义允许哪些工作负载使用此模板。",Delete:"删除","Delete certificate?":"删除证书？","Delete provider":"删除提供商","Delete provider?":"删除提供者？","Delete template":"删除模板","Delete template?":"删除模板？","Delete workload identity?":"删除工作负载身份？","Deleting <b>{{templateName}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{templateName}}</b> 将：","Deleting <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> will:":"删除 <b>{{workloadIdentifier}}</b> 将：",Description:"描述",Details:$jt,Disable:"禁用","Disable certificate signer?":"禁用证书签名者？","Discovery expiration time":"发现过期时间",Dismiss:"关闭","Does not contain":"不包含","Does not equal":"不等于","Drag or select to resize":"拖动或选择以调整大小","Drag to reorder":"拖动即可重新排序","Each identity name carries the region and the resource that produced it, so two accounts cannot render the same name.":"每个身份名称都带有生成它的区域和资源，因此两个账户无法生成相同的名称。",Edit:"编辑","Edit attestation rules":"编辑证明规则","Edit filter":"编辑筛选条件","Edit identity path and attestation":"编辑身份路径和证明",Editing:jjt,Enable:"启用","Enable certificate signer":"启用证书签名者","Enable certificate signer?":"启用证书签名者？","End signing time":"签名结束时间","Enter a 12-digit AWS account ID.":"输入 12 位数的 亚马逊云科技 账户 ID。","Enter a certificate authority ID.":"输入证书颁发机构 ID。","Enter a name":"输入名称","Enter a name for the certificate authority.":"输入证书颁发机构的名称。","Enter a path prefix":"输入路径前缀","Enter a path prefix value":"输入路径前缀值","Enter a value":"输入值","Enter a whole number of hours from 1 to 48.":"输入 1 到 48 之间的整数小时数。","Enter key":"输入键","Enter the ID of a certificate authority or choose from below":"输入证书颁发机构的 ID，或从下方选择。","Enter the policy as valid JSON.":"以有效的 JSON 输入策略。","Enter value":"输入值",Equals:"等于",Error:"错误","Error fetching the details":"获取详细信息时出错",Errors:"错误","Every published certificate chain. A verifier that accepts this provider's X.509-SVIDs fetches its roots from here.":"每个已发布的证书链。接受此提供程序的 X.509-SVID 的验证程序从此处获取其根。","Every template and workload identity under {{providerName}} is deleted with it, and its identity names are never reissued. Workloads relying on them stop being issued credentials.":"{{providerName}} 下的每个模板和工作负载身份都会随之删除，且其身份名称永远不会重新发布。依赖它们的工作负载将不再获颁凭证。","Failed to copy":"未能复制","Failed to copy JSON":"无法复制 JSON","Failed to load attestation policy.":"无法加载证明策略。","Failed to load templates.":"无法加载模板。","Filter identities":"筛选身份","Filter providers":"筛选提供程序","Filter templates":"筛选模板","Filter themes":"筛选主题","Find identities":"查找身份","Find providers":"查找提供程序","Find templates":"查找模板","Find theme":"查找主题","For mutual TLS, attach a certificate authority":"对于双向 TLS，请关联一个证书颁发机构 (CA)。","For token-based services, issue a JWT":"对于基于令牌的服务，请签发 JWT。",Format:"格式","Generating its key":"正在生成其密钥","Get started":"开始使用","Give your workloads an identity":"为您的工作负载赋予身份","Govern who can create resources":"管理资源创建权限","Govern who can create templates referring to this provider":"管理谁可以创建引用该提供商的模板","Grant access up front":"预先授予访问权限","Greater than":"大于","Greater than or equal":"大于或等于",hours:"小时","How identities are kept unique":"如何保持身份的唯一性",'Identity "{{identityId}}" not found.':"未找到身份“{{identityId}}”。","Identity name":"身份名称","Identity name pattern":"身份名称模式","Identity path and attestation":"身份路径和证明","Identity selection":"身份选择","In transition":"正在转换中",Inactive:"非活动","Incoming CA":"传入 CA",Info:"信息","Infrastructure ID (account ID) in the template path pattern":"模板路径模式中的基础设施 ID（账户 ID）","Invalid key. Keys can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"键无效。键只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Invalid request":"无效请求","Invalid value. Values can only contain Unicode letters, digits, white space and any of the following: _.:/=+@-":"值无效。值只能包含 Unicode 字母、数字、空格和以下任何内容：_.:/=+@-","Issues the X.509-SVIDs this provider's workloads present as client certificates to systems outside AWS. It needs an AWS Private CA certificate authority affiliated with IAM.":"签发 X.509-SVID，此提供商的工作负载将其作为客户端证书出示给 亚马逊云科技 外部的系统。它需要一个与 IAM 关联的 Amazon Private CA 证书颁发机构。","Issues X.509-SVIDs, for mTLS peers that verify a client certificate.":"颁发 X.509-SVID，供验证客户端证书的 mTLS 对等方使用。","Issuing its CA certificate":"正在签发其 CA 证书","It has stopped signing, but its chain is still published, so workloads are relying on it to verify credentials issued earlier. Deleting it now pulls the chain at once and those credentials start failing. Leave it alone and it becomes inactive on its own, after which deleting it changes nothing.":"它已停止签名，但其链仍在发布，因此工作负载依赖它来验证先前颁发的凭证。现在删除它会立即拉取该链，那些凭证将开始失败。不理会它，它会自行变为不活跃，之后删除它不会产生任何变化。","Item moved from position {{initialPosition}} to position {{finalPosition}} of {{total}}":"项目已从第 {{initialPosition}} 个位置移动到第 {{finalPosition}} 个位置（共 {{total}} 个位置）。","JSON copied":"已复制 JSON",JWKS:Wjt,"JWKS popover":"每个有效的签名密钥都由 kid 选择。亚马逊云科技 会在签名切换到新密钥之前在此处发布新密钥。","JWT Outbound signers column Signing algorithm":"签名算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key":"密钥算法","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key issue time":"当前密钥自何时起用于签名","JWT Outbound signers column Signing key popover":"亚马逊云科技 生成密钥并按自己的计划轮换它们，在开始签名之前将每个新密钥发布到 JWKS。算法在轮换期间保持不变，因此读取 JWKS 的验证者无需在您这边做任何更改。","JWT Outbound signers desc":"为需要验证签名令牌的系统对 JWT-SVID 进行签名。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery":"OIDC 发现","JWT Outbound signers label oidc discovery popover":"标准发现文档。大多数验证者只需要此 URL 即可，因为他们可从中找到密钥。","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer":"OIDC 颁发者","JWT Outbound signers label oidc issuer popover":"此处签名的每个 JWT-SVID 的 iss 声明。固定颁发者的验证者会固定此值。","JWT Outbound signers section title":"令牌验证信息","JWT Outbound signers status":"由 亚马逊云科技 提供的默认值","JWT Outbound signers title":"JWT 签名者",Key:"键","Last updated time":"上次更新时间","Learn more":"了解更多","Learn more about deleting a provider (opens in a new tab)":"了解有关删除提供者的更多信息（在新选项卡中打开）","Less than":"小于","Less than or equal":"小于或等于","Let other accounts or principals in your organization create templates and identities under this provider, within the path prefixes you choose.":"让组织中的其他账户或主体可以在此提供商下创建模板和身份，并将其限制在您指定的路径前缀范围内。","Let workloads reach non-AWS resources":"使工作负载能够访问非 亚马逊云科技 资源","Light themes":"浅色主题","Ln {{row}}, Col {{column}}":"行 {{row}}，列 {{column}}","Loading certificate authorities":"正在加载证书颁发机构","Loading code editor":"正在加载代码编辑器","Loading tag keys":"正在加载标签键","Loading tag values":"正在加载标签值","Loading tags that are associated with this resource":"正在加载与此资源关联的标签","Loading workload identities":"正在加载工作负载身份","Manage tags":"管理标签","Manage the provider":"管理提供商","Manual creation":"手动创建","Manually create":"手动创建","Manually created identities":"手动创建的身份","Matching workloads get their own identity name the moment they start, at any scale.":"匹配的工作负载自启动时起即可获得各自的身份名称，且不受规模限制。","Member accounts can no longer create or use anything under this provider":"成员账户不能再在该提供者下创建或使用任何内容","Minimum signing delay":"最小签名延迟","Moves signing to another certificate authority. Its chain publishes to the trust bundle first, and the current certificate keeps signing until it takes over.":"将签名转移到另一个证书颁发机构。其链会先发布到信任包，并且当前证书会继续签名，直到其接管为止。","Moving item to position {{currentPosition}} of {{total}}":"正在将项目移至第 {{currentPosition}}/{{total}} 个位置",Name:"名称","Name must be 256 characters or less.":"名称不能超过 256 个字符。","Name pattern":"名称模式","Name pattern values":"名称模式值","Name values":"名称值","Names identities automatically as workloads start, so you don't create or manage them one by one.":"在工作负载启动时自动为其命名身份，无需逐一创建或管理这些身份。","Names you create by hand under this provider. A resource owner can grant access to a name before its workload runs.":"您在此提供商下手动创建的名称。资源所有者可以在工作负载运行之前授予对该名称的访问权限。","naming prefix":"命名前缀","Naming scheme":"命名方案","Next month":"下个月","Next page":"下一页","Next step":"下一步","No attestation policy set. Define one so a workload can run as this identity.":"尚未设置证明策略。请定义证明策略，以允许工作负载以此身份运行。","No by default, but can add a policy":"默认情况下为否，但可以添加策略","No certificate authorities in this account":"此账户中没有证书颁发机构","No conditions. Nothing can run as this identity until you add at least 1.":"无任何条件。在您添加至少 1 个条件之前，任何内容都无法以此身份运行。","no domain":"无域名","No match found":"未找到匹配项","No matches":"没有匹配项","No tags associated with the resource.":"没有与资源关联的标签。","No templates added yet":"尚未添加任何模板","No workload identity providers":"无工作负载身份提供程序","No workload matches this template, so it generates no identities.":"没有与此模板匹配的工作负载，因此不会生成任何身份。","No, and cannot be granted":"否，且无法授予",None:"无","Not saved: {{keys}}.":"未保存：{{keys}}。","Not set":"未设置",Notifications:"通知","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level providers.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级提供者。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level templates.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级模板。","Only the management account or a delegated administrator can delete organization-level workload identities.":"只有管理账户或委派管理员可以删除组织级工作负载身份。","Open in AWS Private CA":"在 Amazon Private CA 中打开",Operator:"运算符",Operators:"运算符",optional:"可选",or:"或","Organization scoped":"组织范围内","Organize the provider and track its cost with tags.":"通过添加标签对提供商进行分类，并跟踪相关成本。","Other accounts in your organization":"组织中的其他账户","Other condition keys":"其他条件键","Outbound signers":"出站签名者","Outbound signers page desc":"出站签名者负责签署此提供方的工作负载向 亚马逊云科技 外部系统提供的凭证。访问 亚马逊云科技 本身不需要签名者：工作负载已经为此使用了 SigV4。","Outbound signers page title":"出站签名者","Owning account":"拥有账户","Page {{pageNumber}} of all pages":"所有页面中的第 {{pageNumber}} 页",path:"路径",Path:"路径","path from templates":"从模板获取路径","Path is the per-workload part of an identity name. It is filled in at runtime from the facts a workload proves.":"路径是身份名称中每个工作负载特有的部分。它在运行时根据工作负载证明的事实填写。","Path pattern":"路径模式","Path prefix":"路径前缀","Path segment {{index}}":"路径段 {{index}}","Picked up item at position {{position}} of {{total}}":"在位置 {{position}}（共 {{total}} 个）上拾起项目","Policy details":"策略详细信息","Policy: Define how a workload attests to get the identity":"策略：定义工作负载如何通过证明来获得身份",Preferences:"首选项","Press space or enter to activate drag, use arrow keys to move, then press space or enter to confirm":"按空格键或 Enter 键激活拖动，使用箭头键移动，然后再次按空格键或 Enter 键确认",Preview:"预览","Previous CA":"上一个 CA","Previous certificates ({{certificateCount}})":"之前的证书（{{certificateCount}}）","Previous month":"上个月","Previous page":"上一页",Properties:"属性",Property:"属性",Provided:"已提供",Provider:Ujt,"Provider name":"提供商名称","Provider not found":"未找到提供商","Provider overview":"提供商概述","Provider selection":"提供程序选择","Provider settings":"提供商设置","Provider values":"提供程序值",Providers:"提供商","Publishing to the trust bundle. Signing starts once every region has it.":"正在发布到信任包。一旦每个区域都拥有它，签名就会开始。","Quick create":"快速创建",Ready:qjt,"Recommended for most workloads":"推荐用于大多数工作负载","Refresh certificate authorities":"刷新证书颁发机构",Remove:"移除","Remove {{name}}":"移除 {{name}}","Remove condition":"移除条件","Remove filter {{filter}}":"移除筛选条件 {{filter}}","Remove governance policy?":"移除治理策略？","Remove tag {{key}}":"移除标签 {{key}}","Removed tags were not saved":"已移除的标签未保存","Reordering canceled":"重新排序已取消","Resize handle":"调整手柄大小","Restricted by":"受限于",Retry:"重试","Review the tags and save again.":"请检查标签后重新保存。",Save:"保存","Save changes":"保存更改",scheme:"方案",Scheme:"方案","Scheme sets the format this provider uses to name identities.":"方案设置了此提供商用于命名身份的格式。",Scope:"范围","Scope sets which accounts are allowed to use this provider.":"范围设置允许哪些账户使用此提供商。","Scope values":"范围值","Search tags":"搜索标签","Segment that partitions identities.":"对身份进行分区的段。","Select {{name}}":"选择 {{name}}",Set:"设置","Set a naming pattern":"设置命名模式","Set an attestation rule":"设置证明规则","Set by your provider.":"由您的提供商设置。","Set the name":"设置名称","Set the unique path pattern and attestation rules that every workload identity generated by this template uses.":"设置此模板生成的每个工作负载身份使用的唯一路径模式和证明规则。","Set up a way to issue workload identities":"设置工作负载身份的签发方式","Set up for your use cases":"根据您的使用案例进行配置","Setting up the certificate authority stopped. You can continue from where it left off.":"证书颁发机构的设置已停止。您可以从上次中断的位置继续。","Settings from your provider {{providerName}}":"来自您的提供商 {{providerName}} 的设置","Show fewer":"显示更少","Show more":"显示更多","Signing new certificates, and published in the trust bundle.":"正在签署新证书，并已发布在信任包中。","Signing resumes immediately, because this certificate is still published in the trust bundle.":"签名立即恢复，因为该证书仍发布在信任包中。","Signing start time":"签名开始时间","Something went wrong":"出错了",Status:"状态","Status bar":"状态栏","Stop access you granted to this identity name from working":"让您授予此身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop access you granted to those identity names from working":"让您授予这些身份名称的访问权限停止生效","Stop matching workloads getting an identity, so they fail on their next request":"停止匹配的工作负载获得身份，使其在下次请求时失败","Stop the identities it generated from resolving":"停止解析它生成的身份","Stop the workload running as this identity, so it fails on its next request":"停止以该身份运行的工作负载，使其在下次请求时失败","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle, so nothing verifies against them. Deleting one is safe.":"已停止签名，并且不再在信任包中，因此不会针对它们进行任何验证。删除其中一个是安全的。","Stopped signing and no longer in the trust bundle.":"已停止签名，且不再包含在信任包中。","Stopped signing, but still published in the trust bundle, so certificates issued earlier keep verifying.":"已停止签名，但仍发布在信任包中，因此之前颁发的证书仍可验证。",Subject:"主题",Success:"成功","Tag keys could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签键","Tag values could not be retrieved":"无法检索标签值",Tags:"标签","Tags could not be loaded":"无法加载标签","Tags not saved":"标签未保存",'Template "{{templateId}}" not found.':"未找到模板“{{templateId}}”。","Template {{templateName}} deleted.":"模板 {{templateName}} 已删除。","Template name":"模板名称","Template name values":"模板名称值","Template: {{name}}":"模板：{{name}}",Templates:"模板","Templates give matching workloads their own identity name automatically. Each one uses this provider's name prefix, plus a path and pattern.":"模板会自动为匹配的工作负载分配各自的身份名称。每个模板均使用该提供商的名称前缀以及路径和模式。","The account that owns the certificate authority.":"拥有该证书颁发机构的账户。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to be issued an identity from this template.":"证明者为工作负载提供担保，且必须满足所有条件，才能从此模板获颁身份。","The attester vouches for the workload, and it must match every condition to run as this identity.":"证明者负责验证工作负载的真实性，工作负载必须满足所有条件，才能以此身份运行。","The certificate authority is still being set up.":"证书颁发机构仍在设置中。","The ID at the end of the certificate authority's ARN in AWS Private CA.":"Amazon Private CA 中证书颁发机构 ARN 末尾的 ID。","The identity name is the provider's naming scheme, a path prefix, and a path pattern.":"身份名称由提供商的命名方案、路径前缀和路径模式组成。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag key is 128.":"标签键中最多可以使用 128 个字符。","The maximum number of characters you can use in a tag value is 256.":"标签值中最多可以使用 256 个字符。","The path prefixes your policy allows":"您的策略允许的路径前缀","The permissions defined in this policy for <b>{{providerName}}</b> stop applying.":"此策略中为 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 定义的权限将停止应用。","The soonest this certificate can start signing. It publishes to the trust bundle first, so every verifier can check it before anything is signed under it. Signing may start later than this, never sooner.":"此证书可以开始签名的最早时间。它会先发布到信任包，以便每个验证程序都能在其下签署任何内容之前进行检查。签名可能晚于该时间开始，绝不会早于该时间。",Theme:"主题","There was an error loading the code editor.":"加载代码编辑器时出错。","This account ({{accountId}})":"该账户 ({{accountId}})","This action deletes the workload identity provider {{providerName}} and everything configured under it.":"此操作将删除工作负载身份提供者 {{providerName}} 及其下配置的所有内容。","This action deletes the workload identity provider <b>{{providerName}}</b> and everything configured under it.":"此操作将删除工作负载身份提供者 <b>{{providerName}}</b> 及其下配置的所有内容。","This cannot be undone, and creating a provider with the same name later does not restore anything. To proceed, complete the steps below.":"此操作无法撤销，之后创建同名提供者也不会恢复任何内容。要继续，请完成以下步骤。","This cannot be undone, and the path this template reserved stays reserved. No future template can generate identities under it.":"此操作无法撤销，此模板预留的路径将保持预留状态。未来的任何模板都无法在其下生成身份。","This cannot be undone, and this name stays reserved. It is never issued again, so you cannot recreate this identity under the same name.":"此操作无法撤销，此名称将保持预留状态。它永远不会再被颁发，因此您无法以相同名称重新创建此身份。","This certificate authority works only in US East (N. Virginia) us-east-1. To use it in other Regions, replicate it in the AWS Private CA console.":"此证书颁发机构仅在美国东部（弗吉尼亚州北部）us-east-1 起作用。要在其他区域使用，请在 Amazon Private CA 控制台中复制它。","This certificate is validating, so deleting it stops verification immediately":"此证书正在验证，因此删除它会立即停止验证","This certificate's chain publishes to the trust bundle again first, and signing resumes once every region has it.":"此证书的链会先再次发布到信任包，并且一旦每个区域都拥有它，签名就会恢复。","This condition key and operator combination already exists":"此条件键和运算符组合已存在。","This management account and delegated administrators":"此管理账户和委派管理员","This organization ({{organizationId}})":"该组织 ({{organizationId}})","This provider stops issuing X.509-SVIDs straight away, and workloads that need a client certificate will start failing on their next request. The certificate below stays configured. Certificates already issued keep verifying for about 12 hours, and Enable resumes signing.":"该提供程序会立即停止颁发 X.509-SVID，需要客户端证书的工作负载将在下一次请求时开始失败。下面的证书保持配置状态。已颁发的证书会继续验证约 12 小时，启用后可恢复签名。","This removes the certificate from the provider and pulls its chain from the trust bundle immediately. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书，并立即将其链从信任捆绑包中拉取出来。证书颁发机构本身保留在 亚马逊云科技 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This removes the certificate from the provider. Its chain already left the trust bundle, so nothing that is verifying today changes. The certificate authority itself stays in AWS Private CA, unchanged.":"这会从提供者中移除证书。其链已离开信任捆绑包，因此当前正在验证的任何内容都不会改变。证书颁发机构本身保留在 亚马逊云科技 私有 CA 中，保持不变。","This tag will be removed upon saving changes":"保存更改后，此标签将移除","This usually takes a few minutes. Keep this page open until it finishes.":"这通常需要几分钟。请保持此页面打开，直至完成。",Today:"今天","Too many requests":"请求太多","Trust bundle endpoint":"信任包端点","trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain":"信任域","Trust domain is the root of trust for the SPIFFE naming scheme. It is a logical name that follows DNS naming style, for example prod.acme.com, but does not need to match a real DNS record.":"信任域是 SPIFFE 命名方案的信任根。它是一个遵循 DNS 命名风格的逻辑名称，例如 prod.acme.com，但无需与真实的 DNS 记录匹配。","Try again. If the problem continues, contact AWS Support.":"请重试。如果问题仍然存在，请联系 亚马逊云科技 Support。","Two accounts must not be able to render the same identity name.":"两个账户无法生成相同的身份名称。","Unable to load templates":"无法加载模板",Undo:"撤销","Unique prefix for different paths":"不同路径的唯一前缀",Update:"更新","Update certificate signer":"更新证书签名者",'Use "{{key}}"':"使用“{{key}}”",'Use "{{value}}"':"使用“{{value}}”","Use a path prefix your organization recognizes, such as a business area or a team. It must be unique across your organization. You can write a policy that governs which accounts may issue identities under this prefix.":"使用您的组织识别的路径前缀，例如业务领域或团队。它必须在您的组织中是唯一的。您可以编写一个策略来管理哪些账户可以在此前缀下发放身份。","Use cases":"使用案例","Use one from another account":"使用另一个账户中的一个",'Use: "{{text}}"':"使用：“{{text}}”","Used as the common name in the certificate authority's subject.":"用作证书颁发机构主题中的公用名。",Validating:Vjt,Value:"值",Values:"值","View all":"查看全部","View all notifications":"查看所有通知","View JSON":"查看 JSON",Visual:"可视化",Warning:"警告",Warnings:"警告","Without a policy, no other account can create templates under this provider, though delegated administrators can already create both. Add a statement for each account, organizational unit, or IAM principal that should be able to, and limit each one to a path prefix.":"如果没有策略，其他账户无法在此提供者下创建模板，尽管委派管理员仍然可以创建两者。为每个应能够执行的账户、组织单位或 IAM 主体添加语句，并将每个限制为路径前缀。",Workload:Hjt,"Workload identities":"工作负载身份","Workload identity":"工作负载身份","Workload identity {{workloadIdentifier}} deleted.":"工作负载身份 {{workloadIdentifier}} 已删除。","Workload identity providers":"工作负载身份提供程序","Workload identity: {{name}}":"工作负载身份：{{name}}","Workloads get named automatically":"工作负载会自动命名","Workloads running in this account can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在此账户中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads running in your organization can use identities generated by this template using information verified by {{workloadLabel}}.":"在您的组织中运行的工作负载可以使用此模板基于 {{workloadLabel}} 验证的信息生成的身份。","Workloads using these identities will stop being issued credentials, and fail on their next request":"使用这些身份的工作负载将不在获得凭证，并在下次请求时失败","Wrap lines":"换行","Write a policy to let another account create templates, or to stop a delegated administrator from part of the name space. Each statement names an organizational unit, specific accounts, or individual IAM principals, allows or denies, and can be limited to a path prefix.":"编写策略，以允许其他账户创建模板，或阻止委派管理员使用部分名称空间。每个语句指定一个组织单位、特定账户或单个 IAM 主体、允许或拒绝，并且可以限制为一个路径前缀。","Yes by default":"默认情况下为是","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tag.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You can add up to {{availableTags}} more tags.":"您最多还可以添加 {{availableTags}} 个标签。","You choose a prefix per use case, and the name carries that instead. Names are shorter, and the prefix must be unique across your organization.":"您可以为每个使用案例选择一个前缀，名称改为使用该前缀。名称较短，并且前缀在您的组织中必须是唯一的。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已超过 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have exceeded the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已超出 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have more keys than can be displayed":"您拥有的键超出可显示的数量","You have more values than can be displayed":"您拥有的值超出可显示的数量","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tag.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的限制。","You have reached the limit of {{tagLimit}} tags.":"您已达到 {{tagLimit}} 个标签的数量上限。","You have unsaved tag changes. Leave this page and discard them?":"您对标签所做的更改尚未保存。是否要离开此页面并放弃更改？","You must choose a path segment":"必须选择路径段","You must specify a condition key":"必须指定条件键","You must specify a tag key":"您必须指定标签键","You must specify a unique tag key.":"必须指定唯一的标签键。","You must specify a value":"必须指定一个值","Your administrator decides which prefixes this account can use. This is checked when you create.":"您的管理员决定此账户可以使用哪些前缀。创建时将对此进行检查。","YYYY/MM/DD":"YYYY/MM/DD","{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.":"{{createdCount}} templates created: {{templateNames}}.","{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} certificates could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} could not be deleted.","{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.":"{{failed}} of {{total}} templates and workload identities could not be deleted, so the provider was not deleted. Resolve the errors, then try again.","{{failedCount}} template could not be created. Review the following errors and try a